<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">- Melo New Testament Latin</book>
  <para style="h">Hawaaritay Ooso</para>
  <para style="toc1">Hawaaritay Ooso</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hawaaritay Ooso</para>
  <para style="toc3">Haw. O.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Hawaaritay Ooso</para>
  <para style="imt">Gelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Hawaaritay ooso maxaafay, Luqaasa Wonggilepp kaallii xaafintteez maxaafe. Yha Maxaafayis yez waanna qofay tiina Yesuusana kaalleez asitay Geeshsha Ayyanay kaalithin, ebaz odiza wonggile qaala, Yerusalaame, Yihuda biita ubbayil, Samaare, sa7a gaxapp gaxa hellodayis (1:8) wayizii heltheezako ododiza. Maxaafay, ammano Ayihude asitaypp aykkii, kunth alamel yez as ubbayis amo maaqqod hellodayis wayizii dalggeezako odiza taarike. Ya maxaafa xaafeezay, ammaniza asitay Oroome kaatetitha laalodayis ganccer tobinttiza asi baazannee ammano Ayihuditay haymaanote folo oothiza maaqqeezana erisodayis miinggii ootheeza.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hawaaritay ooso maxaafayid Yesuusa bagga odiza Wonggilay helliza aqo uba wode dalggittar dalggittar yhanigizannee woosa keeth eqqo qonccisiz hayidzii aafe aqo shaakkinttodayis danda7iza:</para>
  <para style="ili">1. Ammano Yerusalaame jammareezay Yesuusa salo kezini.</para>
  <para style="ili">2. Ammano Isreele gade ubba hello bagga.</para>
  <para style="ili">3. Oroome gujjii Meditiraane Abba yuushar yez gade ubbayid dalggeezana beeziza.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hawaaritay ooso maxaafayid aadhii benttizay Geeshsha Ayyana ooso maaqqodar, Phenxeqosxe gallas Yerusalaame yez ammanizitayil afa wolqqar wodhdheezana odiza. Yey garkkekka, maxaafay gancce qoncceez oosita ubbayil bentteezay garkk Geeshsha Ayyanay woosa keethinnee woosa keeth aqisizita kaalitheezannee minthatheeza gujjii odiza. Hawaaritay oosay gancce oosintteez oositaykka kiitay ammaniza asay de7olannee woosa keeth pettipettithayid yez wolqqay ab garkk dammazako beeziza.</para>
  <para style="iot">Hawaaritay oosay aykkeez qofita</para>
  <para style="io1">Markkatethis giigintto <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 1:1-26">1:1-26</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">Yesuusa wurssith kiitannee Geeshsha Ayyanna bagga inggeez qaala <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 1:1-14">1:1-14</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">Yihuda aqo Maataasa doorintto <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 1:15-26">1:15-26</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yerusalaame markkattithii <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 2:1-8:3">2:1—8:3</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yihuddannee Samaare markkattith <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 8:4-12:25">8:4—12:25</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Phawuloosa hawaaretith oosa <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 13:1-28:31">13:1—28:31</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">Tiina hawaaretithis yhanigo <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 13:1-14:28">13:1—14:28</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">Yerusalaame shiiqo <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 15:1-35">15:1-35</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">Nam7antho hawaaretith yhanigo <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 15:36-18:22">15:36—18:22</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">Hayidzanth hawaaretith yhanigo <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 18:23-21:16">18:23—21:16</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">Phawuloosa Yerusalaame, Qisaarannee Oroome acinttitha <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 21:17-28:31">21:17—28:31</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1-2"/>Tewofiloosa, Yesuusa fa oosa aykkeez wodepp salo yhanigeez gallas hellodayis, ootheezibazinnee tamaarsseezibaz ubba taanii ta tiina maxaafayid xaafeeza. Salo yhanigodaypp tiina E fa dooreez hawaarita Geeshsha Ayyanar azazeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:1-4">Luq. 1:1-4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 1:1-2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3"/>E fa iita waaya ekkeezaypp guye yhayiqopp denddeezana gaame markkatithar sidhe baazin qonccisii unttis fana beezeeza. Oyttam gallas unttis qonccii Xooss kaatetithibagga unttan taamarsseeza. <verse eid="ACT 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4"/>Pettii wode unttara wolla yezar unttan yhayigarkk yeegii azazeeza: «Ta yinttis odeeza, ta Aday immad geez ufayss qaala naagoyttapp attin Yeruselaamepp kezippate.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:49">Luq. 24:49</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5"/>Abis giiko, Waannisa haathar xammaqqeeza, zin xiqqa wodepp guye Geeshsha Ayyanar yi xammaqinttoda» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mat. 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:8">Mar. 1:8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:16">Luq. 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:33">Wan. 1:33</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa salo yhanigeeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6"/>Hawaaritay Yesuusana hellii eeko, «Godayyo, Isra7eelitayis ne kaatetitha mahiz woday yhayanee?» yeegii oyceeza.<verse eid="ACT 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7"/>Yesuusa unttiko, «Ta Aday fa mawuter oothiza wodannee laytha yi erodayis danda7ooya. <verse eid="ACT 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8"/>Zini Geeshsha Ayyanay yinttal afa wodhdhiz wode yi wolqqa ekkoda. Yeypp, guye Yerusalaame, Yihuda gade ubbayil, Samaarerannee biitta gaxapp gaxa hellodayis yi taas markkita maaqqoda» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:19">Mat. 28:19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:15">Mar. 16:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:47-48">Luq. 24:47-48</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9"/>Yeya geezaypp guye unttii be7adar, dhoqq dhoqq gi, salo kezin shaarakka eza u aafaypp geentheeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 16:19">Mar. 16:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:50-51">Luq. 24:50-51</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10"/>Yesuusa yhammadar unttii salo fude be7adar, booth ma7o ma77eez nam77ii asitay qopekkazin u achch baggayir eqqii, <verse eid="ACT 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11"/>«Galila asayyo, salo bi7ittar, yi abis eqqeenee? Yha yi be7adar salo qiteez Yesuusa yhannii garkk maaqqii ye7oda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yihuda aqo Maataasa doorintteeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:3-10">Mat. 27:3-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12"/>Yeypp guye, hawaaritay Dabire zayite Ambalapp Yerusalaame maaqqeeza. Dabire zayite Ambay Yerusalaamepp maala gallasa yedhith garkk haakiza. <verse eid="ACT 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13"/>Unttii Yerusalaame gelii, fooqeel afa kezeeza. Unttikka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maala gallas yedhithgarkk guusay pettii kilo metre oge guus</char></note>: Phixiroosa, Waannisa, Yayqqooba, Indiraase, Filphoosa, Toomaasa, Barttolomoosa, Maatoosa, Ilfoosa na7a Yayqqooba, Qanataza<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Qinatiza guusay Ayihuditay ammao wogasinnee fa gades micinttiza as</char></note> Simoonannee Yayqqooba na7a Yihuda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:2-4">Mat. 10:2-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:16-19">Mar. 3:16-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:14-16">Luq. 6:14-16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14"/>Yhayttitay ubbay maachchitayr, Yesuusa indat Maaramirannee Yesuusa ishitayira ubbay pettii wozinar maaqqii ubba wode miinggii woossiza.<verse eid="ACT 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15"/>Ye wode Phixiroosa xeetannee laatam maaqqiz ammaniza asay shiiqeez aqo denddii eqqii, yhay garkk yeegeeza: <verse eid="ACT 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16"/>«Ta ishuntho, Yesuusana aykkeezita kaalitheez Yihuda bagga Geeshsha Ayyanay tiina Dawute doonar odeez Xooss qaalay polinttodayis beeziza. <verse eid="ACT 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17"/>Yihuda nuur wolla yha oosa oothodayis maraxintteez asii.»<verse eid="ACT 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18"/>Zin Yihuda iita oosor denggeez miishayir gade wonggeeza. E sinor pokkin, e ulay peedhinttin; e maracay zazintteeza. <verse eid="ACT 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19"/>Yihudal afa haneezibaza Yerusalaame yez as ubbay si7eeza. Yey gishos, ye gada fa gada doonar «Akalddaama» geeza. Akelddaama guusay Suuth biitta guussii.<verse eid="ACT 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20"/>«Yeykka mazmuure maxaafayid,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">«‹E karay kallo atto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 1:20">oonkka ezayid yezippee.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">Ma e shuumatitha haray ekko› ginttinttii xaafintteeza.»<verse eid="ACT 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21"/>«Yey gishos, Goda Yesuusa nu gancce yezeez wode ubbayid nuur yezitayppe, <verse eid="ACT 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22"/>ma Xammaqiza Waannisa wodaypp aykkii Goda Yesuusa salo yhanigeez gallas hellodayis nuur yezitaypp pettii asii e denddayis nuur markka maaqqodayis beeziza» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:16">Mat. 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9">Mar. 1:9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21">Luq. 3:21</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23"/>Yey gishos, asay doorodayis Yosixoosa giz Barssabaasa ginttinttiza Yooseefannee Maataasa nam7ita shiisheeza. <verse eid="ACT 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24"/>Yeypp guye, Xooss woossittar, «As ubba wozina eriza Godayyo, yha nam7itaypp ne oona dooreezako nuna beezoba. <verse eid="ACT 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25"/>Yihuda fa aqa qitii, ashsheez oosannee hawaaretith oosa ekkoday garkk yhayttitaypp nuna beezoba» yeegeeza. <verse eid="ACT 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26"/>Unttal afa ixa olin Ixay Maataasal afa wodhdhin Maataasa taphpho pettii hawaaritayll afa guzhintteeza.<verse eid="ACT 1:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Geesha Ayyana wodhith</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1"/>Phenxeqosxe giz gallasay helleez wode ammaniza as ubbay pettii aqo shiiqii yeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:15-21">Lewii. 23:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:9-11">Nam7i. 16:9-11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2"/>Qoppekkazin wolqqama gote garkk guummiz guumthay salopp yi7ii unttii yez keetha kumeeza. <verse eid="ACT 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3"/>Tama lath aaziz iranthitay unttis benttittar, shaginttii shaginttii unttal ubbayil afa beteeza. <verse eid="ACT 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4"/>Unttii ubbay Geeshsha Ayyanar kumii duma duma doonar odinttoday garkk Geeshsha Ayyanay unttan udin odintto aykkeeza.<verse eid="ACT 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5"/>Ye wode biitta ubbapp ye7eez Xoossis yashittiz Ayihuditay Yerusalaame yeza. <verse eid="ACT 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6"/>Ye guumtha si7ii gaame asay shiiqeeza. Ammaniza asay u gade doonar odinttodar si7eez gishos <verse eid="ACT 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7"/>yhay malabaz gi, «Yha odinttiza as ubbay Galila as baasa? <verse eid="ACT 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8"/>Yeezin, nuunii, nu yelintteez biitta doonar unttii odinttodar wayizii si7odayis danda7eenee? <verse eid="ACT 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9"/>Nuunii Pharixe, Meede, Elaame, Mesophotaame<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mesophotaame guussay nam7i haathitay gancce guussii ye haathitaykka Ephiratoosannee Tigra</char></note> yezitay, Yihuda, Qaphadooqa, Phanxoosa, Iisiya, <verse eid="ACT 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10"/>Phirge, Phinfile, Gibxxe, Qaarina achcha yez Liiba yezita. Nuupp baggityikka Oroomepp ye7eez asita. <verse eid="ACT 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11"/>Ayihuditaynnee Ayihudetitha ammano geleez asitay, Qarxeesannee Arabe asitay, Xoossii ootheez gita oosa nu qaalayir ododar si7iza» yeegeeza. <verse eid="ACT 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12"/>Ubbay malabaz gi, godibaz dhabin woliko, «Yhayi ab maaqqodeshsha?» yeegeeza. <verse eid="ACT 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13"/>Zin yhankkitay, «Yeyititay uzhii matheembay» yeegii unttal ari7eeza.<verse eid="ACT 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phixiroosa nashsha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14"/>Zini Phixiroosa, taphpho pettii hawaaritayira denddii eqqii, fa qaala dhoqq udii, unttiko yhay garkk yeegii odeeza: «Ayihuditayyo, Yerusalaame yez ubbitayo, taanii odiza si7oytta. <verse eid="ACT 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15"/>Wonttapp hayidzii saate maaqqeez gishos yi qoppizay garkk yha asitay mathekkaya; yey yinttis erintto. <verse eid="ACT 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16"/>Zin yhay haneezay nabe Iyu7eela odeezay polinttoday garkkes<verse eid="ACT 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17"/>«‹Xoossii, wode wurssitha yhay garkk hanoda yeegiza:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">taanii as ubbayil afa ta Ayyana gogisoda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">Yi dhiirath na7itaynnee maachch na7itay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">tinbbite ododa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">Yi paanthitay qonccith be7ada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">yi cimitay ahumo ahumoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17-21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:28-32">Iyu. 2:28-32</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18"/>Ye gallasitayid tana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">ammaniza dhiirathi ayllitayil afannee maachch ayllitayil afa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">taanii ta Ayyana gogisoda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">unttii tinbbite ododa.<verse eid="ACT 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19"/>Ma taanii afa salor oroth baz,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">oommo sa7arakka malla beezoda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:19">Suuthii, tamannee wolqqama cuya fuullo benttoda.<verse eid="ACT 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20"/>Gitannee bonchcho maaqqeez Goday gallasay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">hellodaypp tiina awa dhumoda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">aginakka suuthii aazoda.<verse eid="ACT 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21"/>Ye wode yhay garkk hanoda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:21">Goday sunth xeegiz oonkka attoda›</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 2:21">yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22"/>«Isreele asayyo, yha qaala si7oytta. Naazirete Yesuusa oonatithay, Xoossii yi gancce ootheez wolqqama oosayirannee malatitayir yinttis qoncciza yi, yi ubbas eriza. <verse eid="ACT 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23"/>Xooss tiina fa erarannee fa shenayir Yesuusa yinttis aadhii inggintteeza. Yi eza higge baa asitay kusher mazqalel afa sottis yi wodheeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:35">Mat. 27:35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:24">Mar. 15:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:33">Luq. 23:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:18">Wan. 19:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24"/>Zin Xooss yhayiqo wolqqa dhabisii eza dentheeza. Yey gishos, yhayiqo eza aykkodayis danda7ekkaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:5-6">Mat. 28:5-6</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:6">Mar. 16:6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:5">Luq. 24:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25"/>Dawute ebagga odittar,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">«‹Taanii dagammaamay garkk,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">Goday ta ushachcha yeza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">Goda ubba wode ta ta tiina bi7iza.<verse eid="ACT 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26"/>Yey gishos, ta wozinay ufaytteeza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">ta doonay ufayssar kumeeza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">yhayqqiz ta asetithay ufayisar yezoda.<verse eid="ACT 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27"/>Abis giiko, ta shemppa Si7oole ashshaamii.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:27">Ma ne Xillay aha wooqqithaami.<verse eid="ACT 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28"/>Neenii tana de7o oga eriseeza.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:28">Ne taar yezay gishos ta ufayssay kunith maaqqiza›<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:25-28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 16:8-11">Maz. 16:8-11</ref></char></note> yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29"/>«Ta ishuntho, nu ada Dawute bagga ta yinttis geeshshii ododa. Dawute yhayqqii moogintteeza; e duufay yhayino hellodayis nu kale yeza. <verse eid="ACT 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30"/>Dawute nabe maaqqeez gishos Xooss e sheeshaypp petta e kaatetitha zufaanayil afa betithodayis ees caaqqeez caaqa eriza. <verse eid="ACT 2:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31"/>Yeyi gishos, Kiristtoosa dendda tiina bi7ii, ‹E shemppay Si7oole attekkaya; e asetithaykka wooqqekkaya› gi odeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 132:11">Maz. 132:11</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 7:12-13">2 Sam. 7:12-13</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32"/>«Xoossii, yha Yesuusa yhayiqoypp dentheezayis nuunii ubbay markka. <verse eid="ACT 2:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33"/>Yey gishos, Xoossii fa ushachcha eza dhoqq dhoqq udii, ees inggod ginttintteez Geeshsha Ayyanay ufayisa fa Xooss Adaypp ekkii, yhaya yi yhatti bi7izannee si7iza nuul afa gogiseeza. <verse eid="ACT 2:33"/><verse number="34-35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34-35"/>Yeykka, Dawute fa ommas salo yhangekkaya zin:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34-35">«‹Goday, ta Goda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34-35">«Taanii ne morkkita</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:34-35">ne tokes yedhdhith aqo udod hellodayis</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:34-35">yhaydda taapp ushachch bagga bettoba geeza»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 2:34-35">yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:34-35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Maz. 110:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 2:34-35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36"/>«Yey gishos, yha yi mazqalel afa sotteez Yesuusa, Xoossii eza Godannee Kiristtoosa maheezana Isreele as ubbay tumapp ero» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 2:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37"/>Asay Phixiroosa geeza si7in u wozinay bochinttin Phixiroosannee yhankko hawaaritayko, «Nu Ishuntho, yeezin nuunii ab udo?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 2:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38"/>Phixiroosa unttiko, «Yi nagaray atto ginttinttoday garkk nagaraypp maaqqii, yi pettay pettay Yesuus Kiristtoosa sunthar xammaqinttoytta. Xooss inggiza Geeshsha Ayyana yi ekkoda. <verse eid="ACT 2:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39"/>Yeykka Xoossii inggod geez ufayss qaalay yinttisii, yi na7itayisinnee Goday nu Xoossay faak xeegiz haakko yez ubbitayis» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 2:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40"/>Phixiroosa unttis hara qaalakka gujjii markkattii, «Yha wode zhuca asayil afa ye7odayis yez pirddaypp yinttan ashshoytta» yeegii zoreeza. <verse eid="ACT 2:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41"/>Phixiroosa odeezana ekkeezitay xammaqintteeza. Ye gallas hayidzii mukule maaqqiz asay ammanii gujintteeza. <verse eid="ACT 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42"/>Unttii hawaaritay timirttayid, pettipettithar, katha wolla muusarannee Xooss woosar miinggeeza.<verse eid="ACT 2:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ammaniza asay pettipettith yess</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43"/>Hawaaritay kushe gaame oorothibazinnee malabaz haneezay gishos as ubbay yashitteeza. <verse eid="ACT 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44"/>Ammaneez ubbitay wolla yeziza; paas yeza baz ubba pettipp shagintteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:32-35">Haw. O. 4:32-35</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45"/>Unttii paas yeza baz bayizii miishe pettayis pettayis koshshizay garkk shagiza. <verse eid="ACT 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46"/>Ubba gallas pettii wozinar maaqqii Xooss kara shiiqiza. Fa kara pettay petta xeegii ufayssarannee ashikke wozinar katha miiza. <verse eid="ACT 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47"/>Xooss galatittar as ubbayir sabintteeza. Goday ammanii attizita gallas gallas unttal afa gujjiza.<verse eid="ACT 2:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Wobbo athay paxeeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1"/>Pettii gallas Phixiroosannee Waannisa Xooss woossodayis uddufun saater Xooss Kara yhanigeeza. <verse eid="ACT 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2"/>Yelintteez gallasapp aykkii toke sileez pettii athay Xooss kara geliza asaypp miishe woossoday garkk ubba wode lo77o giz Xooss kara penge gallas gallas ki7ii gaddizazin. <verse eid="ACT 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3"/>Ye toke sileez athay Phixiroosannee Waannisa Xooss Kara gelod hanodar bi7ii unttan miishe woosseeza.<verse eid="ACT 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4"/>Unttikka eza dakkii bi7ii, Phixiroosa «Nuuko yhana bo7oba» yeegeeza. <verse eid="ACT 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5"/>Toke sila athay unttapp akko baz demmada aazin unttan be7eeza. <verse eid="ACT 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6"/>Zin Phixiroosa eziko, «Taas birannee worqqa baaya, zin taas yeza baz ta nees immada. Naazirete Yesuus Kiristtoosa sunthar denddii yedhdhoba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7"/>Yeypp guye, sila athayis ushachch kusha aykkii dentheeza. Ellisii e tokaynnee qilccay miinggii atteeza. <verse eid="ACT 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8"/>Athay guppii denddii eqqeeza. Gedennee yhana yeth aykkeeza. Yeypp guye, yedhdhitarannee, guppitar Xooss galatittar unttar wolla Xooss Kara geleeza.<verse eid="ACT 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9"/>E yedhdhodarannee Xooss galatodar asii ubbay eza be7eeza. <verse eid="ACT 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10"/>Be7eez ubbitaykka miishe woossodayis lo77o giz Xooss Kara pengel betteezay eza maaqqeeza ereeza; E haneezibaza bi7ii malabaz geeza.<verse eid="ACT 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phixiroosa Xooss kara odeez sibkata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11"/>Athay Phixiroosappennee Waannisapp duuxaam gi aykkii yezin asii ubbay malabaz gi, Solomone barandda giz aqo wolla unttiko woxxeeza. <verse eid="ACT 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12"/>Phixiroosa asa bi7ii asayiko, «Isreele asayyo, abis yhaya malabaz gee? Woy abis nuna dakkii be7ee? Nuunii nu wolqqar woy nu Xooss lo7ottithayir yha atha yetheezibaz yinttis aazinee? <verse eid="ACT 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13"/>Afraame, Isaaqa, Yayqqooba Xoossay, nu aditay Xoossay, fa na7a Yesuusa boncheeza. Zin yi yhayiqos aathii inggeeza Philaaxoosa bili7odayis koykokka yi e tiina, ‹Nuunii eza koyooya› yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:15">Kes. 3:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14"/>Yi geeshshannee xilla, kaddii, shemppo wodheeza yinttis billoday garkk Philaaxoosa woosseeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:15-23">Mat. 27:15-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-14">Mar. 15:6-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-23">Luq. 23:13-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 9:12-15">Wan. 9:12-15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15"/>De7o inggiza yi wodheeza, zin Xoossii yhayiqopp eza dentheeza. Yeyis nuunii markka. <verse eid="ACT 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16"/>Yha yi bi7izaynnee eriza asay paxii minggeezay Yesuusa sunthar ammaneez gisho. Yha yi ubbay tiina eza yhay garkk patheezay E Yesuusa ammaneez gishosi.<verse eid="ACT 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17"/>«Yhattekka ta ishuntho, yinttikka yinttan kalithizitaykka, erekkazar ootheezana taanii eriza. <verse eid="ACT 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18"/>Zin Xoossii binii nabitay ubba doonar, ‹Kiristtoosa waaye ekkodayis beeziza› yeegeeza polinttoday garkk udeeza. <verse eid="ACT 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19"/>Yikkee, Xoossii yi nagara atto goday garkk maarototh gelii Godayiko maaqqoytta. <verse eid="ACT 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20"/>Goday kalepp minthatho wode yinttis ye7oda. Goday tiinatii dooreez Kiristtoosa yinttis dakkoda. <verse eid="ACT 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21"/>Xoossii fa geesh nabitay doonar binii odeezay garkk ubba baz oroxxiza wode hellodayis yha Yesuusa salo gam7odayis beeziza. <verse eid="ACT 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22"/>Muse, ‹Goda Xoossay tana dentheezay garkk yi ganccepp yinttis nabe denthoda. Yi E giza ubba si7oytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Nam7i. 18:15</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 18:18">18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23"/>Ye nabay oda si7oowa as oonkka as ganccepp shaakinttii dhabo› yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:19">Nam7i. 18:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 3:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24"/>«Ma Saami7eelapp aykkii yez nabitay ubbitay yha wode bagga odeeza. <verse eid="ACT 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25"/>Yi nabitay na7ita; ma Xoossii Afraames, ‹Sa7all yez as ubba taanii ne sheeshay baggar anjjoda› yeegii nu aditayis geleez qaala caaqo laattiza na7ita.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:18">Medhe. 22:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26"/>Xooss yinttan ubba yi iita ogaypp mahii anjjoday garkk fa na7a denthii yinttis tiina dakkeeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 3:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Phixiroosannee Waannisa ayihude shanggo tiina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1"/>Phixiroosannee Waannisa asayis ododar qeesitay, Xooss kara naagizitay halaqaynnee Saduqaawitay unttiko ye7eeza. <verse eid="ACT 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2"/>Unttii Yesuusa yhayiqopp dendeezannee yeypp denddeezayid yhayiqopp denddo yezana woya taamarsseez gishos yiloteeza. <verse eid="ACT 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3"/>Yey gisho, unttan aykkii sa7a omatheezaypp wonttod hellodayis achch kara gelseeza. <verse eid="ACT 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4"/>Zin qaala si7eezitaypp gaamitay ammaneeza. Ammaneez dhiirath asay taybay ichchin mukule heleeza.<verse eid="ACT 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5"/>Wonttitha gallas kaalithizitay, cimitayinnee, higge asitamaaritay Yerusalaame shiiqeeza. <verse eid="ACT 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6"/>Ye asay gancce qeese halaqa Haanna, Qayyaafa, Waannisa, Iskkinddirennee qeese halaqay kara asitay ubbay yeza. <verse eid="ACT 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7"/>Hawaarita fa tiina eesi, «Aba wolqqar woy o sunthar yhaya yi ootheenee?» yeegii oyceeza.<verse eid="ACT 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8"/>Ye wode Phixiroosa Geeshsha Ayyanar kumii, «Woya halaqitayyonnee, cimitayo, <verse eid="ACT 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9"/>yhayino yha wobbo athayis oosintteez lo77o oosayil E wayizii paxeezako yi nuna oyciko, <verse eid="ACT 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10"/>mazqalel afa yi soxxin, Xoossii yhayiqopp dentheez Naazirete Yesuus Kiristtoosa sunthayir yha athay paxii yi tiina eqqeezay yinttisnnee Isreele as ubbayis erintto.<verse eid="ACT 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11"/>«‹Yinttii gimbbizitay borii ixxeez shuchchay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:11">keethe muumer tookkii aykkiz kirkiro garkke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:11">ubbaypp aadhiz shuchch maaqqeeza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:11">ye shuchchay Yesuusa.›<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Maz. 118:22</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12"/>Yey gishos, atotithii e baggarapp attin hara o baggarakka baaya. Nuunii e sunthar attod garkk as ubbayis Xoossii salopp oommor inggeez hara sunthii baaya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13"/>Shiiqeez asay Phixiroosannee Waannisa yashsha bayth odeezana be7eez wode unttii tamaarekka cere as maaqqeeza akaakii malabaz geeza; unttii Yesuusar yezayana ereeza. <verse eid="ACT 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14"/>Ma paxeez athay Phixiroosarannee Waannisara eqqeezana asay bi7in godibaz dhabeeza. <verse eid="ACT 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15"/>Zin Phixiroosannee Waannisa bale kezoday garkk udii fa gancce, <verse eid="ACT 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16"/>«Yha asita nu ab udo? U kushe oosintteez gita mala bazay Yerusalaame yez ubbayis benttiza. Nuunii yeya eroowa godayis danda7ooya. <verse eid="ACT 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17"/>Zin yha oday as gancce laalinttaama ygarkk yikkepp guye yha asitay Yesuusa sunthayir ooskka odaamayinnee taamarisamay garkk miinthii odii» yeegii zorintteeza.<verse eid="ACT 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18"/>Unttan xeegii, Yesuusa sunthayir yhannipp gede yesha odaamay garkkennee tamaarssaamay garkk azazeeza. <verse eid="ACT 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19"/>Zin Phixiroosannee Waannisa unttiko mahii, «Xoossis kiitinttodayippennee yinttis kiitinttodaypp Xooss tiina aay lo77ozako an yi pirddoytta. <verse eid="ACT 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20"/>Nuunii be7eezi bazinnee si7eezibaz oda ashshodayis danda7ooya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21"/>Woya cimitaynnee kaalithizitay kaseesaypp miinthii naagisii unttan dakkii ashsheeza. Asay haneezibazayis Xooss galatiza gishos unttan seerodayis danda7ibe7ekkaya. <verse eid="ACT 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22"/>Ye malatayir harggepp patheez athayis laythay oyitamapp aadho.<verse eid="ACT 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ammaniza asay woosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23"/>Phixiroosannee Waannisa bili7inttii unttar ammaniza dabbitayiko yhanigii, qeese halaqitayinnee cimitay faako geezbaz ubba unttis odeeza. <verse eid="ACT 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24"/>Unttii yeya si7eez wode pettii wozinar maaqqii Xoossa yhay garkk yeegii woosseeza: «Ubba mooddiz Godayyo, salo, sa7a, abbannee u gancce yez ubba baz medhdheezayyo,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:11">Kes. 20:11</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:6">Nah. 9:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 146:6">Maz. 146:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25"/>Neenii ne ayllana, nu ade Dawute doona Geeshsha Ayyanar,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">«‹Woya abis yiloteenee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:25">Asay abis cere tobbeenee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25-26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:1-2">Maz. 2:1-2</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26"/>Sa7a kaatityinnee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">gade haarizitay pettipp Godayil afannee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">E Kiristtoosal afa denddeeza› yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27"/>«Tumakka, Herodoosannee Phenxe Philaaxoosa Ayihude baa asayirannee Isreele asayira ne tizheez ne geeshsh Na7a Yesuusal afa dendodayis yha katamayi shiiqeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat. 27:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1">Mar. 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1">Luq. 23:1</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 23:7-11">7-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-29">Wan. 18:28-29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28"/>Ma ne wolqqayidannee ne shenayid udod gi qopp betteeza ubba unttii poleeza. <verse eid="ACT 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29"/>Yhattekka Godayyo, u mandditha bo7oba; nuunii ne ayllitay ne qaala kunth wozinar ododay garkk nuna danda7isoba. <verse eid="ACT 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30"/>Ne geeshsh oosancho Yesuusa sunthar hargganchchita pathodayis, oorathibazinnee malatitay oosinttoday garkk ne kushe miccoba» gi woosseeza.<verse eid="ACT 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31"/>Unttii Xooss woosseezaypp guye ye unttii shiiqeez aqay eni7eeza. U ubbay Geeshsha Ayyanar kumin Xooss qaala goobi odeeza.<verse eid="ACT 4:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tiina ammaneez asay pettipetteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32"/>Ammanizitay ubbay qofarannee wozinar petto maaqqeeza. Unttii paas yeza baz tabaz geekkazar pettipp shaakinttiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:44-45">Haw. O. 2:44-45</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33"/>Hawaaritay Goda Yesuusa yhayiqopp dentheez gita wolqqar markkattiza. Xooss unttis ubbayis aadho keehatithaypp gaanthii inggeeza. <verse eid="ACT 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34"/>Biitta woy kamppa yezitay ubbay bayizii ekkeez miisha ki7iza gishos ammanizitay gancce metintteezay pettakka baaya. <verse eid="ACT 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35"/>Miishe ki7ii hawaaritayis inggiza; ye miisha pettayis pettayis koshshizay garkk shagii shagii inggiza.<verse eid="ACT 4:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36"/>Qoophiroosa giz aqo yelintteez Yooseefa giz Lewe sheeshaypp maaqqeez pettay yeza. E suntha hawaaritay Barnnabaasa geeza. Barnabaasa guussay Minthatho na7a guussii geeza. <verse eid="ACT 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37"/>Barnnabaasa paas yez biitta bayizii miisha ki7ii hawaaritayis inggeeza.<verse eid="ACT 4:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Hananannee e machchat Saphphiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1"/>Pettii Hanana giz athay fa machchat Saphphirir gade bayizeeza. <verse eid="ACT 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2"/>Ye bayizeez miishaypp fa machchat erodar shagii ashshii, atteezana ki7ii hawaaritay toke kale gaddeeza.<verse eid="ACT 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3"/>Zin Phixiroosa Hananako, «Neenii Geeshsha Ayyana dooshshoday garkkennee biita bayizeez miishaypp shagii ashshoday garkk Xalahe ne wozina abis geleenee? <verse eid="ACT 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4"/>Neenii bayizodaypp tiina biitay nees baasannee? Ma ne bayiz maaqqinkka miishay nees baasannee? Yeezin, yey garkk oothodayis abis ne wozinar qoppeenee? Neenii Xoossal afa worddoteenepp attin asal afa worddotekkaya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5"/>Hananee ye qaala si7eezangarkk pokkii yhayqqeeza; yeya si7eez ubbay iita yashitteeza. <verse eid="ACT 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6"/>Na7atitha asitay denddii e aha ziidhii afilar xaaxii kanggii moogeeza.<verse eid="ACT 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7"/>Hayidzii saatepp guye Hanana machchat yeya erekkazar Phixiroosa yeza aqo geleeza. <verse eid="ACT 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8"/>Phixiroosa iiko, «Yi biitta yhannii garkk miishes bayizeenee? An taas odoba» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:8">Izaka, «Ee, yhay garkk miishes bayizeez» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9"/>Phixiroosa iiko, «Neerannee ne azinayira Goda Ayyana faaccodayis abis zorintteene? Yeezako, ne azina moogeez asay baler yeza; nenakka unttii bale kessoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10"/>Izakka izir Phixiroosa toke achcha pokkii yhayqqii ateeza; na7atithitay gelodar yhayqqeezano denggii bale kessii, I azinay kale moogeeza. <verse eid="ACT 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11"/>Woosa keeth ubbaynnee yeya si7eez hara as ubbay loythii yashitteeza.<verse eid="ACT 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Orothibazitannee mala bizita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12"/>Hawaaritay gaame malatitannee orothabazita as gancce ootheeza. Ammaniza ubbay Solomone barandda pettipp shiiqeeza. <verse eid="ACT 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13"/>Hara asaypp pettii asikka unttan hellodayis minggekka, zin asay unttan bonchchiza. <verse eid="ACT 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14"/>Ammaniza dhiirathitaynne maachchitay taybay kaseesaypp gaanggittar gaaggittar qiteeza. <verse eid="ACT 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15"/>Yey gishos, asay hargganchchita halarannee arssar tookkii Phixiroosa aadhodar e eeshay unttapp pettayil pettayil afa shemppoday garkk oge doona kessii gaddeeza. <verse eid="ACT 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16"/>Ma gaame asay Yerusalaame kale yez katamitaypp hargganchchitannee tuna ayyana waayisiza asita ekkii yi7iza; ubbaykka paxeeza.<verse eid="ACT 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hawaaritayil afa bayi7ith dendeez</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17"/>Qeese halaqaynnee ezir yez Saduqaawitay ubbay qinaater kumii hawaaritayil afa denddeeza. <verse eid="ACT 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18"/>Hawaarita aykkii woya achch kara oleeza. <verse eid="ACT 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19"/>Zin Goda kiitanchchay qamma achch kara penga dooyii hawaarita bale kessii, <verse eid="ACT 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20"/>«Yhanigii, Xooss kara eqqii yha de7o qaala as ubbayis odoytta» yeegeeza. <verse eid="ACT 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21"/>Hawaaritay yeya si7eez wode wontt guura Xooss Kara gelii taamarsso aykkeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Qeesitay halaqaynnee ezar yezitay yi7ii, Isreele cimita ubba xeegii shiishii hawaarita fa tiina ko7oday garkk wotaaddarita achch kara azazeeza. <verse eid="ACT 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22"/>Zin wotaaddaritay achch kara yhanigii hawaarita denggekka. Guye maaqqii yi7ii woyas, <verse eid="ACT 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23"/>«Nuunii yhanigodar achch kara ibithay miinthii gorddettin, naagizitay pengel eqqeezita denggeez. Zin nuunii penga dooyodar gancce hara attozin pettii askka baaya» yeegeeza. <verse eid="ACT 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24"/>Yey gishos, Xooss Kara wotaaddarita kiittizayinnee qeese halaqitay yeya si7eez wode «Hawaaritayil afa abi haneenee?» yeegii taweeza.<verse eid="ACT 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25"/>Ye wode pettii athay unttiko yi7ii, «Yeezako, achch kara yi gelsseez asitay Xooss kara eqqii asa taamarssiza» yeegii unttis odeeza. <verse eid="ACT 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26"/>Xooss Kara wotaaddarita kiittizay fa wotaaddaritayira yhanigii hawaarita ke7eeza. Zin unttii fana asay shuchchar shocoda gi yashitteez gishos unttan aaddashii ke7eeza.<verse eid="ACT 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27"/>Unttii hawaarita ki7ii, shiiqeez shanggo tiina ki7in qeese halaqay unttiko, <verse eid="ACT 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28"/>«Yinttan nuunii ya athay sunthar tamaarssaamay ygarkk miinthii kiittekkasa? Yeezako, yi timirtta Yerusalaame katama ubba heltheeza. Ye athay shemppayis nuna oyicishodayis qoppine?» yeegii oycceeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:25">Mat. 27:25</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29"/>Phixiroosarannee yhankko hawaaritayir unttis mahittar, «Nuunii asis kiitinttodaypp Xoossis kiitinttodayis beeziza. <verse eid="ACT 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30"/>Mazqalel afa yi sottii wodhdheez Yesuusa nu aditay Xoossay yhayiqopp dentheeza. <verse eid="ACT 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31"/>Isreelitay nagaraypp maaqqoday garkkennee u nagaray atto ginttinttoday garkk Xooss Yesuusa haarizannee ashshiza udii bonchchor fappe ushachch baggar betitheeza. <verse eid="ACT 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32"/>Yeyis nuunii markka; ma Xooss fana kiitinttizitayis inggeez Geeshsha Ayyaanaykka markka» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33"/>Shiiqeez asay yeya si7eez wode iita yilottii, hawaarita wodhodayis qoppeeza. <verse eid="ACT 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34"/>Zin as ubbayid lo77o bonchchintteez, higge asitamaaray, Gamaalale giz pettii Ferisaaway denddii eqqii hawaarita xiqqa wodes bale kessoday garkk azazeeza. <verse eid="ACT 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35"/>Yeypp guye, shiiqeez asayiko, «Isreele asayyo, yha asitayil afa yi udodayis qoppizabazipp naaginttoytta. <verse eid="ACT 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36"/>Abis giiko, yhaypp tiina Tewodaasa fana, ‹Taanii damma› gi denddin, oyddii xeet maaqqiz asitay ezar ma7intteeza. Zin eza wodhin eza kaalleez ubbay laalinttin pathoowa as maaqqeeza. <verse eid="ACT 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37"/>Yeypp guye, asay taybinttiza wode Galila yez Yihuda denddii gaame as pangga mahii kaalitheez, zin ezakka wodhin eza kaalleez as ubbay laalintteeza. <verse eid="ACT 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38"/>Yhattekka ta yinttis odiza; yha asitaypp shaakinttoytta; unttan bochchipatte. Abis giiko, yha qofannee yha oosa as oothizabaz maaqqiko dhaboda. <verse eid="ACT 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39"/>Zini yha qofaynnee yha oosay Xoossapp ye7eez baz maaqqiko, yi unttan dhabisodayis danda7oowa. Yeyititar yi Xoossar kaccinttoda» yeegii odeeza. Yeyi gishos, shiiqeez asay Gamaalale zoriza ekkeeza.<verse eid="ACT 5:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40"/>Hawaarita kara xeegii gelisii alanggar garafeeza. Yeypp guye, unttiko, «Yesuusa suntha nam7intho denthipatte» gi bili7i dakkeeza. <verse eid="ACT 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41"/>Yesuusa sunthay gishos unttii kawushoday beeziza baz maaqqeezana ereez gishos shanggita tiinapp ufayttittar kezeeza. <verse eid="ACT 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42"/>Unttii ubba wode Xooss keethannee as kara Yesuusa E Kiristtoosa maaqqeezana taamarssizanannee sabbakizana ashshekkaya.<verse eid="ACT 5:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Laappun asitay doorintto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1"/>Ye wode kaalizitay taybay gaanggii gaanggii yhanigodar, Girike doona odinttiza Ayihuditay Yihuda yelinttii yez Ayihuditayil afa oolleeza. Abis giiko, Girike doona odinttiza Ayihuditay, «Gallas gallas ingginttiza kathayir nu azinii yhayqqeez maachchitayir urqqiza» yeegeeza. <verse eid="ACT 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2"/>Taphpho nam77ii hawaaritay woosa keeth as ubba xeegii, «Nuunii Xooss qaala odiza ashshii katha gishodayis nuus beezooya. <verse eid="ACT 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3"/>Yikkee, nu ishuntho, lo77o asita, Geeshsha Ayyanarannee ecetithar kumeez laappun asita yi ganccepp dooroytta; nuunii unttan yha oosayis shuumoda. <verse eid="ACT 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4"/>Zin nuunii, nu kuminth wode Xooss woosarannee qaala tamaarssor peeshshoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5"/>Hawaaritay odeez oday as ubba ufaysseeza. Yey gishos, ammanorannee Geeshsha Ayyanar kumeez Isxifaanose, Filphoosa, Phirokoroosa, Niqaarone, Ximoona, Pharmmeenannee Ayihude ammano gelii maaqqeez Anxooka Niqoloosa maraxeeza. <verse eid="ACT 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6"/>Unttan hawaarita tiina ki7in, hawaaritay unttal afa kushe gaddii Xooss woosseeza.<verse eid="ACT 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7"/>Xooss qaalay dalggi dalggi yhanigeeza. Yerusalaame yez ammanizitay taybay gaanggii gaanggii qiteeza; qeesitayppekka gaamitay ammaneeza.<verse eid="ACT 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Isixefaanose aykintteeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8"/>Isxefaanose aadho keehatethayrannee wolqqar kumii as gancce orothibazitannee malabazita udiza. <verse eid="ACT 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9"/>Aylletithapp kezizitayis ginttinttiz Ayihude Woosa Keeth asay Qerenappennee Iskkinddireppe Kilqepennee Iisiyappe ye7eez pettii pettii asitay denddii Isxifaanosar palameeza. <verse eid="ACT 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10"/>Zin Isxifaanose odinttitar yez ecetithannee Ayyana unttii eqinttodayis danda7ekkaya.<verse eid="ACT 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11"/>Ye wode unttii, «Musenannee Xoossa E cazhodar si7eez» giz worddo markkatta denthitheeza. <verse eid="ACT 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12"/>Yey garkk udii woya gade cimitannee higge asitamaarita ezal afa denthitheeza. Isxifaanosena aykkii Shanggo tiina kanggeeza. <verse eid="ACT 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13"/>Ezal afa payideez worddo markkitay, «Yha athay yha Xooss karannee Muse higga mahii mahii cazhiza. <verse eid="ACT 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14"/>E, ‹Yhay Naazirete Yesuusa, yha Xooss Kara laalloda; ma Muse nuus inggeez higga laammoda› yeegodar nuunii si7eez» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15"/>Shanggo shiiqol betteez as ubbay Isxifaanose dakkii be7adar e sinay kiitanchcho sino aaziza.<verse eid="ACT 6:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Isxifaanose nashsha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1"/>Qeesitay halaqay Isxifaanoseko, «Yha mootay tuma?» yeegii oycceeza.<verse eid="ACT 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2"/>Isxifaanose, «Ta ishuntho, ta aditayyo, si7oytta! Nu ada Afraame Kaaraane yezodayis yhanigodaypp tiina Masephexoome yezin, bonchcho Xoossay ees qonccii,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2-3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:1">Medhe. 12:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3"/>‹Ne gadayppennee ne dabbitaypp shaakinttii taanii nena beeziza biitta qitoba› yeegeeza. <verse eid="ACT 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4"/>Ye wode Afraame Kaladaawitay biittapp kezii Kaaraane yezodayis qiteeza. E aday yhayqqeezaypp guye Xoossii eza yha biitta yhatti yi yez gada ke7eeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 11:31">Medhe. 11:31</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 12:4">12:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5"/>E hara attozin tokay yedhdhiz aqokka Afiraames inggekka. Zin na7a ees baa wode Xooss yha biitta eesinnee e sheeshayis laata udii inggodana qaala geleeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Medhe. 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 13:15">13:15</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 15:18">15:18</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 17:8">17:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6"/>Xoossii Afraameko, ‹Ne sheeshay hara biitta imathetithar yezoda; ezayid oyddii xeet layth unttii aylletitha haarinttoda. <verse eid="ACT 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7"/>Zin taanii ne sheesha moodiz gadayil afa pirddoda. Yeypp guye, unttii ye biittaypp kezii yhaydda taas goynnoda› yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:12">Kes. 3:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8"/>Xoossii Afraame sheeshay dookalinttoday garkk ezar caaqqin, Isaaqa yelintteez hosppuntha gallasar dookaleeza. Isaaqa Yayqqooba dookaleeza; ma Yayqqooba taphpho nam77ii fa na7ita, nu aditay mayzita dookaleeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:10-14">Medhe. 17:10-14</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 21:2-4">21:2-4</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 25:26">25:26</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 29:31-35">29:31-35</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9"/>«Yayqqooba na7itay Yooseefana qinaatii Gibxxe biitta aylletithis bayizeeza, zin Xoossii ezar yeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:11">Medhe. 37:11</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 37:28">28</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 39:2">39:2</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 39:21">21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10"/>Eza, e waaye ubbaypp kesseeza. Gibxxe kaat Paarona tiina deettennee ecetith ees inggeeza. Gibxxe kaatay Yooseefas Gibxxe biittannee fa kara ubba aqisod halaqatithi inggeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:39-41">Medhe. 41:39-41</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11"/>«Gibxxe biittayidannee Kan7aane gade ubbayid naye gelii gaame asa un77itheeza. Ye wode nu mayzitay katha denggodayis danda7ibe7ekkaya. <verse eid="ACT 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12"/>Yayqqooba Gibxxe biittayid katha yezana si7ii nu aditay tiina ged eza dakkeeza. <verse eid="ACT 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13"/>Nam7inth yhamayir Yoosef fa ishitayis fana erseeza. Gibxxe kaat Faarona Yooseefa sheeshay ereeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:1">Medhe. 45:1</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 45:16">16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14"/>Yooseefa fa ade Yayqqoobannee fa dabbo ubba, laappun tamann ichchin asay faako ye7oday garkk kiittii ki7iseeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:9-10">Medhe. 45:9-10</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 45:17-18">17-18</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 46:27">46:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15"/>Yayqqooba Gibxxe biitta wodhdheeza; eenne e na7itay ezayid yhayqqeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 46:1-7">Medhe. 46:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 49:33">49:33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16"/>U meqetha ye aqaypp Seekeeme tookinttii yhanigii, ezayid Afraame Hamoore na7itaypp gaam birar wongeez duufayid moogeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:3-16">Medhe. 23:3-16</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 33:19">33:19</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 50:7-13">50:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:32">Iyya. 24:32</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17"/>«Zin Xoossay Afraames inggod geeza poliza layth hellodayis helleez wode Gibxxe biittayid yez nu asay gaanggii gaanggii qiteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17-18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:7-8">Kes. 1:7-8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18"/>Yeypp guye, Yooseefa eroowa hara kaat Gibxxe biittayid kawutod hellodayisii. <verse eid="ACT 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19"/>Ye kaatay nu zeritha genii xiqqa na7itay yhayqqoday garkk unttan bale kessii oloday garkk nu adita un77itheeza.<verse eid="ACT 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20"/>«Ye wode Muse yelintteez; E Xooss tiina usa lo77o na7a. Fa aday kara hayidzii agina hellodayis dicceeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:10-11">Kes. 1:10-11</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 1:22">22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21"/>Muse wora gaddeez wode Gibxxe kaatay na7ita denggii ekkii fa na7a udii eza dichcheeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:2">Kes. 2:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22"/>Muse Gibxxitay ecetith ubba taamarii odarannee oosor mino as maaqqeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:3-10">Kes. 2:3-10</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23"/>«Muses laythay oyttam kumeez wode fa ishita, Isra7eelita be7adayis fa wozinayid qoppeeza. <verse eid="ACT 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24"/>Isra7eelitaypp pettaya Gibxxe as pettay qohodar bi7ii ye Isreele atha maaddii, ye qoheez Gibxxe atha wodhii kushe maheeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:11-15">Kes. 2:11-15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25"/>Muse fa ishita fa baggar Xoossii ashshodayis hanizana unttii akaakoda gi qoppeeza, zin unttii akaakekka.<verse eid="ACT 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26"/>«Wonttitha gallas nam77ii Isreele asitay pettay pettayir yhadhinttodar denggeeza unttan dabbosodayis kezii, ‹Asuntho, yi ishita; abis pettay petta qohine?› yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 7:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27"/>«Zin pettay fa lagga qohizay Museko, ‹Nena nuul afa haarizannee daynna ootheezay oonoo? <verse eid="ACT 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28"/>Neenii ziqin Gibxxe atha wodheezay garkk tana wodhodayis koyinee?› yeegii Musena urqqii dakkeeza. <verse eid="ACT 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29"/>Muse yeya si7ii Gibxxepp bettii Miidaame biitta bete as maaqqii yezitar nam7i dhirith na7ita yeleeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 18:3-4">Kes. 18:3-4</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30"/>«Goda kiitanchchay oyttam laythapp guye Siinna amba kale yez liizho tushe gancce eexiza tama laco gancce Muses bentteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:30-34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:1-10">Kes. 3:1-10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31"/>Muse fa be7eezayid malabaz gi, loythii be7adayis tusheko shiiqii yezin, Goda qaalar, <verse eid="ACT 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32"/>‹Taanii ne aditay, Afraame Xooss, Isaaqa Xooss, Yayqqooba Xooss› yeegttar Museko ye7eez. Muse yashshar kukkurii be7adayis danda7ekka.<verse eid="ACT 7:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33"/>«Goday Museko, ‹Neenii eqqeez biittay geeshshi maaqqeez gishos ne tokayid yez caamma kessoba. <verse eid="ACT 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34"/>Taanii Gibxxe yez ta asay un77intta be7eeza. U uufa si7ii unttan ashshodayis wodhdheeza. Yhatti yhana! Taanii nena Gibxxe kiittoda› yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35"/>«Isreelitay Muse, ‹Nena nuna haarizannee daynna ootheezay oonoo?› yeegii ixxeeza ye muse tushe gancce ees bentteez kiitanchchay baggar haarizannee ashshiza udii Xooss azazeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:14">Kes. 2:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36"/>Ye Muse Isra7eelita Gibxxe biittayir zoqo Abbannee liizho biittar oyttam layth malabazitannee orothabazita oothitar unttan kaalith keseeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:5">Kes. 7:5</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 14:21">14:21</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:33">Tay. 14:33</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37"/>«Isreele asayiko, ‹Xoossii tana dentheezay garkk yi sheeshay ganccepp ta garkk nabe yinttis denthoda› yeegeezay yha Muse.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Nam7i. 18:15</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 18:18">18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38"/>Liizho biitta shiiqeez Isreele asayira yezeezay, nu aditayirannee Siinna ambal afa ees odeez kiitanchchayira yezeez. Ye Muse de7o qaala nuus inggodayis ekkeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:1-20:17">Kes. 19:1—20:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:1-33">Nam7i. 5:1-33</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39"/>«Zin nu mayzitay Muses azazinttodayis koyekkaya; eza ixxii guye Gibxxe maaqqodayis amotteeza. <verse eid="ACT 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40"/>Ma Aaroonako, ‹Nuna kaalithiza Xoossita nuus oothoba. Abis giiko, yhayi nuna Gibxxepp ke7eez Muse, wayeezako nuunii erooya› yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:1">Kes. 32:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41"/>Ye wode ooggona aaziz eeqa ootheeza. Ye eeqayis yarshsho yarshsheez fa kusher ootheez oosayir ufaytteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:2-6">Kes. 32:2-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42"/>Zin Xoossii unttis zokko maheeza. Unttii salo xoolinttita goynnoday garkk unttan ashshii ashsheeza. Nabitay maxaafayid,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">«‹Isreele asitayyo, oyttam layth kunth</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">liizho biitta shukkeez mehennee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">yarshsheez yarshsha taas yarshsheenenee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:42-43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 5:25-27">Amo. 5:25-27</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43"/>Yi, yinttis goynnodayis kochcheez eeqanne Mooloke dunkkaana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">Refana giz yi Xoossa xoolintto misila tookkeeza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">Taanii yinttan Baabiloonepp</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">seko bagga dakkoda› ginttinttii xaafintteeza.<verse eid="ACT 7:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44"/>«Nu aditayis liizho biitta markka dunkkaanay yeza. Ezakka Xoossii Muse kiitteezannee e beezeezay garkk ootheeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:9">Kes. 25:9</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 25:40">40</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45"/>Ma nu aditay ye dunkkaana fa aditaypp ekkii Xooss tiina bayi7itheez Ayihude maaqqekka asay biitta aykkeez wode Iyyaasur woli ekkii geleeza. Ye dunkkaanay Dawute wode hellodayiskka ye gadayid yezeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 3:14-17">Iyya. 3:14-17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46"/>Dawute Xoossar sabintteeza. Ma Yayqqooba Xoossayis keeth keexxodayis Xoossa woosseeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:1-16">2 Sam. 7:1-16</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:1-14">1 Zeena. 17:1-14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47"/>Zin ees keeth keexxeezay Solomone.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:1-38">1 Kaat. 6:1-38</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 3:1-17">2 Zeena. 3:1-17</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48"/>«Hano zin, Ubbaypp afa Xoossay asii keexxeez keetha yezooya. Nabe geezay garkk,<verse eid="ACT 7:48"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49"/>«‹Salo ta zufaane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">sa7aykka ta tokay yedhdhiz aqo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Yeezin, taas yi ab garkk keeth keexxode?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">woy taanii shemppiza aqay aba yenee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:1-2">Isa. 66:1-2</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50"/>Yha ubba ootheezay ta kushe baasa?›</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 7:50">yeegiza Goday.<verse eid="ACT 7:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51"/>«Yi wayizii si7oowa aso? Yi wozinay Xooss qaala ekkodayis abis ixxeenee? Yi hayay abis tuleenee? Yi, yi aditaykka uba wode Geeshsha Ayyanara eqinttiza. <verse eid="ACT 7:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52"/>Nabitay ganccepp yi aditay bayi7eezay oonoo? Xillay ye7odana tiinatii odeezana wodheeza. Yhatti yi eza aathii inggii wodheeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 63:10">Isa. 63:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53"/>Yi kiitanchcha kushepp Xooss higga ekkeeza, zin kiitinttekkaya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 7:53"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Isxifaanose shuchchar cadintteeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54"/>Unttii yeya si7eez wode fa wozinayid Isxifaanosel afa gaame yilottii, fa achch dhaqii manddeeza. <verse eid="ACT 7:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55"/>Zin Isxifaanose Geeshsha Ayyanar kumii, salo udee bi7ii, Xooss bonchchonnee Yesuusa Xooss ushachch baggar eqqeezana be7eeza. <verse eid="ACT 7:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56"/>«Yeezako, taanii salo dooyinttin, As Na7ay, Xoossa ushachcha eqqeeza be7eeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 7:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57"/>Qaala dhoqq udii ukkittar, fa haya tuccii wola eeko woxxeeza <verse eid="ACT 7:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58"/>Eza katamaypp gaxa kessii, shuchchar caddeeza. Markkattii fa ma7a pettii Saa7oola giz na7atithay kale gaddeeza.<verse eid="ACT 7:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59"/>Isxifaanose, «Ta Goda Yesuusa, ta shemppa ekkoba» yeegii xeegodar unttii eza shuchchar cadeeza. <verse eid="ACT 7:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60"/>Bunqittii, fa qaala dhoqq udii, «Ta Godayyo, yha nagara unttis atto goba» yeegeeza. Yey geezapp maaqqii yhayqqeeza.<verse eid="ACT 7:60"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Saa7oola ammaniza asa bayi7eeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1"/>Saa7oola Isxifaanose yhayiqayid ma7intteeza. Ye gallas Yerusalaame yez woosa keetha gita bayi7ith denddeeza. Hawaaritay attin ammanizitay ubbay Yihuda biittannee Samaare biitta laalintteeza. <verse eid="ACT 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2"/>Pettii pettii Xooss asitay Isxifaanose moogeeza; ma ees iita yeekkeeza. <verse eid="ACT 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3"/>Zin Saa7oola woosa keeth dhabisodayis koyiza. Kara kara yuuyii gelii, ammaniza dhiirathitannee maachchita goochchii goochchii kessii achch kara gelsseeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 22:4-5">Haw. O. 22:4-5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26:9-11</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wonggilay Samaare sabbakintteeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4"/>Laalintteez ammanizitay yhanigeez aqo ubbayid qaala odeeza. <verse eid="ACT 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5"/>Filphoosa Samaare katama yhanigii Kiristtoosa bagga asayis odeeza. <verse eid="ACT 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6"/>Gaame asay Filphoosa geeza si7eez wodennee E oothiza malabazita be7eez wode eza akaakii si7eeza. <verse eid="ACT 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7"/>Tuna ayyanitay uukkii gaame asaypp kezeeza; ma gaame gundditaynnee wobbitay bili7intteeza. <verse eid="ACT 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8"/>Ye katamayid yez asay gaame ufaytteeza.<verse eid="ACT 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9"/>Zin Simoona giz pettii athay ye katamitte yeza. E, «Taanii gita gita asi» gi Samaare asa kaayor yhay malabaziyegisittar gam7eeza. <verse eid="ACT 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10"/>Xiqqapp aykkii damma hellodayis yez as ubbay, «Damma Xoossa wolqqay yhaya» gi eza si7eeza. <verse eid="ACT 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11"/>Gaame wodepp aykkii kaayor Samaare asa malabaz giseez gishos asay eza si7eeza. <verse eid="ACT 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12"/>Zin Filphoosa Xoossa kaatetithannee Yesuus Kiristtoosa sunthibagga dhiirathitayisnne maachchitayis odin, unttii ebaz ammanii xammaqintteeza. <verse eid="ACT 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13"/>Ma Simoonakka ammanii xammaqinttii Filphoosara wola yhanigii be7eezi baz ubbayidannee oosintteez gita malatita bi7ii malabaz geeza.<verse eid="ACT 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14"/>Yerusalaame yez hawaaritay Samaare asay Xooss qaala ekkeeza si7ii Phixiroosannee Waannisa unttiko dakkeeza. <verse eid="ACT 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15"/>Phixiroosannee Waannisa yhanigii, ammanizitay Geeshsha Ayyana ekkodaygarkk unttis Xoossa woosseeza. <verse eid="ACT 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16"/>Abis giiko, Samaare asitay Goda Yesuusa sunthar aadda xammaqintteenepp attin unttapp pettayil afakka Geeshsha Ayyana haga wodhdhekka. <verse eid="ACT 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17"/>Ye wode Phixiroosannee Waannisa fa kushe unttal afa gaddin, unttii Geeshsha Ayyana ekkeeza.<verse eid="ACT 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18"/>Hawaaritay fa kushe unttal afa gaddin, unttis Geeshsha Ayyanay inggintteeza Simoona be7eez wode Phixiroosasinnee Waannisas miishe ki7ii, <verse eid="ACT 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19"/>«Taanikka ta kushe gaddeez ubbay Geeshsha Ayyana ekkoday garkk yha mawute taasikka inggoytte» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20"/>Zin Phixiroosa eeko, «Neenii Xooss imota miisher woonggodayis qoppeezay gishos ne miishitir nena ekkii dhabo. <verse eid="ACT 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21"/>Ne wozinay Xooss tiina luulo maaqqekka gishos nees yhaydda shago woy qaada baaya. <verse eid="ACT 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22"/>Yikkee, yha ne wozina iitatithay gishos nagaraypp maaqqoba. Ne wozina yez iita qofa Xoossii atto goday garkk Goda woossoba. <verse eid="ACT 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23"/>Ne iita camo qinaaterannee nagara achcha yezaya taanii bi7iza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24"/>Simoona mahii, «Yi geezaypp pettakka tana hellaamay garkk taas goda woossoytta» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25"/>Phixiroosannee Waannisa markkatteezayppennee Goda qaala odeezaypp guye Yerusalaame maaqqeeza. Samaare yez gaame heera Wonggile odeeza.<verse eid="ACT 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Filphoosa Tophphe zhandarbana xammaqeez</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26"/>Goda kiitanchchay Filphoosako, «Denddii sulle baggar Yerusalaamepp Gaaza kanggiza liizho biita ogayko yhanigoba» yeegeeza. <verse eid="ACT 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27"/>Filphoosa denddii qiteeza. Hinddeke giz Tophphe kaatatis I miisha ubba naagiza Tophphe as yeza. Eekka goynnodayis Yerusalaame qiteeza. <verse eid="ACT 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28"/>Gaarel bettii, Yerusalaamepp fa biitta maaqqittar nabe Isiyaasa maxaafe nabbabiza.<verse eid="ACT 8:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29"/>Geeshsha Ayyanay Filphoosako, «Ye gaarayko yhanigii kale shiiqoba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30"/>Yeezin Filphoosa woxxii yhanigii hellodar zhandarbay nabe Isiyaasa maxaafe nabbabodar si7ii, «Ne nabbabizay nees gelinee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31"/>Zhandarbay, «Tana tamarisiza as baazin wayizii gelode?» yeegeeza. Gaarel kezii bettoday garkk Filphoosa woosseeza. <verse eid="ACT 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32"/>Zhandarbay nabbabiza maxaafay kifilay yhaya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:32-33 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 53:7-8">Isa. 53:7-8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>«E dur garkk shukinttodayis laagintteeza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">Duri na7a fa ikisa meedizitay tiina si77i gizay garkk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">eekka fa doona dooyekkaya.<verse eid="ACT 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33"/>E kawuzheeza; ees geeshsh pirddakka dhabeeza.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">E yessay yha sa7aypp gachintteez gishos</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">e sheeshibagga oonoo ododay?» yeegiza.<verse eid="ACT 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34"/>Zhandarbay mahii Filphoosako, «Nabe obaz odee? Fa bagga odinenee hara asibaz odee? Taas odooye» yeegeeza. <verse eid="ACT 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35"/>Filphoosa mahii, Xooss qaala ye aqaypp aykkii, Yesuusa bagga odiza Wonggile ees odeeza.<verse eid="ACT 8:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36"/>Unttii yhanigttar haathii yeza aqo helleeza. Zhandarbay, «Haathe yhaya bo7oba; ta xammaqinttamay garkk abi kaye?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 8:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37"/>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">8:37 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Pettii pettii birana maxaafitay payido 37 yez qopa gujjiza zin binii maxiftay gujjooya</char>
    </note>Filphoosa eeko, «Neenii ne kunith wozinaypp ammaniko danda7iza» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:37">E mahii, «Yesuus Kiristtoos Xoossa Na7a maaqqeezana taanii ammaniza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 8:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38"/>Gaaray eqqod garkk zhandarbay kiittin, nam7ay wodhdhii haatha geleeza; Filphoosa eza xammaqeeza. <verse eid="ACT 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39"/>Unttii haathapp gaxa kezeezan garkk Goda Ayyanay Filphoosa qoppekkazin ekkeeza. Nam7intha zhandarbay Filphoosa be7ekkaya, zin fa oga ufayttittar qiteeza. <verse eid="ACT 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40"/>Filphoosa Azaaxona oleeza. Ma Qisaare ye7oda hellodayis katamitayir yuuyii Wonggile markkatteeza.<verse eid="ACT 8:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Saa7oola ammaneeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">Haw. O. 22:6-16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26:12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1"/>Ye wode Saa7oola Goda kaalizita wodhodayis mandditar qeese halaqitayiko yhanigeez. <verse eid="ACT 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2"/>Goda oge kaalliza dhiirathitannee maachchita denggiko, accii Yerusalaame ko7odayis, Damasqqo yez Ayihude Woosa Keethitayis dabddaabbe xaafinttoday garkk eza woosseeza.<verse eid="ACT 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3"/>E yhanigii, Damasqqo katama hellodayis ukkodar, qoppekka salopp wolqqama poo7o e yuushayir poo7eeza. <verse eid="ACT 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4"/>E sa7a pokkeezazin, «Saa7oola, Saa7oola, abis tana bayithinnee?» giz qaala si7eeza.<verse eid="ACT 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5"/>Saa7oola, «Godayyo, ne oonoo?» yeegii oycceez.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:5">«Taanii, ne bayi7ith Yesuusa» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6"/>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">9:6 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Pettii pettii maxaapitay kukkuritarannee malabaz giitara yeegizanno gujjiza</char>
    </note>Goday eeko, «Denddii katama geloba; ne oothodayis beezizabaza ezayid nees odinttoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7"/>Saa7oolara oge yhanigiz asitay akkokka odinttekka eqqii atteeza. Giirth si7inttiza, zin oonakka benttowa. <verse eid="ACT 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8"/>Saa7oola pokkeez aqaypp denddii be7adar e aafay denggaam ixeeza. Yey gishos, unttii e kushayid aykkii kaalithii Damasqqo gelseeza. <verse eid="ACT 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9"/>Hayidzii gallas hellodayis E be7adayis danda7ekka; akkokka meekkaya; uzhekkaya.<verse eid="ACT 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10"/>Damasqqo pettii Hanana giz Yesuusa tamaaray yeza. Goday qoncithar, «Hananaa» yeegii xeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:10">Hananee mahii, «Ta Godayyo, ta yhaydda yeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11"/>Goday eeko, «Denddii luulo ginttinttiz oge yhanigii, Yihuda kara Saa7oola giz xersesepp ye7eez woos woossiz atha koyoba. <verse eid="ACT 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12"/>Ma Hanana ginttiz athay gelii, Saa7oola nam7intho be7aday garkk fa kushe ezal afa gaddodar qoncithar be7eeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13"/>Hanana mahii, «Godayyo, Yerusalaame ne geeshsh asayil afa ye athay ab garkk iita baz ootheezako taanii gaame asaypp si7eeza. <verse eid="ACT 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14"/>Ma Damasqqo ne suntha xeegizita ubba accodayis, qeese halaqitay ees mawute inggeeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15"/>Zin Goday eeko, «Saa7oola Ayihude maaqqekka asay tiina, kaatitay tiinannee Isreele asay tiina, ta suntha ersodayisnnee taas oothoayis maraxintteez miisha maaqqeez gishos ne eeko yhanigoba. <verse eid="ACT 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16"/>Abis giiko, ta sunthay gishos E waafa waaye ekkodayis beezizako taanii eza beezoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17"/>Hananee yhanigii, kara gelii, fa kushe Saa7oolal afa gaddii, «Ta isha Saa7oola, ne ye7eez ogayil nees bentteez Goda Yesuusa, ne be7aday garkkennee Geeshsha Ayyanar kumoday garkk tana azazeeza» yeegeeza. <verse eid="ACT 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18"/>Ellisii, Saa7oola aafaypp pettii puqo garkkezibazay wodhdhin, Saa7oola nam7intho be7eeza. Ma denddii xammaqintteeza. <verse eid="ACT 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19"/>Katha mi miinggeeza, Damasqqo yez ammanizitayir xiqqa gallas gam7eeza.<verse eid="ACT 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Saa7oola Damasqqo taamarsseeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20"/>Ellisii Saa7oola, «Yesuusa Xooss Na7a» yeegii Damasqqo yez Ayihude Woosa Keethitayid qaala taamarsseeza.<verse eid="ACT 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21"/>Yeya si7eez ubbay malabaz gi, «Yhay Yerusalaame Yesuusa suntha xeegizita dhabisiza baasannee? Ma yhana ye7eezay unttan accii, qeese halaqitay tiina kanggodayis baasannee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22"/>Zin Saa7oola qaala odor minggittar minggittar yhanigeeza. Yesuusa, E Kiristtoosa maaqqeezana milxxi udii odeez gishos Damasqqo yez Ayihuditay ees mahodibaz dhabeeza.<verse eid="ACT 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23"/>Gaame gallasapp guye Ayihuditay shiiqii, Saa7oola wodhodayis tobbeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:23-25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:32-33">2 Qor. 11:32-33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24"/>Zin Ayihuditay fana wodhodayis qoppeeza Saa7oola si7eeza. Unttii eza wodhodayis qammannee gallas katama penge naagiza. <verse eid="ACT 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25"/>Zin e tamaaritay eza qamma kanggii, gimbbe gase lukor daachchora wodhiseeza.<verse eid="ACT 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Saa7oola Yerusalaame taamarsseeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26"/>Saa7oola Yerusalaame helleez wode ammanizitayir walakinttodayis koyeeza. Zin E Kiristtoosa ammaneezay unttis tuma aazam ixxin ees yashitteeza. <verse eid="ACT 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27"/>Zin Barnnabaasa Saa7oola hawaaritayko kanggeez. Ogel Goday wayizii qoncceezakonnee nashsheezako, ma Saa7oola Damasqqo Yesuusa sunthayir yashittekka wayizii qaala odeezako unttis geeshshii odeeza. <verse eid="ACT 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28"/>Saa7oola Yerusalaame wutii Goday sunthayir yashittekka qaala odittar, hawaaritayira wolla yeza. <verse eid="ACT 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29"/>Ma Saa7oola Girike qaala odeez Ayihuditayra odinttittar palamiza. Zin unttii eza wodhodayis koyeeza. <verse eid="ACT 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30"/>Ammaniza asitay yeya si7ii, Saa7oola Qisaare kanggii Tersese dakkeeza.<verse eid="ACT 9:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31"/>Yihuda, Galilarannee Samaare ubbayid yez woosa keethitay saror yezeeza. Ma miinggeeza; Godayis yashittittar Geeshsha Ayyana minthathor gaanggii gaanggii yhanigeeza.<verse eid="ACT 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phixiroosa Liidarannee Yoophphe taamarsseeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32"/>Phixiroosa gade ubba yuuyttar Liida yez ammaniza asitayko helleeza. <verse eid="ACT 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33"/>Ezayid hosppun layth muda silii arssal woyi7ii yez Eeniya giz atha denggeeza. <verse eid="ACT 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34"/>Phixiroosa, «Eeniya, Yesuus Kiristtoosa nena pathiza; denddii ne hiixa denthoba» yeegeeza. Eekka ellisii denddii eqqeeza. <verse eid="ACT 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35"/>Liidarannee Saarona yez as ubbay Eeniya bi7ii, Godayiko maaqqeeza.<verse eid="ACT 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36"/>Yoophphe katama pettii Xaabito ginttiz ammaniza asita yeza. (Xaabito guussay gen7e guussii) Iza fa yeza wode ubbayid lo77o baz oothitarannee manqqita maaddittar yezeeza. <verse eid="ACT 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37"/>Ye wode iza hargginttii yhayqqin, asay I aha meeccii, pooqeel afa kessii woyitheeza. <verse eid="ACT 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38"/>Liida Yoophphes kale yeza. Ammanizitay Phixiroosa Liida yeza si7ii, «Hayyana nuuko ellisii ye7oba» yeegiz kiita nam77ii asita eeko azazeeza.<verse eid="ACT 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39"/>Yey gishos, Phixiroosa denddii, unttara yhanigeeza. Hellii, pooqeel afa yez kifile eza gelseeza. Am7itay Phixiroosa kalayir eqqii yeekkittar Dorqqa unttara paxa yezar ootheez qamisitannee afilita ubba Phixiroosa beezeeza. <verse eid="ACT 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40"/>Phixiroosa unttan ubba bale kessii, gulbatii Xoossa woosseeza. Ma ahayko maaqqii, «Xaabite, denddoba» yeegeeza. Xaabita fa aafa dooyii Phixiroosa bi7ii, denddii betteeza. <verse eid="ACT 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41"/>Phixiroosa izo fa kusher maaddii denthii esseeza. Yeypp guye, ammanizitannee ami7ta xeegii, denddeezano u tiina ke7eeza.<verse eid="ACT 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42"/>Yha oday Yoophphe katama ubba helleeza. Gaame asay Goda ammaneeza. <verse eid="ACT 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43"/>Phixiroosa Yoophphe Simoona giz degelay kara unddenna gallas gam7eeza.<verse eid="ACT 9:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Phixiroosarannee Qornnelosara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1"/>Qisaare, «Xaale ola asitay cuga» ginttinttiz ola asitay gancce pettii Qorineloosa ginttinttiz mato halaqay yeza. <verse eid="ACT 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2"/>Qorineloosa fa kara asayira Xoossa miinthii ammaniza asinnee Xoossa goynniza as. Ayihude manqqitakka gaame maaddiza, ma Xoossa ubba wode woossiza. <verse eid="ACT 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3"/>Pettii gallas uddufun saate heera Xooss kiitanchchay eeko yi7ii, «Qornneloosaa» gi xeegodar E qoncithar geeshshii be7eeza.<verse eid="ACT 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4"/>Qorineloosa dagammii kiitanchcha toli udii bi7ii, «Godayyo, abba?» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:4">Kiitanchchay mahii, «Ne woosannee manqqita ne maaddizay Xooss tiina qofintteeza. <verse eid="ACT 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5"/>Yhatti Yoophphe as kiittii, Phixiroosa giz Simoona ki7isoba. <verse eid="ACT 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6"/>Phixiroosa abba kaler degela Simoona kara imathetithi betteeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7"/>Qorineloosa paas odeez kiitanchchay yhanigin, fa ayllitaypp nam7itannee Xooss goynniza fa kale wotaaddaritaypp petta xeegii, <verse eid="ACT 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8"/>Unttis ubba baz odii Yoophphe azazeeza.<verse eid="ACT 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9"/>Wonttitha gallas unttii yhanigii, Yoophphe katama ukkodar usuppun saate heera Xooss woossodayis Phixiroosa pooqeel afa kezeeza. <verse eid="ACT 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10"/>E nayinttii kath maadayis koyeez, zin katha kaxxodar E ahumo be7eeza. <verse eid="ACT 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11"/>Salo dooyinttin, damma afila aazizabaz oyddii baggar aykkinttii wodhdhodar E be7eeza. <verse eid="ACT 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12"/>Ezayid oyddii toker yez mehitay, wora do7ita, ulora goochinttiza medhetithaynnee salo kafita ubbay yeza. <verse eid="ACT 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13"/>Ye wode «Phixiroosa, denddii eqqii shukkii mooba» giz qaala eeko ye7eez.<verse eid="ACT 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14"/>Zin Phixiroosa, «Godayyo, wa77a! Ta tuna baz ubbarakka mi eroowa» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15"/>Ma, «Xoossay geeshsheeza neenii tuna giipe» giz qaala nam7intho eeko ye7eez. <verse eid="ACT 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16"/>Yeykka, hayidzii toke haneezaypp guye ye gita afila aazizay ellisii udee salo ekintteeza.<verse eid="ACT 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17"/>Phixiroosa fa be7eez qoncithayis bili7ithay, «Ab maaqqadeshsha?» gi fa wozinar qoppodar, Qorineloosa kiitteez asitay Simoona kara oyicichi denggii baler eqqeeza. <verse eid="ACT 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18"/>Fa qaala u dhoqq udii, «Phixiroosa ginttiz Simoona imathay yhaydda yenee?» yeegii oyceeza.<verse eid="ACT 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19"/>Phixiroosa qoncithar be7eezi baza qopithal afa yezin, Geeshsha Ayyana eeko, «Yeezako, hayidzii asitay nena koyiza. <verse eid="ACT 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20"/>Denddii wodhdhoba, taanii unttan kiitteez gishos se7ekka unttar yhanigoba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21"/>Phixiroosa asitayko wodhdhii, «Yi koyizay tanannee; yi abis ye7eenee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22"/>Unttii mahii, «Nuna mato halaqay Qorineloosa azazeeza. E geeshsh, Xoossa goynniza asinnee Ayihude as ubbayid gaame bonchchintteez as. Qorineloosa, nena fa kara kanggii qaala neepp si7oday garkk geeshsha kiitanchchay ees odeeza» yeegeeza. <verse eid="ACT 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23"/>Phixiroosa asita kara gelssii mokkeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Wonttitha gallas, denddii unttara qiteeza. Yoophphe katama yez ammanizitaypp pettay pettay ezar wolla yhanigeeza. <verse eid="ACT 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24"/>Wonttitha gallas, Qisaare helleeza. Qorineloosa fa iginttannee fa laggita pettipp xeegii shiishii, Phixiroosa naagiza. <verse eid="ACT 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25"/>Phixiroosa kara gelod hanodar, Qorineloosa eza hellii e tiina xuggunii ees goynnodayis koyeeza. <verse eid="ACT 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26"/>Zin Phixiroosa, «Denddoba, taakka ta ommas ne garkk as» yeegii eza dentheeza.<verse eid="ACT 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27"/>Phixiroosa Qornneloosar odeinttinttar kara gelodar gaamay asay shiiqeeza denggeeza. <verse eid="ACT 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28"/>E asayiko, «Ayihude as hara gader pettipodayis woy woli hellodayis woga baza yi eriza. Zin taanii oonakka tuna woy geeshshi baaya gaamay garkk Xooss tana beezeeza. <verse eid="ACT 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29"/>Yey gishos, yi taako kiittin ixo bayth ye7eeza. Yhatti tana abis xeegiseezako taas odoytta» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30"/>Qorineloosa, «Taanii yhayino oyddii gallasapp tiina yhannontte uddufun saate woosa woosodar, phooliz ma7o ma77eez as ta tiina eqqeeza. <verse eid="ACT 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31"/>E taako, ‹Qorineloosa, Xoossii ne woosa si7eeza, neenii manqqita maaddeezanakka qoppeeza. <verse eid="ACT 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32"/>Yikkee, as Yoophphe kiittii, Simoon Phixiroosa giza xeegisoba. E, Simoona giz degela athay kara aba doonar betteeza› yeegeeza. <verse eid="ACT 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33"/>Yey gishos, taanii neeko ellisii kiiteeza; ne yi7ithayir lo77o ootheeza. Yikkee, Xoossii nena Kiitteezibaz ubba si7odayis yhatti nuunii ubbay yhaydda Goday tiina yeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phixiroosa nashsha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34"/>Kaallikka, Phixiroosa, «Xoossii as sino bi7ii asapp ase shaakkooya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Nam7i. 10:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35"/>Zini duma duma biitta as ubba oona maaqqikokka paas yashittizannee xillo ooso oothizayid Xoossii ufayttiza taanii tuma akaakeeza. <verse eid="ACT 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36"/>Xoossay, ubba Goda maaqqeez Yesuus Kiristtoosa baggar sarotith odittar yha Wonggila Isreele asayis azazeeza yi eriza. <verse eid="ACT 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37"/>Waannisa xinqqatebagga sabbakeezaypp aykkii Galilapp aykkii Yihuda biita ubba hellodayis haneezibaza yi eriza. <verse eid="ACT 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38"/>Xoossii Naazirete Yesuusana Geesha Ayyanar tizheezannee wolqqa inggeeza. Xoossii eza yez gishos lo77o baz oothittar harggintteezita pathitarannee Xalahe kushe haarintteez ubba kessittar yuuyeeza.<verse eid="ACT 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39"/>«Ayihude biittannee Yerusalaame E ootheez ubba bazayis nuunii markkitta. Unttii mazqalel afa sottii eza wodheeza. <verse eid="ACT 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40"/>Zin Xoossii hayidzintha gallas yhayiqopp eza denthii asayis benttoday garkk udeeza. <verse eid="ACT 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41"/>Ye benttithay Xooss tiina maraxeez ees markka maaqqeez nuus markkatizapp attin as ubbayis baaya. E yhayiqopp denddeezaypp guye nuur meezannee uzheeza. <verse eid="ACT 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42"/>Nuunii Wonggile asayis ododay garkkennee paxa yezital afannee yhayqqeezitayil afa pirddodayis Xoossii shuumeezay Yesuusa maaqqeezana markkattoday garkk nuna azazeeza. <verse eid="ACT 10:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43"/>Xooss ammaniza ubbay nagaray, e sunthayir atto ginttinttiza nabitay markkatiza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 10:43"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayihude maaqqekka asitay ammanii Geeshsha Ayyana ekkeeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44"/>Phixiroosa haga oda haasekkazin qaala si7odar ubbayil afa Geeshsha Ayyana goggeeza. <verse eid="ACT 10:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45"/>Phixiroosar Yoophphepp ye7eez ammaniza dookalintteez Ayihude ubbay, Ayihude baazitalakka Geeshsha Ayyana gogeez gishos malabaz geeza. <verse eid="ACT 10:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46"/>Yeya godayis danda7eeza, unttii duma duma doonar nashshittarannee Xoossa galatodar si7eez gishosi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:46">Ye wode Phixiroosa mahii, <verse eid="ACT 10:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47"/>«Yeyitititay ma nugarkk Geeshsha Ayyana ekkeezitay haathar xammaqinttamay garkk kayoday danda7izay oonoo?» yeegeeza. <verse eid="ACT 10:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48"/>Unttii Yesuus Kiristtoosa sunthayir xammaqinttoday garkk unttan azazeeza. Yeypp guye, unttii paar xiqqa gallas bettoday garkk Phixiroosana woosseeza.<verse eid="ACT 10:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Phixiroosa fa ootheezibaza Yerusalaame woosa keethis odeeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1"/>Hawaaritayinnee Yihuda yez ammanizitay, Ayihude baazitaykka Xoossa qaala ekkeeza si7eeza. <verse eid="ACT 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2"/>Phixiroosa Yerusalaame yhanigeez wode dookalintteez ammanizitay, <verse eid="ACT 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3"/>eeko, «Neenii dookalinttekkazityiko gelii unttara katha abis meenee?» yeegii falameeza.<verse eid="ACT 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4"/>Zin Phixiroosa haneezibaz tiinapp aykkii maarar odeeza: <verse eid="ACT 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5"/>«Taanii Yoophphe katama Xooss woossittar ajuuta be7eeza. Damma afila aazizabaz oyddii baggar aykkinttii salopp wodhdhittar taako ye7eez. <verse eid="ACT 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6"/>Taanii dakkii be7adar oyddii toker yez mehita, wora do7ita, ulora goochinttiza medhetithitannee salo kafita be7eeza. <verse eid="ACT 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7"/>‹Phixiroosa, denddoba, shukkii mooba› giz qaala si7eeza.<verse eid="ACT 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8"/>«Zini taanii, ‹Godayyo, wa77a, tuna baz woy geezhekkabaz ubbarakka ta doonako helii erooya› yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9"/>«‹Xoossay geeshsheeza neenii tuna giipe› yeegiz qaala nam7intho salopp ye7eez.<verse eid="ACT 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10"/>«Yey hayidzii toke haneeza, mahii ubbay salo fud ekintteeza. <verse eid="ACT 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11"/>Ye saatatekka hayidzii asitay Qisaarepp taako kiitinttii taanii yez kara helleeza. <verse eid="ACT 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12"/>Sidhekkazar unttara yhammadaygarkk Ayyana taas odeeza. Ma yha usuppun ishitay Yoophphepp taara Qisaare yhanigeezitayir Qorineloosa kara geleeza. <verse eid="ACT 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13"/>Kiitanchchay e kara gancce eqqii, ‹Yoophphe kiittii Phixiroosa ginttinttiz Simoona xeegisoba. <verse eid="ACT 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14"/>Nenannee ne kara as ubba ashshiza qaala E nees ododa› geezana Qorineloosa nuus odeeza.<verse eid="ACT 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15"/>«Taanii nashsha aykkodar Geeshsha Ayyana tiin nuul afa wodhdheezay garkk unttal afakka wodhdheeza. <verse eid="ACT 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16"/>Ye wode ‹Waannisa haathar xammaqeeza, zin yi Geeshsha Ayyanar xammaqinttoda› yeegeez Goda qaalay taas qopintteeza. <verse eid="ACT 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17"/>Xoossay nuus Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa ammaneezitayis inggeez imota izo Ayihude baazitayisikka inggiko, yeezin Xoossa kayodayis taanii oonoo?» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:5">Haw. O. 1:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18"/>Unttii yeya si7eez wode fa palama ashshii, «Yeya maaqqiko, Xoossay Ayihude baazitaykka nagarapp maaqqii de7o yezoday garkk maaroteth inggeeza» yeegii Xooss galateeza.<verse eid="ACT 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Anxooka woosa keeth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19"/>Isxefaanoosana yhayiqos heltheez bay7ithaypp denddeezayid laalintteez ammanizitay qaala Ayihuditay aaddas odittar pinqqe, Qoophiroosannee Anxooka hellodayis yuuyeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:1-4">Haw. O. 8:1-4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20"/>Zin Qoophiroosappennee Qerenapp ye7eez pettii pettii ammaniza asitay Anxooka yhanigii, Goda Yesuusa Wonggile Girike asayiskka odeeza. <verse eid="ACT 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21"/>Goda wolqqay unttara yeza; ma gaame asay ammanii Godayikko maaqqeeza.<verse eid="ACT 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22"/>Ye oda Yerusalaame yez woosa keethay si7eez gishos Barnnabaasana Anxooka azazeeza. <verse eid="ACT 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23"/>Barnnabaasa Anxooka yhanigeez wode Xoossii fa aadho kehetithaypp fa woyayis wayizii inggeezako bi7ii ufaytteeza. Unttii ubbay fa kunth wozinar Godayil miinggii yezoday garkk unttan zoreezay: <verse eid="ACT 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24"/>Barnnabaasa Geesha Ayyanarannee ammanor kumeez keeha as maaqqeez gishosii. Gaame asaykka Goda ammaneeza.<verse eid="ACT 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25"/>Yeypp guye, Barnnabaasa Saa7oola koyodayis Xerseese qiteeza. <verse eid="ACT 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26"/>Ezayid Saa7oola denggii Anxooka ekkii ye7eeza. Barnnabaasannee Saa7oola woosa keetha asayira laythi muda bettii gaame asa taamarsseeza. Ammanizitay Anxooka «Kiristtaane» ginttinttii tiina xeegintteeza.<verse eid="ACT 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27"/>Ye wode pettii pettii nabitay Yerusalaamepp Anxooka wodhdheeza. <verse eid="ACT 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28"/>U ganccepp Agaboosa gizay denddii gade ubbayil iita naye dendodana Ayyana wolqqar tinbbite odeeza. Yeyi haneezay Oroome Kaatay Qalawudoosa wodaydda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:10">Haw. O. 21:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29"/>Ammanizitay ommar ommar fa wolqqay garkk miishe kessii Yihuda yez ammanizitayis maadee dakkodayis qofa acceeza. <verse eid="ACT 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30"/>Unttii yey garkk udii, miisha Barnnabaasalannee Saa7oolal woosa keeth cimitayis dakkeeza.<verse eid="ACT 11:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Woosa keethal afa dendeez wolqqama bayi7ithii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1"/>Ye wode Kaatay Herodoosa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Kaatay Herodoosa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yhay kaatay Heroodos, damma Herodoosa Agripha gizay E, 37-44 Maarotitha Laytha hellodayis haareeza. E kaat Heroodosas na7a na7a</char></note> woosa keeth asaypp bagga bayithi aykkeeza. <verse eid="ACT 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2"/>Waannisa isha Yayqqooba mashshar wodhiseeza. <verse eid="ACT 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3"/>Yey Ayihudita ufaysseezana bi7ii, gujjii Phixiroosanakka aytheeza. Yey haneezay boora Baale bonchchiza gallasitayida. <verse eid="ACT 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4"/>Phixiroosana aykkii acceeza. Paaziqa bonchchiza gallasitaypp guye woya tiina eza kessodayis qoppii, oyddii oyddii wotaaddaritay oyddii aqo naagizitay eza naagoday garkk aathii inggeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Kes. 12:1-27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5"/>Yey gishos, Phixiroosa achch kara naaginttiza. Zin woosa keeth asay ees miinthii Xooss woossiza.<verse eid="ACT 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiitanchchay Phixiroosana achch karapp kesseeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6"/>Herodoosa Phixiroosana woya tiina shiishodaypp tiina qamma Phixiroosa nam7i baggar nam7ii wotaaddaritay gancce santhalaater acinttii gentteeza. Naagizitay achch karay pengitayid eqqii naagiza. <verse eid="ACT 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7"/>Qoppekkazin Goda kiitanchchay qoncceeza. Achch karayid poo7o poo7eeza. Kiitanchchay Phixiroosa miyya bochchii barkkithii «Elle denddoba» yeegeeza. Izirakka santhalaatay e kushaypp wodhdheeza. <verse eid="ACT 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8"/>Kiitanchchay eeko, «Ne ma7a ma77oba, ne caammakka aathoba» yeegeeza. Phixiroosa yey garkk ootheeza; kiitanchchay, «Ne afar ma77iz ma7a ma77ii tana kaalloba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9"/>Phixiroosa achch karapp kezii kiitanchcha kaalleeza. Ees ahumo bi7izay garkk aazizapp attin kiitanchchay oothizabazay tuma aazekkaya. <verse eid="ACT 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10"/>Kiitanchchayirannee Phixiroosara tiinasannee nam7intho wotaaddara aadhii katama kanggiza biraata pengayiko helleeza. Pengaykka unttis fa aaddas dooyintteeza. Unttii kezii pettii husa ogel kezeezan garkk qoppekkazin kiitanchchay Phixiroosapp shaakintteeza.<verse eid="ACT 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11"/>Phixiroosas wozina maaqqin, «Ta Goday fa kiitanchcha kiittii, Herodoosa kusheppennee naagii betteez Ayihude as ubbaypp ashsheezana yhatti tuma ta ereeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12"/>E yeya akaakeez wode gaame asay pettipp shiiqii Xoossa woossiza aqa, Marqqoosa giz Waannisa indat Mayramii kara yhanigeeza. <verse eid="ACT 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13"/>Ezayid baler eqqii xeegeeza. Pettii Rooda giz ooso asita penga ees dooyodayis ye7eeza. <verse eid="ACT 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14"/>Rooda Phixiroosa qaala maaqqeezana erii ufayisar kumii gazara dooyoda ashshii guye woxxii yhanigii, «Phixiroosa bale eqqeeza» yeegii asayis odeeza.<verse eid="ACT 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15"/>Asay iiko, «Neenii eeyinnee!» yeegeeza. Rooda Phixiroosa maaqqeeza geeshshii odeeza. Unttii, «Yey E kiitanchcha» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16"/>Zin Phixiroosa baler eqqii xeessi ashshaam ixxin asay gazara dooyii eza bi7ii malabaz geeza. <verse eid="ACT 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17"/>Zin unttii si77i goday garkk Phixiroosa fa kushayir mallii Goday achch keethaypp eza wayizii kesseezako unttis qonccisii odii, «Yhaya Yayqqoobasinnee ammaniza asayis odoytta» gi ezaypp kezii hara aqo qiteeza.<verse eid="ACT 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18"/>Sa7a wonttodar «Phixiroosa ana qiteenee» gi wotaaddaritay woli gancce gaame walaseeza. <verse eid="ACT 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19"/>Herodoosa Phixiroosa koyisin, E benttekazay gishos naagizita qurii, unttan wodhoday garkk azazeeza. Yeypp guye, Herodoosa Yihudapp Qisaare wodhdhii ezayid xiqqa wode betteeza.<verse eid="ACT 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Herodoosa yhayiqo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20"/>Herodoosa Xiroosa asayirannee Sidoona asayir wola morkke. Unttii biittay katha Herodoosa biittapp denggiza gishos unttii pettipp maaqqii e zhandarba Bilasxoosa paas cima udii dabbotodayis Heroodosakko yhanigeeza.<verse eid="ACT 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21"/>Herodoosa suntheez gallas fa kaatetith afila ma77ii, zufaanayil afa bettii asayis odeeza. <verse eid="ACT 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22"/>Asay, «Yey Xooss qaala, as qaala baaya» yeegii uukkeeza. <verse eid="ACT 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23"/>Herodoosa Xoossa bonchchekka gishos izira Goda kiitanchchay eza shocin guxiner minttinttii yhayqqeeza.<verse eid="ACT 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24"/>Zin Xooss qaalay diccittarannee dalggittar kiiteeza.<verse eid="ACT 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25"/>Barnnabaasannee Saa7oola fa oosa polii Marqqoosa giz Waannisa paar ekkii Yerusalaamepp maaqqeeza.<verse eid="ACT 12:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Barnnabaasannee Saa7oola kiitintteeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1"/>Anxooka yez woosa keetha nabitayinnee asitamaaritay yeza. Unttii Barnnabaasa, Karith ginttinttiz Simoona, Qerenapp ye7eez Lukosa, Kaatay Heroodisara dicceez Minaahennee Saa7oola. <verse eid="ACT 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2"/>Unttii Goda goynnitarannee xoomitarannee Geeshsha Ayyanay, «Taanii xeegeez oosayis Barnnabaasannee Saa7oola taas shagoytta» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3"/>Yey gishos, unttii xoomeezappennee woosseezaypp guye fa kushayid unttal afa gaddii woossii dakkeeza.<verse eid="ACT 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Barnnabaasannee Saa7oola Qoophiroosa yhanigeeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4"/>Yey gishos, Geeshsha Ayyana unttana azazeeza. Selewuqe yhanigeeza; ezaypp markkabe gelii Qoophiroosa haathar teqintteez biita yhanigeeza. <verse eid="ACT 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5"/>Unttii Silmmana hellii Ayihude Woosa Keethitayid Xooss qaala odeeza. Waannisa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:5 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Waannisa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yha aqa xaafintteez Waannisa, hawaare Waannisa baazin Waannisa Marqqoosa ginttinttiz Marqqoosa Wonggile xaafeezaya.</char></note> maaddittar unttar yeza.<verse eid="ACT 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6"/>Unttii Qoophiroosa haathar teqintteez biitta kanthii Phaafu heliza wode pettii worddo nabe Bar-Yesuusa giz Ayihude ammita denggeeza. <verse eid="ACT 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7"/>Ye ammitay gade aqisiz Sarggosa Phawuloosa giz wozinaama athayira yeza. Sarggosa Phawuloosa Barnabaasanne Saa7oola faako xeegii Xooss qaala si7odayis koyeeza. <verse eid="ACT 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8"/>Zin Girike doonar ammitay sunthay «Elimmaasa» bilthay gade haarizay ammanamay garkk kayodayis koyii Barnabaasarannee Phawuloosar eqintteeza.<verse eid="ACT 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9"/>Zin Phawuloosa giz Saa7oola Geeshsha Ayyanar kumii ammitana dakkii bi7ii, <verse eid="ACT 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10"/>«Naati, Xalahe na7ayyo, iitatith ubbay kumeezayo, xillotith ubbayis morkkayo, luule Goda oga mirqiza ashshaamo? <verse eid="ACT 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11"/>Yeezako, yhatti Goday kach kushay neell afa yeza. Neenii qooqe maaqqoda; xiqqa wodes awa poo7o be7aamii» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:11">Izir cagganannee dhuma e aafa goozin, fa kushayid aykkii kaalithiza as koyttar yuuyeeza. <verse eid="ACT 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12"/>Gade haarizay yeya be7eez wode Godaabaz tamaarssizayid malabaz gi ammaneeza.<verse eid="ACT 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Barnnabaasannee Phawuloosa Phisida Anxooka yhanigeeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13"/>Phawuloosannee ezar yezitay Phaafupp denddii, Phinfila yez Phergge markkaber yhanigeeza. Waannisa unttapp shaakinttii Yerusalaame maaqqeeza. <verse eid="ACT 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14"/>Zin unttii Pherggepp aadhii Phisida yez Anxooka helleeza. Maala gallas gallas Ayihude Woosa Keeth gelii betteeza. <verse eid="ACT 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15"/>Muse higgayid nabitay maxaafay nabbabintteezaypp guye Ayihude Woosa Keeth halaqitay, «Nu ishuntho, as minthathiza qaala yinttis yezako asayis odoytte» yeegii unttiko azazeeza.<verse eid="ACT 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16"/>Phawuloosa denddii eqqii fa kusher mallii, «Isreele asitannee, Xoossa goynniza Ayihude maaqqekka asayyo, si7oytta. <verse eid="ACT 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17"/>Yha Isreele asa Xoossay, nu mayzita dooreeza. Gibxxe biitta imathatithar unttii yezin, unttan gaanthii fa gita wolqqar Gibxxe biittapp kesseeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:7">Kes. 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 12:51">Kes. 12:51</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18"/>Liizho biitta oyttam layth maaqqoda unttan danda7eeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:34">Tay. 14:34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 1:31">Nam7i. 1:31</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19"/>Kan7aane biitta Ayihude maaqqekka laappun kaatetithita haasii u biitta fa asa laatiseeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:1">Nam7i. 7:1</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 14:1">Iyya. 14:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20"/>Yeyi ubbay oydd xeetannee ishatam maaqqad layth gancce haneeza. Yeypp guye nabe Sami7eela wode hellodayis daynnitay aqisoday garkk inggeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 2:16">Nam7i. 2:16</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 3:20">1 Sam. 3:20</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21"/>«Yeypp guye, unttii paas kaat inggoday garkk woossin, Xoossii Biiname sheeshaypp Qiise na7a, Saa7oola oyttam laythi kawutoday garkk unttis inggeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 8:5">1 Sam. 8:5</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 10:21">10:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22"/>Xoossay Saa7oola shaareezaypp guye unttal afa Dawute kawutiseeza. Xoossay Dawute bagga markkattittar, ‹Taanii ta shene ubba oothiz ta wozina maaqqeez Issaye na7a Dawute denggeeza› yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 13:14">1 Sam. 13:14</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 16:12">16:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:20">Maz. 89:20</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23"/>«Xoossay, ‹Taanii Dawute sheeshaypp Isreele ashshiza ko7oda› gi qaala geleezay garkk Yesuusana ke7eeza. <verse eid="ACT 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24"/>Yesuusa ye7odaypp tiina Isreele as ubbay fa nagaraypp maaqqii xammaqinttoday garkk Waannisa qaala odeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:4">Mar. 1:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:3">Luq. 3:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25"/>Ma Waannisa fa oosa wurssod hanittar asayiko, ‹Tana yi oona gi qoppee? Taanii yi naagiza Kiristtoosa baaya, zin taanii e caamma bilodayis taas beezowazay taapp guyer yi7iza› yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mat. 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:7">Mar. 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:16">Luq. 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:20">Wan. 1:20</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 1:27">27</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26"/>«Nu Ishuntho, Afraame sheeshuntho, ma yhaydda Ayihude baazin Xoossis yashittizitayo, yha atotitha qaalay nuus kiitintteeza. <verse eid="ACT 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27"/>Abis giiko, Yerusalaame yez asaynnee u halaqitay Yesuusana erekkaya. Maala gallas ubbayid nabbabinttiza nabitay qaala akaakekka gishos ezal afa pirddii nabitay odeez qaala poleeza. <verse eid="ACT 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28"/>Yesuusa wodhisodayis pettii sankkekka dhabin Philaaxoosa eza wodhoday garkk woosseeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:22-23">Mat. 27:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:13-14">Mar. 15:13-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:21-23">Luq. 23:21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:15">Wan. 19:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29"/>Unttii Yesuusabaz Geeshsha Maxaafayid xaafintteezibaz ubba poleez wode mazqalepp eza wodhisii moogeeza<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Moogeezay biitta gancce baazin shuchchapp woocintteez duufo gancce gaddeez guussii</char></note>.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat. 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mar. 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luq. 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Wan. 19:38-42</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30"/>Zin Xoossay yhayiqopp Yesuusa dentheeza. <verse eid="ACT 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31"/>Yeypp guye, E paar Galilapp Yerusalaame ye7eezitayis unddenna gallas bentteeza. Unttii yhatti ebaz asayis markkatiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:3">Haw. O. 1:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32"/>«Xoossii nu aditayis immad geez Wonggile nuunii yinttis odiza. <verse eid="ACT 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33"/>Dawute fa Mazmuure Maxaafayid nam7intho shemppayid,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">« ‹Neenii, ta Na7a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:33">taanii yhayino nena yeleeza›</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 13:33">giinttintteezay xaafintteeza Yesuusa, Xoossii yhayiqopp denthii nu mayzitayis inggod geeza nuus u na7itayis poleeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Maz. 2:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34"/>E wooqqaamay garkk Xoossay yhayiqopp eza denthor erisodayis,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">« ‹Taanii Dawutes inggod geez</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:34">ammanintteez geeshsh anjjo yinttis inggoda› yeegii odeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:3">Isa. 55:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:34"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35"/>Yey gishos, Mazmuure Maxaafayid hara aqo ma</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:35">‹Ne Xillay aha wooqqisaamii yeegiza.›<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 16:10">Maz. 16:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36"/>«Dawute fa wode Xoossa qofa poleezaypp guye yhayqqii fa aditayir mooginttii wooqqeeza. <verse eid="ACT 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37"/>Zin Xoossay yhayiqopp dentheezay wooqqekkaya.<verse eid="ACT 13:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38"/>«Yey gishos, ta ishuntho, nagara atotithay Yesuusa baggar tiinatii yinttis odintteeza eroytta. Muse higgay nagarapp xillisodayis danda7ooya. <verse eid="ACT 13:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39"/>Zin Yesuusa ammaniza ubbay nagarapp xilliza. <verse eid="ACT 13:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40"/>Yey gishos, nabitay geezay yinttal afa hellaamay garkk naaginttoytta.<verse eid="ACT 13:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41"/>« ‹Xoossay geezbaz leeqisizuntho! Bo7oytta! Malabaz goytta! Dhaboytta!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">oonkka odin, yi ammanoowa oosa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">taanii yi wode oothoda› » yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 1:5">Ibr. 1:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42"/>Phawuloosannee Barnnabaasa Ayihude Woosa keethapp kezodar, kaalliza maala gallasayid yeya gujjii ododay garkk asay unttan woosseeza. <verse eid="ACT 13:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43"/>Shiiqo laalintteezaypp guye gaame Ayihuditayinnee Ayihuditay ammanayid gelii Xoossa goynniza gaamitay Phawuloosannee Barnnabaasa kaalleeza. Ammaneezitay Xooss aadho keehatithayid miinggii yezoday garkk unttan zoreeza.<verse eid="ACT 13:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44"/>Kaalliza maala gallas katama yez asaypp oonkk attekka god hellodayi gaamitay Xooss qaala si7odayis shiiqeeza. <verse eid="ACT 13:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45"/>Zin Ayihuditay gaame asa be7eez wode Phawuloosa qinaattii e nashsha ixxii eza cazheeza.<verse eid="ACT 13:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46"/>Phawuloosannee Barnnabaasa yashittekkaya, «Xoossa qaalay tiinatii yinttis odinttodayis koshshiza. Zin yi qaala ixxii medhina de7o ekkodayis nuus beezooya gi yi, yi ommas pirddeez gishos yikkee nuunii Ayihude baazitayko maaqqoda. <verse eid="ACT 13:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47"/>Yeykka Goday,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">« ‹Alame kunithay ne baggar attoday garkk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:47">taanii nena Ayihude baa woyas poo7o ootheeza yeegii nuna azazeeza› » yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:6">Isa. 42:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:6">49:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48"/>Ayihude baazitay yeya si7ii ufayttii Xooss qaala bonchcheeza. Ma medhina de7os maraxintteez ubbay ammaneeza.<verse eid="ACT 13:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49"/>Goda qaalay ye gade ubba helleeza. <verse eid="ACT 13:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50"/>Zin Ayihuditay, Ayihude baazar Xoosse goynniza bonchintteez maachchitannee katama yez gita asita Phawuloosal afannee Barnnabaasal afa denthitheeza. Ye asitay unttan bayi7ith aykkii fa biittapp kesseeza. <verse eid="ACT 13:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51"/>Zin Phawuloosarannee Barnnabaasara ixxizitayis malla maaqqoday garkk fa toke buli7a tiqisii Iqoononnee katama yhanigeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:14">Mat. 10:14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:11">Mar. 6:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:5">Luq. 9:5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:11">10:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 13:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52"/>Ma Anxooka yez ammanizitay Geeshsha Ayyanarannee ufayisar kumeeza.<verse eid="ACT 13:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosannee Barnnabaasa Iqonoone yhanigeeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1"/>Kaseesaygarkk, Phawuloosannee Barnnabaasa Iqonoone Ayihuditay woosa keeth gelii gaame Ayihuditayinnee Ayihude baazitay ammanod hellodayis qaala odeeza. <verse eid="ACT 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2"/>Zin ammanekka Ayihuditay, Ayihude baazitay wozina laammii ishitayil afa denthitheeza. <verse eid="ACT 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3"/>Hawaaritay ezayid gaame wode gam7eeza. Unttii yashitekka Goday bagga odeeza. Goday malatitannee oorithabaz unttii oothoday garkk unttis mawute inggii fa aadho keehetith qaalay tuma maaqqeezana beezeeza. <verse eid="ACT 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4"/>Zin ye katama asay shaakinttii, baggay Ayihuditayir baggay ma Hawaaritayir maaqqeeza.<verse eid="ACT 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5"/>Ayihude baazitayinnee Ayihuditay fa halaqitayir wolla maaqqii hawaarita qohodayisinnee shuchchar shocodayis koyeeza. <verse eid="ACT 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6"/>Hawaaritay yeya erii, Lisxirannee Derbe giz Liqa7one katamitannee u heera yez biitta qosintteeza. <verse eid="ACT 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7"/>Ezayid Wonggile odeeza.<verse eid="ACT 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosannee Barnnabaasa Lisxirarannee Deriber</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8"/>Yelintteezaypp aykkii nam77ii tokitay sileez yedhdhii eroowa pettii athay Lisxira yeza. <verse eid="ACT 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9"/>Ye athay Phawuloosa ododar bettii si7izazin. Phawuloosa eza dakkii be7adar paxodayis ees ammano yeza bi7ii, <verse eid="ACT 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10"/>fa qaala dhoqq udii, «Sitti gi ne tokayir eqqoba» yeegeeza. Yeezin, puthukk gi denddii eqqii yeth aykkeeza.<verse eid="ACT 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11"/>Phawuloosa ootheeza asay bi7ii u fa qaala dhoqq udii Liqa7one doonar, «Xoossitay as aazii nuuko wodhdheeza» yeegeeza. <verse eid="ACT 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12"/>Barnnabaasana, «Diya» gi, Phawuloosa yhaydda odar erintteezaya maaqqeez gishos eza, «Hermmeesa» gi suntheeza. <verse eid="ACT 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13"/>Katamaypp gaxa yez Diya giz eeqa kara kaahinay kormmitannee fudhe doosita hawaaritayis yarshshodayis kezii katama gaxa ke7eeza.<verse eid="ACT 14:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14"/>Zin Barnnabaasannee Phawuloosa yeya si7ii fa ma7a peedheeza. Asay gancce woxxii gelii, <verse eid="ACT 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15"/>fa qaala dhoqq udii, «Asayyo, yhaya abis oothee? Nuunikka yi garkk ase. Yha pathoowabazaypp salonnee sa7a, abbannee u gancce yez ubba baz medhdheez de7o Xoossayiko yi maaqqoday garkk yinttis nuunii Wonggile ododa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:11">Kes. 20:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 146:6">Maz. 146:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16"/>E binii asay fa oge fa oge yhammaday garkk dakkii ashsheeza. <verse eid="ACT 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17"/>Zini ira salopp bukkiseeza, kathakka woder woder inggeez, kathi inggii yinttan gaame ufaysseeza, yeezii yinttis lo77o baz udii paas markka dhabisekka» yeegeeza. <verse eid="ACT 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18"/>Hawaaritay yeya gi paas asay yarshshaamay garkk waayer kayiseeza.<verse eid="ACT 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19"/>Anxookappennee Iqoononeppe ye7eez Ayihuditay, asa fa bagga mahii shuchchar Phawuloosa caddeeza. Unttis E yhayqqeezibaz aazin katamapp gaxa goochchii kanggii oleeza. <verse eid="ACT 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20"/>Zin ammanizita yi7ii, e yuushayid galchchii eqqeezazin E denddii katama geleeza. Wonttitha gallas Barnabaasar pettipp Derbe qiteeza.<verse eid="ACT 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosannee Barnnabaasa Soore Anxooka maaqqeeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21"/>Unttii Derbe katama Wonggile odii gaamita ammantheezaypp guye Lisxira, Iqoononennee Phisida Anxooka maaqqeeza. <verse eid="ACT 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22"/>Ye katamitayid yez ammanizita mihithitara unttii ammanor minggod garkk zorttar, «Xoossa kaatetitha gelodayis nuunii gaame waaye ekkodayis beeziza» yeegii taamarsseeza. <verse eid="ACT 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23"/>Ma woosa keethitayis ommas ommas cimita dooreeza. Xoomeezayppennee woosseezaypp guye unttii ammaneez Godayis u hadara inggeeza.<verse eid="ACT 14:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24"/>Phisida biitta kanthii aadhii Phinfile yhanigeeza. <verse eid="ACT 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25"/>Phergge qaala odeezaypp guye Axaala yhanigeeza. <verse eid="ACT 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26"/>Yeypp unttii fa poleez oosayis Xooss aadho keehatithayis unttan hadara inggeez Anxooka markkaber maaqqeeza.<verse eid="ACT 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27"/>Anxooka hellii woosa keeth asa shiishii Xoossay unttara ootheez oosa ubbaynnee Ayihude maaqqekka asay ammanoday garkk unttis wayizii oge dooyeezako odeeza. <verse eid="ACT 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28"/>Ezayid ammanizitayir gaame wode gam7eeza.<verse eid="ACT 14:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Yerusalaame shiiqo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1"/>Pettii pettii asay Yihudapp Anxooka yhanigii, «Muse wogay garkk yi dookalinttaam ixxiko attodayis danda7ooya» gi ammanizita taamarsso aykkeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:3">Lewii. 12:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2"/>Yey Phawuloosannee Barnnabaasa unttar gaame palamoday garkkennee wacoday garkk ootheeza. Yey gishos, Anxooka yez pettii pettii asay Phawuloosarannee Barnnabaasara Yerusalaame yhanigii Hawaaritayrannee cimitayir woli hellii ye oda billoday garkk qofa acceeza.<verse eid="ACT 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3"/>Woosa keethay unttan kiittin yhanigeeza. Unttii finqqe Samaarera aadhittar Ayihude baazitay Xoossiko wayizii maaqqeezako odeeza. Yey ammanizita ubba gaame ufaysseeza. <verse eid="ACT 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4"/>Unttii Yerusalaame hellin woosa keethay, Hawaaritayinnee cimitay unttan mokkeeza. Xoossay unttar ootheezi bazita ubba u odeeza. <verse eid="ACT 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5"/>Zin Ferisaawitay baggapp ammaneez pettii pettii asay denddii eqqii, «Ayihude baazar ammaneez asay dookalinttodayisinnee Muse higga naagodayis beeziza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6"/>Hawaaritayinnee cimitay yeya tobbodayis shiiqeeza. <verse eid="ACT 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7"/>Gaame odintteezaypp guye, Phixiroosa denddii eqqii, «Ta ishuntho, Ayihude baazitay Wonggile qaala ta doonaypp si7ii ammanoday garkk tiinatii tana Xooss yi ganccepp dooreezana yi eriza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:1-43">Haw. O. 10:1-43</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8"/>As wozina eriza Xooss Geeshsha Ayyana nuus inggeezay garkk unttiskka inggeezana markkatteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:4">Haw. O. 2:4</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 10:44">10:44</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9"/>Ammanor u wozina geeshsheez gishos nu ganccennee u gancce dummatith gaddekkaya. <verse eid="ACT 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10"/>Yey gishos, nu aditaynne nuunii tookkodayis danda7inttoowa qambbara ammanizitay morgayil gaddii yhatti abis Xoossa paace? <verse eid="ACT 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11"/>Goda Yesuusa aadho keehatithayid unttii atteezay garkk nuukka atteezana ammanoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12"/>Asay si77i gi, Barnnabaasannee Phawuloosa Ayihude maaqqekka asay gancce fa baggar Xoossii ootheez malatitannee oorothibaz ubba ododar si7eeza.<verse eid="ACT 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13"/>Unttii nashsha haaseezaypp guye Yayqqooba, «Ishuntho, ta giza si7oytta. <verse eid="ACT 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14"/>Xoossii Ayihude baazitay ganccepp fa as doorodayis kezii unttan tiin wayizii qopeezako Simoona odeeza. <verse eid="ACT 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15"/>Nabitay qaalay yhayir qariza. Geeshsha Maxaafayid,<verse eid="ACT 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16"/>«‹Yhaypp guye, taanii maaqqoda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">wodhdheez Dawute keetha denthoda.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:16-18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="AMO 9:11-12">Amo. 9:11-12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Laalintteez keethaka ta mahii essoda.<verse eid="ACT 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17"/>Atteez as ubbay taako ye7oda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17">taanii xeegeez Ayihude maaqqekka as ubbay tana koyoda.<verse eid="ACT 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18"/>Binipp aykkii yey erinttoday garkk udeez</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:18">goday, tana› yeegiza.<verse eid="ACT 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19"/>«Yey gishos, ta qofay Xoossiko maaqqeez Ayihude baazita nuunii waayithaamay garkke. <verse eid="ACT 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20"/>Zin unttii eeqas yarshshinttii tuneezibaz maamay garkk, lagitaamay garkk, bawuta maamay garkkennee suuthii uzhaaminnee maamay garkk unttis nuunii dabddaabbe xaafodayis koshshiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:15-17">Kes. 34:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 17:10-16">Lewii. 17:10-16</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 18:6-23">18:6-23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21"/>Muse higgay binipp aykkii maalagalas Ayihude Woosa Keethi nabbabinttiza katama ubbayid sabbakinttiza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22"/>Yeypp guye, hawaaritaynnee cimitay woosa keeth as ubbayir wolla fa ganccepp xiqqa asita doorii Phawuloosarannee Barnnabaasara Anxooka dakkodayis qofa acceeza. Unttii unddenna erintteez kaalithiza nam7i asita Barssabaasa ginttinttiza e Yihudannee Sillaase dooreeza. <verse eid="ACT 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23"/>Yhay garkk ginttinttii xaafintteez dabddaabba unttal afa dakkeeza: «Nuunii hawaaritaynnee cimitay yi ishitay, Anxooka, Soorarannee Kilqqe yez Ayihude maaqqekka ishitayis nu sarotha kiittoda.<verse eid="ACT 15:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24"/>«Nuunii kiittekka asitay nu ganccepp yhanigii, ‹Yi dookalinttodayisinnee higge naagodayis beeziza gi› yinttan waayitheezannee yilotheeza nu si7eeza. <verse eid="ACT 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25"/>Nuunii dosiza Barnnabaasannee Phawuloosa doorintteez asayir wolla yinttiko kiittodayis pettii wozinar nu murtteeza. <verse eid="ACT 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26"/>Unttii nu Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa gishos fa shemppo aathii inggeeza. <verse eid="ACT 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27"/>Yey gishos, nuunii xaafeezana unttii fa doonarakka gujjii yinttis ododay garkk e Yihudannee Sillaase azazeeza.<verse eid="ACT 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28"/>«Yha koshshizitaypp attin hara toofo yinttan toossaamay garkk nuunnee Geeshsha Ayyanay lo77o qofa maaqqeezana be7eeza <verse eid="ACT 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29"/>Eeqas yarshintti tuneezibaz miipatte, suuth uzhipatte, bawuta miipatte, lagite ayikkipatte. Yha ubbaypp yi, yinttan naagiko lo77o baz udiza. Saro yezoytta» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30"/>Yey gishos, kiitintteezitay moyizinttii Anxooka yhanigii ammaniza asita shiishii, dabddaabbe inggeeza. <verse eid="ACT 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31"/>Unttii ye minthatho dabddaabba nabbabeezaypp ufaytteeza. <verse eid="ACT 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32"/>Ma e Yihudannee Sillaase u fa ommas nabita maaqqeez gishos ammanizita lo7ithii zorii minthatheeza. <verse eid="ACT 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33"/>Unttii Anxooka xiqqa gallas betteezaypp guye ishitay lo77or moyizin fana kiitteezitayiko maaqqeeza. <verse eid="ACT 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34"/><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pettii pettii kusher xaafintteez binii maxaafitayid payido 34 baaya.</char></note> [Zin Sillaase ezayid attodayis koyeeza.]<verse eid="ACT 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35"/>Ma Phawuloosarannee Barnnabaasar hara gaame asitayir wolla Goday qaala tamarssitarannee Wonggile odittar Anxooka gam7eeza.<verse eid="ACT 15:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Barnnabaasapp shaakintteeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36"/>Xiqqa gallasapp guye Phawuloosa Barnnabaasako, «Nuunii Goday qaala odeez katama ubbitayid ammanizitay waafa yezako guye maaqqittar wola be7adannee eroda» yeegeeza. <verse eid="ACT 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37"/>Barnnabaasa Marqqoosa ginttinttiza Waannisa paar yhanigoday garkk koyeeza. <verse eid="ACT 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38"/>Zin Phawuloosa Marqqoosa paar yhanigoday garkk koyekkaya. Yeykka, E Phinfila shaakinttii unttar oothodayis yhanigekka gishosi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:13">Haw. O. 13:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39"/>U gancce iita kachchii kezin pettay pettaypp shaakintteeza. Barnnabaasa Marqqoosa ekkii markkaber Qoophiroosa kezeeza. <verse eid="ACT 15:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40"/>Zin Phawuloosa Sillaasena dooreeza; ammanizitay Phawuloosa Xooss aadho keehatithayis hadara inggeezaypp guye e qiteeza. <verse eid="ACT 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41"/>Yeezii, woosa keethita minthathittar Soorarannee Kilqara aadheeza.<verse eid="ACT 15:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Ximaatoosa Phawuloosanannee Sillaase heleeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1"/>Phawuloosa Derbbennee Lisxira heleeza. Ezayid Ximaatoosa giz ammaniza as yeza. E indatakka ammaniza Ayihude maachch, e aday Girike asii. <verse eid="ACT 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2"/>Lisxirarannee Iqonoone yez ammizitay Ximaatoosa bagga lo7ithii markkatteeza. <verse eid="ACT 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3"/>Phawuloosa Ximaatoosa paar kanggodayis koyeeza, eez aday Girike as maaqqeeza ye aqo yez Ayihude ubbay eriza gishos eza dookaleeza. <verse eid="ACT 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4"/>Unttii katamitayira yhanigttar Yerusalaame yez hawaaritaynnee cimitay acceez qofa ammanizitay naagoday garkk unttis odittar aadheeza. <verse eid="ACT 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5"/>Yey gishos, woosa keethitay ammanor minggittar, payidorakka gallas gallas gaanggii gaanggii yhanigeeza.<verse eid="ACT 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Maqadoona yhammadaygarkk xeegintteeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6"/>Iisiya qaala odaamay garkk Geeshsha Ayyanay unttan kayeez gishos Phirgerannee Galata biittar aadheeza. <verse eid="ACT 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7"/>Unttii Miisa zawa helleez wode Bitaana yhammadayis butintteeza. Zin Yesuusa Ayyanay unttan kayeeza. <verse eid="ACT 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8"/>Yey gishos, unttii Miisa kanttar aadhittar Xiro7aada wodhdheeza. <verse eid="ACT 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9"/>Phawuloosa qamma qoncithar pettii Maqadoona as faako, «Maqadoona piinggii nuna maaddooye» yeegttar eqqii woosodar be7eeza. <verse eid="ACT 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10"/>Ajuuta E be7eezaypp guye ellisii nuunii Maqadoona yhammadayis koyeeza. Yeykka, Wonggile ezayid yez asayis ododayis Xoossay nuna xeegeez aazeeza.<verse eid="ACT 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Liida Kiristtoosa ammaneeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11"/>Xiro7aadapp denddii markkabe gelii Samotiraaqe yhanigeeza, wonttitha gallas Naaphule yhanigeeza. <verse eid="ACT 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12"/>Yeypp denddii Maqadoona biitta yez Filphisoosa giz erintteez worada katama yhanigeeza. Ma Filphisoosa Oroome kaatay olar mooddeez katama. Nuunii ye katamayid xiqqa gallas betteeza.<verse eid="ACT 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13"/>Maala gallas katamaypp gaxa borkka kale Ayihuditay Xooss woossiza aqo yezana qoppii ged yhanigeeza. Ye aqayid shiiqeez maachchitayis qaala odeeza.<verse eid="ACT 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14"/>Nuna si7odar asaypp pettii Liida ginttinttiz Tiyatiroona katamapp ye7eeza, Xooss ammaneeza zoqo afila zal7iza, asita yeza. Phawuloosa odiza iza si7oday garkk Goday I wozina dooyeeza. <verse eid="ACT 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15"/>Liida fa kara asayir pettipp xammaqintteezaypp guye nuuko, «Yi tana Goda tuma ammaneeza giiko ta kara yi7ii yezoytta» gi miinthii wooseeza.<verse eid="ACT 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosarannee Sillaasera accintteeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16"/>Nuunii Xoossa woossiza aqa yhammadar iita ayyana iil afa yezanna kaayor fa goditayi gaame miishe ki7iz pettii ayllata nuna heleeza. <verse eid="ACT 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17"/>Phawuloosannee nuna kaallii, «Yhaytitay Ubbaypp afa Xooss ayllita! Unttii yi attoda oga odizita» gi uukkeeza.<verse eid="ACT 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18"/>Ubba gallas yey garkk giza. Zini Phawuloosa yilottii guye maaqqii, ye ayyana, «Yesuus Kiristtoosa sunthayir izippe kezoba» gi azazeeza. Izirakka iita ayyanay izippe kezeeza.<verse eid="ACT 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19"/>Zin I godittay u miishe denggiz ogay dhabeeza bi7ii, Phawuloosannee Sillaase aykkii, awudare dayinnitay tiina goochchii kanggeeza. <verse eid="ACT 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20"/>Dayinnitay tiina u kanggii, «Yhayititay Ayihude as maaqqittar nu katama asa iita waayithiza. <verse eid="ACT 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21"/>Nuunii Oroome gade as maaqqodar ekkodayisinnee oothodayis woga baabaz taamarssiza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22"/>Asay pettii bagga maaqqii, Phawuloosal afannee Sillaasel afa denddeeza. Dayinnitay u afila qaarii gufer unttan shocoday garkk azazeeza. <verse eid="ACT 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23"/>Unttan gaame yhadhdheezaypp guye achch kara geliseeza. Achch keetha naagizay unttan miinthii naagod garkk azazeeza. <verse eid="ACT 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24"/>Achch kara naagizay ye kiita ekkii, Phawuloosannee Sillaase achch karayis qol7a gelisseeza. U toka duthar duuxeeza.<verse eid="ACT 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25"/>Zin giddii bilahe maaqqodar Phawuloosarannee Sillaasera woossittarannee mazimure yexxittar Xoossa galattiza. Achch kara yez hara asitaykka unttii gizibaz si7iza.<figure style="fig" alt="Paul and Silas in stocks" file="LB00337B.tif" size="span" ref="16:25">Phawulossannee sillase duxintto</figure> <verse eid="ACT 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26"/>Qoppekka achch kara baasay eni7od hellodayis biitta eni7o maaqqeeza. Ye saatatekka penge ubbay dooyintteeza; accintteez as ubba santhalaatay bilintti wodhdheeza. <verse eid="ACT 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27"/>Achch kara naagizay genttapp barkkodar achch kara penge ubbay dooyintteeza bi7ii achch asay kezii qiteeza aazin fana wodhodayis mashsha ekkeeza. <verse eid="ACT 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28"/>Zin Phawuloosa qaala dhoqq udii «Nu ubbay yhaydda yeza nena qohippe» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29"/>Achch kara naagizay xomppe woossii ekkii ellisii gancce laasii Kukkorittar Phawuloosa tiinannee Sillaase tiina xugguneeza. <verse eid="ACT 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30"/>Unttan bale kessii, «Ta goditayyo, taanii attodayis ab udodayis beezee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31"/>Phawuloosarannee Sillaaser eziko, «Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa ammanoba; neerannee ne kara asayira attoda» yeegeeza. <verse eid="ACT 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32"/>Unttii eesinnee e kara yez ubbayis Goday qaala odeeza. <verse eid="ACT 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33"/>Qamma ye saatatekka achch kara naagizay unttan kanggii u sambara meecceeza. Ellisii fa kara as ubbayir xammaqintteeza. <verse eid="ACT 16:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34"/>Phawuloosannee Sillaase fa kara kanggii unttis katha aatheeza. E fa kara as ubbayir Xooss ammaneez gishos ufaytteeza.<verse eid="ACT 16:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35"/>Sa7ay wonttin daynnitay, «Ye asita bili7oba» yeegii poolise halaqita eziko azazeeza. <verse eid="ACT 16:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36"/>Achch kara naagizay, «Yi bilinttodaygarkk daynnitay azazeeza. Yikkee, kezii saro yhanigoytta» yeegii ye kiita Phawuloosas odeeza.<verse eid="ACT 16:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37"/>Zin Phawuloosa ye poolise halaqitayko, «Nuunii Oroome as<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:37 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Oroome as: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Phawuloosa fana Oroome as yeegii xeegeezay ye wode Ayihude biitta haarizay Oroome kaatetitha maaqqeez gishosii. Ye wode Oroome biitta yez asay pirdda baythii garafinttooya.</char></note> maaqqadar unttii nuna pirdda bagga asay tiina yhadhdhii, achch kara oleeza. Yhatt nuna geemar kezii qito ginee? Hanena, unttii fa ommas yi7ii nuna kesso» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 16:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38"/>Poolise halaqitay daynnayis yeya odin, Phawuloosarannee Sillaasera Oroome gade as maaqqeeza si7eez wode yashitteeza. <verse eid="ACT 16:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39"/>Yey gishos, daynnitay yi7ii unttiko, «Nuunii yinttan qoheeza» geeza. Achch karapp bale unttan kessii, katamaypp kezii qitodaygarkk woosseeza. <verse eid="ACT 16:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40"/>Phawuloosarannee Sillaasera achch karapp kezii Liida kara yhanigeeza. Ezayid ammanizita hellii unttan minthathii kezii qiteeza.<verse eid="ACT 16:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosara Sillaaser Teselonqqe Qiteeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1"/>Phawuloosarannee Sillaasera Amfipholiinarannee Apholoonar aadhii Teselonqqe yhanigeeza. Ezayid Ayihude Woosa Keethi yeza. <verse eid="ACT 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2"/>Phawuloosa kaseesay garkk ezayid geleeza. Ezayid hayidzii saamintta Xooss qaalapp asayis odeeza. <verse eid="ACT 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3"/>Kiristtoosa waaye ekkodayisinnee yhayiqopp dendodayis beezizana unttis qonccer odittar, «Yesuusa yha taanii yinttis odizay Kiristtoosa» yeegeeza. <verse eid="ACT 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4"/>Unttapp pettay pettay oday tuma maaqqeezana ma77ii Phawuloosarannee Sillaasera tobbeeza. Yey garkkekka, Xoossa goyinniza gaame Girike asaynnee gaame bonchchintteez maachchitaykka unttar tobbeeza.<verse eid="ACT 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5"/>Zin Ayihuditay qinaattii azaliza iita asita gabe ogepp shiisheeza. Katama gancce cabbo medhdheeza; Phawuloosannee Sillaase asayis aathii immadayis kezii Yaasona kara ellis qiteeza. <verse eid="ACT 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6"/>Phawuloosannee Sillaase unttis benttaam ixxin, Yaasonennee ishitaypp pettii pettii ammanizita katama halaqitayiko goochchii kanggii, «Yeyititay biita ubba buqqizitay yhatti ma nuuko ye7eeza. <verse eid="ACT 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7"/>Yaasone unttan fa kara gaddeeza. Yhayititay, ‹Yesuusa giz hara kaatay yeza› gi Qeesare kiita ixxizita» yeegii uukkeeza.<verse eid="ACT 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8"/>Shiiqeez asaynnee katama halaqitay yeya si7in ezis hanod baz dhabeeza. <verse eid="ACT 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9"/>Halaqitay Yaasonannee harita waaser bili7eeza.<verse eid="ACT 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosannee Sillaase Beera gade taamarsseeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10"/>Ammanizitay Phawuloosannee Sillaase qammar Beera dakkeeza. Beera hellii, Ayihude Woosa Keethi geleeza. <verse eid="ACT 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11"/>Beera asitay Teselonqqe asitaypp aadheez wozina luulita. Unttii qaala kunth wozinapp ekkeeza; gallas gallas Geeshsha Maxaafita nabbabitar Phawuloosa geezay tuma maaqqeezana shaakkii ereeza. <verse eid="ACT 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12"/>Yey gishos, unttapp gaamitay, Girikitayppekka bonchchintteez xiqqa maachchitaynnee dhiirathitay ammaneeza.<verse eid="ACT 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13"/>Zin Teselonqqe yez Ayihuditay Phawuloosa Xooss qaala Beera gaddekka odeezana si7ii Beera yi7ii asa buqeeza. <verse eid="ACT 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14"/>Yeypp guye, ammanizitay ellisii Phawuloosa abba kale dakkeeza. Zin Sillaasennee Ximaatoosa Beera atteeza. <verse eid="ACT 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15"/>Phawuloosana moyizeez asay Ateena helthii ashsheeza. Ye asay Sillaasennee Ximaatoosa unttis danda7inttiko ellsii faako ye7od garkk Phawuloosa kiitteez kiita ekkii Beera maaqqeeza.<verse eid="ACT 17:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Ateena biittal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16"/>Phawuloosa Ateena Sillaasenannee Ximaatoosa naagttar, katamay eeqar kumeezana bi7ii shentteeza. <verse eid="ACT 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17"/>Yey gishos, Ayihude Woosa keetha Ayihuditayirannee Xoossa goynniza Ayihude maaqqekka asayir ma gabelakka fana heleez asayir ubba wode palamiza. <verse eid="ACT 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18"/>Ephiqoroosa baggapennee Isttoykantta ginttinttiz eranchitaypp pettay pettay Phawuloosar palameeza. Unttapp pettay pettay, «Yha doonanchay ab ododayis koyineshsha?» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 17:18">Yhankkitay Phawuloosa Yesuusannee yhayiqopp denddo bagga unttis odeez gishos «Oroth eeqitay bagga odiz aaziza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 17:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19"/>Phawuloosa aykkii Aryoospagoosa ginttiz shiiqo aqa kanggii, «Yha neenii taamarssiza orothibazay abizako nuna erisaamoo? <verse eid="ACT 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20"/>Abis giiko, neenii nuus orothibaz odizay; abizako nuunii erodayis koyiza» yeegeeza. <verse eid="ACT 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21"/>Ateena as ubbaynnee ezayid yez imathitay orothibaz odinttekazarannee si7ekka peezhooya.<verse eid="ACT 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22"/>Phawuloosa Aryoospagoosa shiiqeez asay tiina eqqii, «Ateena asayyo, yi Xoossitayis ubba bazar gaame yashittiza taanii bi7iza. <verse eid="ACT 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23"/>Taanii yi katamayir yuuyttar yi goynniza aqita be7adar ‹Erinttoowa Xoossis› ginttinttii xaafintteez yarshsho aqo denggeeza. Yha yi erekkazar goynnizana taanii yinttis odiza. <verse eid="ACT 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24"/>Sa7annee sa7all yez ubba baz medhdheez Xoossay, salonnee sa7a Goday, asii keexxeez keetha yezooya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:24-25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:27">1 Kaat. 8:27</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:5">Isa. 42:5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:48">Haw. O. 7:48</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25"/>E de7onnee, shempponnee ubba baz as ubbayis inggiza gishos pacce yez as garkk as maadee koyooya. <verse eid="ACT 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26"/>Asii yezod wodayisnnee aqayis zawa inggeeza. Xoossay as zerithi ubba pettii athaypp medhdhii biita ubbayid gaddeeza. <verse eid="ACT 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27"/>E yeya ootheezay asii eza koyoday garkkennee koyii demmaday garkkesii. Hanikokka E nuupp haakkekkaya. <verse eid="ACT 17:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28"/>Yinttipp pettii pettii yexxizitay, ‹Nuunii e na7ita› geezay garkk, Nuunii ezayid pathi yezii, eni7iza. <verse eid="ACT 17:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29"/>Yikkee, nuunii Xooss na7ita maaqqiz gishos ‹Xoossay as ecetitharannee qofar worqqapp woy birapp woy shuchchapp oosintteezibaz aaziza› yeegii qoppodayis beezooya. <verse eid="ACT 17:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30"/>Yey gishos, Xoossii tiina asay erekka ootheezana ashshii aadheeza, zin yhatti ubba aqo yez as ubbay nagarapp maaqqoday garkk azaziza. <verse eid="ACT 17:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31"/>Abis giiko, Xoossii fa dooreez athayir sa7all yez as ubbayil afa xillo pirdda pirddodayis qamma giigisii gaddeeza. Eza yhayiqopp denthii yeya as ubbayis tumaseeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 17:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32"/>Unttapp pettii pettii asitay yhayiqopp denddo bagga Phawuloosapp si7ii, ezal afa ari7eeza. Zin yhankkitay, «Nuunii yeya neepp gujjii si7odayis koyiza» yeegeeza. <verse eid="ACT 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33"/>Yey gishos, Phawuloosa u ganccepp kezeeza. <verse eid="ACT 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34"/>Zin pettii pettii dhiithitay Phawuloosa hellii ammaneeza. U ganccepp Aryoospagoosa pirdde daynna Diyonasoosa ginttiz asita, Damarsso ginttiz pettii asttinnee yhankkitay yeza.<verse eid="ACT 17:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Qoronttoosa qiteeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1"/>Yeypp guye, Phawuloosa Ateenapp kezii, Qoronttoosa qiteeza. <verse eid="ACT 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2"/>Ezayid Aqiila ginttiz Phanxoosa yelintteez pettii Ayihude as denggeeza. Ayihude as ubbay Oroomeppe kezoday garkk kaatay Qalawudoosa kiitteez gishos xiqqa wodepp tiina E fa machchat Phirisqilar Ixaalepp ye7eeza. Phawuloosa unttan hellodayis ye7eeza. <verse eid="ACT 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3"/>E oosay unttiisay garkk dunkkaane siko maaqqeez gishos unttar bettii wolla ootheeza. <verse eid="ACT 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4"/>Phawuloosa maala gallas ubbayid Ayihuditannee Girikita ammanthodayis Ayihude Woosa keetha unttar odinttiza.<verse eid="ACT 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5"/>Sillaasennee Ximaatoosa Meqidonapp yi7in Phawuloosa fa wode ubba inggii Ayihuditayis Yesuusa E, Kiristtoosa gi azala bayth markkattitar qaala odeeza. <verse eid="ACT 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6"/>Zin unttii Phawuloosana ixxii eza cazhin Phawuloosa fa afilaypp buli7a tiqqisttar, «Yi suuthayis yinttan oyico; taanii yhanpp geeshsh. Yhanpp maaqqii, taanii Ayihude maaqqekka asayiko yhammada» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7"/>Yeypp kezii Xooss goynniza Titosa Yosxoosa giz athay kara yhanigeeza. Yosxoosa karay Ayihude Woosa Keethay kale yeza. <verse eid="ACT 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8"/>Ayihude Woosa Keeth halaqay Qarisphoosa fa kara as ubbayir Goda ammaneeza. Qoronttoosa asitayppekka gaamitay Xooss qaala si7eez wode ammanii xammaqintteeza.<verse eid="ACT 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9"/>Goday pettii qamma Phawuloosas qoncithar yi7ii, «Yashitippe; odobapp attin si77i giipe. <verse eid="ACT 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10"/>Taanii neer yeza. Taas yha katamayid, gaame as yez gishos nena qohi iita baz oothod as oonkka baaya» yeegeeza. <verse eid="ACT 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11"/>Yey gishos, Phawuloosa Xooss qaala asa tamaarssittar pettii laythinnee usuppun agina unttar betteeza.<verse eid="ACT 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12"/>Gaaloosa Akkaya biitta aqisodar Ayihuditay pettipp Phawuloosal afa denddii pirdde keethi kanggii, <verse eid="ACT 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13"/>«Yha athay higge ixxii, asay Xooss goynnoday garkk udiza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14"/>Phawuloosa nashshod hanodar, Gaaloosa Ayihuditayko, «Ayihuditayyo, yey iita ooso woy naaqo maaqqeezako taanii yi bagga danda7i si7odayis beeziza. <verse eid="ACT 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15"/>Zin qaalas, yi sunthayisinnee yi higgayis yi palamiza baz maaqqiko yi, yinttis billoytta; yeya taanii pirddaamii» yeegeeza. <verse eid="ACT 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16"/>Yeezii, unttan pirdda keethaypp bale kesseeza. <verse eid="ACT 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17"/>Yeypp guye, as ubbay Ayihude Woosa Keeth halaqa Sosteenisa aykkii pirdde keeth tiina yhadhdheeza. Zin Gaaloosas yey abkka aazekkaya.<verse eid="ACT 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Anxooka maaqqeeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18"/>Phawuloosa gaame gallas Qoronttoosa betteezaypp guye ammaniza asa sarothi, Phirisqilirannee Aqiilara markkaber Soora yhanigeeza. Zin E yhanigodaypp tiina ees gatho yez gishos Kinkkiroosa katamayid fa omma meedeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:18">Tay. 6:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19"/>Unttii Efesoone hellii Phawuloosa Phirisqilannee Aqiila ezayid ashsheeza. Zin paas Ayihude Woosa Keethi gelii Ayihuditayira odintteeza. <verse eid="ACT 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20"/>Unttii paar gaame wode bettoday garkk Phawuloosana woosseeza zin E ixeeza. <verse eid="ACT 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21"/>Unttapp shaakinttii, «Xoossii giiko yinttiko maaqqii ye7oda» yeegii Efisonepp markkaber dendeeza. <verse eid="ACT 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22"/>Qisaare hellii Yerusalaame yhanigii woosa keeth asay sarotheezaypp guye Anxooka qiteeza.<verse eid="ACT 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23"/>Ezayid xiqqa wode gam7eezaypp guye taamarita asita ubba minthathittar Galatiyarannee Phirger aadheeza.<verse eid="ACT 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aphiloosa Efesoonalannee Qoronttoosala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24"/>Iskkinddire yeleta maaqqeez pettii Aphiloosa giz Ayihude as Efesoone qiteeza. E oda eriza asinnee Xooss qaala lo7ithii eriza asii. <verse eid="ACT 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25"/>E Goda oga taamarii, ayyanar xuuginttii Yesuusa bagga luule odizannee tamarisiza. Hano zin, Waannisa xinqqata aadda eriza. <verse eid="ACT 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26"/>E Ayihude Woosa keetha yashittekkazar taamarsseeza. Phirisqilannee Aqiila E odizana si7ii eza paar kara kanggii Xoossa oga tiinaasaypp aathii ees odeeza.<verse eid="ACT 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27"/>Aphiloosa Akkaza yhammadayis koyin Efesoona yez ammaniza asay e qofa ekkii Akkaya yez ammanizitay eza mokkoday garkk unttis dabddaabbe xaafeeza. E ezayid hellii Xooss aadho keehetithar Yesuus Kiristtoosa ammaneezita gaame maaddeeza. <verse eid="ACT 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28"/>Yesuusa E Kiristtoosa maaqqeezana Ayihuditayis Xooss qaalaypp qonccisii woya ubbay tiina miinthii taamarsseeza.<verse eid="ACT 18:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Efesoona qiteeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1"/>Aphiloosa Qoronttoosa yezin, Phawuloosa wookki bagga gader aadhii Efesoone helleeza. Ezayid pettii pettii ammaniza asita denggeeza. <verse eid="ACT 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2"/>Unttanakka, «Yi ammaneez wode Geesha Ayyana ekkeenee?» yeegii oyiceeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:2">Unttii, «wa77a, ekkekkaya; hara attozin, Geesha Ayyana yezanakka nu si7ekkaya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3"/>Phawuloosa unttiko, «Yeezin, yi abar xammaqintteenee?» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:3">Unttii, «Nuunii Waannisa xinqqata xammaqintteeza» yeegii maheeza.<verse eid="ACT 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4"/>Phawuloosa, «Waannisa paapp guyer yi7iz Yesuusana asay ammanoday garkk asayis odittar, maarotithis beeziza xinqqata xammaqeeza» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mat. 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:4">Mar. 1:4</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 1:7-8">7-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:4">Luq. 3:4</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 3:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:26-27">Wan. 1:26-27</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5"/>Unttii yeya si7ii Goda Yesuusa tamaarita maaqqodayis E sunthar xammaqintteeza gallas gallas Geeshsha Maxaafita nabbabiza. <verse eid="ACT 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6"/>Phawuloosa fa kusha unttal afa gaddin Geeshsha Ayyana unttal afa wodhdhin, duma duma doonar odintteeza; ma tinbbite odeeza. <verse eid="ACT 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7"/>Ye aqayid taphpho nam7e maaqqiz asitay yeza.<verse eid="ACT 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8"/>Phawuloosa Ayihude Woosa Keeth gelii, Xooss kaatetithii bagga yashittekkazar palamttarannee lo7ithii qonccisttar unttar hayidzii agina hellodayis gam7eeza. <verse eid="ACT 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9"/>Zin unttapp pettay pettay dhube maaqqii gaame asay tiina Goday oga cazhii ammanaam ixxeeza. Phawuloosa ammanizita unttapp shagii ekkii Xiranoosa giz timirtte keetha ubba wode unttan taamarsseeza. <verse eid="ACT 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10"/>Phawuloosa nam77ii layithi hellodayis qaala odeeza. Yey gishos, Iisiya yez as ubbay, Ayihuditayinnee Ayihude baazitay Goday qaala si7eeza.<verse eid="ACT 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossay Phawuloosa kushe ootheez malatita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11"/>Xoossay Phawuloosa kushe wolqqama malabazita ootheeza. <verse eid="ACT 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12"/>Yey gishos, asay e galla bochcheez maarabe woy ma7o harggintteez asayis kanggiza. Unttikka paxiza; tuna ayyanitaykka unttapp keziza.<verse eid="ACT 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13"/>Tuna ayyanita kessittar yuuyiza Ayihuditaypp pettay pettay, «Phawuloosa sabbakiza Yesuusa sunthayir kezoytta gi yinttan azaziza» yeegii, tuna gaalenitay aykkeez asitayil afa Goda Yesuusa suntha xeegeeza <verse eid="ACT 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14"/>Ayihude Qeese halaqitaypp petta maaqqeez Asqeewa ginttiz athayis yeya oothiza laappun dhiirath na7itay yeza.<verse eid="ACT 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15"/>Zin tuna ayyanay unttiko, «Taanii Yesuusakka Phawuloosa baggakka eriza, zin yinttii oonanttara?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16"/>Tuna ayyana aykkeez athay unttal afa doonggii wodhdhii, unttal madoth kessii, ye karitipp kallo laasii dhabod hellodayis wolqqamii gameeza. <verse eid="ACT 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17"/>Efesoona yez Ayihuditayinnee Ayihude baazitay ubbay yeya si7ii iita yashitteeza. Goda Yesuusa sunthay gaame bonchintteeza. <verse eid="ACT 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18"/>Ammanizitaypp gaamitay fa ootheez iita oosa buuxittarannee qoncce odittar yi7iza. <verse eid="ACT 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19"/>Murunitaypp gaamitay fa maxaafita shiishii as ubbay tiina micheeza. Ye maxaafitay waagay waagay ishatam mukule bira<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:19 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Shuchch bira: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maatoosa 26:15 bo7oytta.</char></note> maaqqeeza. <verse eid="ACT 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20"/>Yey garkk hanii Xooss qaalay wolqqar diccittarannee dalggittar qiteeza.<verse eid="ACT 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Efesoone katama cabbotithi dendeeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21"/>Yey polintteezapp guye Phawuloosa, «Taanii Yerusalaame maaqqii Oroome yhammadayis beeziza» yeegii Maqadoonarannee Akkayara aadhii Yerusalaame yhammadayis qofa acceeza. <verse eid="ACT 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22"/>Ma fana maaddizitaypp nam7ita Ximaatoosannee Erasxoosa Maqadoona kiittii, paas Iisiya xiqqa wode gam7eeza.<verse eid="ACT 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23"/>Ye wode yha ogay gishos iita kachchii kezeeza. <verse eid="ACT 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24"/>Pettii bira oothiz Dimexiroosa ginttiz athay Arxemisa eeqa kara misile birapp medhdhii gaame wodhe denggizazin. <verse eid="ACT 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25"/>Yey gishos, yey garkk ooso oothizita pettipp shiishii, «Asayyo, nu duretithay yha oosaypp maaqqeezana yi eriza. <verse eid="ACT 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26"/>Phawuloosa, yhay ‹As kushe oosintteezitay Xooss baaya› yeegii, Efesoonarannee xiqqa biittitaypp attin muume Iisa biitta ubbayil yez gaame asayis odii ammantheezannee maheeza yi be7eezannee si7eeza. <verse eid="ACT 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27"/>Meto maaqqeezay, nu oosay leqintteezita aadda baazin Iisannee gade ubbayil yez as goynniza gita Xoossinnee Arxemisa <figure style="fig" alt="Artemis" file="HK00286B.tif" size="span" ref="16:25">Arximse</figure> karay odinttekka attodaynnee E damotithaykka wodhdhoday yashshiza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28"/>Asay yeya si7ii shener kumii, «Efisoona Arxemisa bayira» yeegii uukkeeza. <verse eid="ACT 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29"/>Ye uufay katama ubba helleeza. Phawuloosa laggita Maqadoona asita, Gaayoosannee Arsxirokoosa unttar wolla dafi ekkii kaa7iza aqa woxxeeza. <verse eid="ACT 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30"/>Phawuloosakka asay shiiqeez aqo gelodayis koyeeza, zin ammaneezitay eza kayeeza. <verse eid="ACT 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31"/>Iisa biitta halaqitaypp Phawuloosas zhame maaqqeez pettay pettay Phawuloosako kiittii, «kaa7iza aqo qonccer kezii benttippe» gi eza woosseeza.<verse eid="ACT 19:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32"/>Shiiqeez asayis hanod baz dhabeeza; gaanggiza bagga asay hara attozin abis shiiqeezako erekkazay gishos pettay pettibaz gi uukkiza ma yhankkitay hara baz gi uukkiza. <verse eid="ACT 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33"/>Ayihuditay Iskkinddirose giz atha woya ganccepp tiina urqqeez, pettii pettii asay E godbaza odin Ezii asay si77i goday garkk fa kushayir mallii beezii, asayis mootinttodayis eqqeeza. <verse eid="ACT 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34"/>Zin Iskkinddire Ayihude as maaqqeez asay erii nam77ii saate maaqqod hollodayis ubbay pettii qaalar, «Efesoona Arxemisa damma» yeegii uukkeeza.<verse eid="ACT 19:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35"/>Wurssitha ye Katamitii xaafay woya si7ii udii, «Efesoona aso! Efesoona katamay gita Arxemiisas eeqa karannee salopp wodhdheez, gita shuchch naagiza maaqqeezana eroowa as oonoo? <verse eid="ACT 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36"/>Yhaya lahiza as baa maaqqiko yi si77ii godayisnnee ellisii 7iita baz oothopp naaginttodayis beeziza. <verse eid="ACT 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37"/>Yi yha asita, eeqa keeth miishe kasttekkazitannee nu Xoossita cazhii be7ekkazita ke7eeza. <verse eid="ACT 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38"/>Yey gishos, Dimexiroosannee ezar yez oosanchchitay oorakka mootintto koykko, pirdde keethi yeza; daynnitaykka yeza; u mootodayiskka danda7iza. <verse eid="ACT 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39"/>Zini yi hara oda koykko, Shanggo shiiqol oday bi7intto. <verse eid="ACT 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40"/>Yey maaqqaam ixxiko yhayino haneezibazayis Oroome kaatetithay nuna oyicoda. Yha buqithayis gaaso baa gishos nuunii malsse mahodayis danda7ooya» <verse eid="ACT 19:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41"/>yeegii shiiqa laaleeza.<verse eid="ACT 19:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Maqadoonannee Girike qiteeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1"/>Cabbotithay hayizeezin Phawuloosa ammaniza asita xeegisii unttan minthatheezaypp guye sarothi Maqadoona yhammadayis kezeeza. <verse eid="ACT 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2"/>E aadhiz biittayid yez ammaniza asayis zore qaala odii minthatheezaypp guye Girike gade qiteeza. <verse eid="ACT 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3"/>E ezayid hayidzii agina bettii, markkaber Soora yhammadayis murttii yezin, Ayihuditay eza wodhodayis kozhizana erii Maqadoonar guye maaqqodayis kozheeza.<verse eid="ACT 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4"/>Phawuloosa moyizeeza Beerappe Pharhuusa na7a Sophaxiroosa, Teselonqqepp Arsxirokoosannee Sikondduusa, Derbbepp Gaayoosa, Iisiyapp Tikiqoosa, Xirofimoosannee Ximaatoosa. <verse eid="ACT 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5"/>Yeyititay tiina yhanigii nuna Xiro7aadal naagiza. <verse eid="ACT 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6"/>Nuunii boora Baale bonchcheezaypp guye Pilphisoosapp markkaber denddii, ichchintha gallas unttan Xiro7aada hellii ezayid laappun gallas gam7eeza.<verse eid="ACT 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Awuxikoosa Xiro7aada yhamadayis dendeeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7"/>Saaminttapp tiina gallas nuunii boora wolla maadayis shiiqii yezin, Phawuloosa wonttitha yhammadayis qoppeez gishos unttis qaala odittar giddii bilahe hellodayis oda adussiseeza. <verse eid="ACT 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8"/>Nuunii shiiqii betteez pooqayil poo7o wazhzhii geezin. <verse eid="ACT 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9"/>Ewuxikoosa ginttiz pettii paanthay maskkootel afa bettii, fana dogii gentteeza. Phawuloosa oda adusseezaypp Ewuxikoosa gentta aafer hayidzintho pooqaypp wodhdhii yhayqqeezana asay dentheeza. <verse eid="ACT 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10"/>Zin Phawuloosa wodhdhii, ezal afa xuggunii. Eza idinggii, «E yhayqqekkaya, hirigipatte» yeegeeza. <verse eid="ACT 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11"/>Yeypp guye, fude pooqeel afa kezii boora baxxii meeza. Sa7a wonttod hellodayis asayis odeezaypp guye denddii qiteeza. <verse eid="ACT 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12"/>Ye paxeez pantha kara kanggii gaame ufaytteeza.<verse eid="ACT 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Xiro7aadapp Milixe qiteeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13"/>Zin Phawuloosa fana ezaypp mokkoday garkk nuus odeezay gishos nu tiinatii markkabekko yhanigii, Asoona yhammadayis denddeeza. Abis giiko, E toker yhammadayis qoppeez gishos nuna yey garkk azazeeza. <verse eid="ACT 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14"/>E nuna Asoona hellin markkaber eza ekkii Mixiline ye7eeza. <verse eid="ACT 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15"/>Wonttitha gallas ezaypp denddii markkaber Kiyoosas tiina baggar yez aqa helleeza; ma wonttitha gallas Saamosa piinggii kaalliza gallas Millixe helleeza. <verse eid="ACT 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16"/>Phawuloosa Iisiya gaame gam7odayis koyekka gishos Efesoone kanttar aadhodayis qoppeeza. Paas danda7inttiko Phenxeqosxe Baale gallas Yerusalaame hellodayis ellisiza.<verse eid="ACT 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Efesoone cimitana zoreeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17"/>Phawuloosa Miliixepp Efesoona kiittii woosa keeth cimita xeegiseeza. <verse eid="ACT 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18"/>Woosa keeth cimitay eziko yi7in, unttiko yhay garkk yeegeeza: «Taanii Iisa geleez tiina gallasapp aykkii yinttar yezeez wode ubbayid wayizii yezeezako yi eriza. <verse eid="ACT 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19"/>Ayihuditay maqinttii taal afa meto helthikokka taanii haayotitharannee gaame aafuthar Godayis ootheeza. <verse eid="ACT 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20"/>Ayidekka yi kara kara yinttan tamaarssittar yinttan maaddeezaypp pettibazikka pacinchekkaya. <verse eid="ACT 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21"/>Taanii Ayihuditayisinnee Ayihude baazitayis nagarapp Xoossiko maaqqoday garkkennee nu Goda Yesuusa ammanoday garkk markatteeza.<verse eid="ACT 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22"/>«Ezayid tana abi hellodazako erooya, yhatti taanii Geeshsha Ayyaanas kiitinttii Yerusalaame yhanigiza: <verse eid="ACT 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23"/>Zin Geeshsha Ayyanay achchinnee waaye tana naagizana katama ubbayid taas markkatteeza. <verse eid="ACT 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24"/>Zin ta laaso polodayisnnee Goda Yesuusapp ekkeez oosa, Xooss aadho keehatith Wonggile markkattiza poliza ta shemppato pathoowa baz garkk payidiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 4:7">2 Xim. 4:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25"/>«Taanii yhattekka Xooss kaatetith markkattittar yi ubbitay ganccer yuuyeeza. Yikkepp guye yinttipp oonkka tana be7aamana eriza. <verse eid="ACT 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26"/>Yey gishos, yinttipp pettii as dhabikokka ta oycinttaamana yhayino yinttis milxi udii odiza. <verse eid="ACT 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27"/>Xooss zore ubba yinttis abikka ashshekkazar odeeza.<verse eid="ACT 20:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28"/>«Fa aaddas fa suuthar wozeez Xoossa woosa keetha naagoytta. Geeshsha Ayyanay yinttan wude henggizita udii shuumeez wudayisinnee yi ubbayis naaginttoytta. <verse eid="ACT 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29"/>Taanii yhanigeezaypp guye, wudayis qadhinttoowa iita pugitay yi gancce gelodana ta eriza. <verse eid="ACT 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30"/>Ammanizita fa lassa kaalithiza worddo asitamaaritay yi ganccepp dendoda. <verse eid="ACT 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31"/>Yey gishos, taanii hayidzii laythi qammannee gallas aafuthar yinttan ommas ommas minthatheeza qoppittar naaginttoytta.<verse eid="ACT 20:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32"/>«Yhattekka yinttan minthodayis geeshsh asayir laatisodayis danda7iza Xoossisinnee E aadho keehateth qaalayis yinttan hadara inggiza.<verse eid="ACT 20:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33"/>«Taanii ooppekka bira woy worqqa woy afila amottekkaya. <verse eid="ACT 20:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34"/>Taanii ta kusher oothii tanannee taar yezita koshshiza baz maaddeeza yi, yi ommas eriza. <verse eid="ACT 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35"/>Yi yhay garkk daaburii oothittar daabureezita maaddodayannee Goda Yesuusa, ‹Ekkizaypp inggizay anjjintteeza› geez qaala yi qoppodayis beeziza taanii yinttan ubba bazar beezeeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 20:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36"/>Phawuloosa yeya odii haasii u ubbitayira gulbatii Xoossa woosseeza. <verse eid="ACT 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37"/>U ubbitaykka Phawuloosana idinggii yeekkittar yeereeza. <verse eid="ACT 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38"/>E mahii, «Yhayinopp guye tana yi be7aamii» yeegeez qaalay unttan iita azzantheeza. Unttii markkaba hellodayis eza moyizeeza.<verse eid="ACT 20:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Yerusalaame qiteeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1"/>Nuunii Efesoona cimitaypp shaakintteezan garkk markkaber Qoose yhanigeeza. Wonttitha gallas Ruude hellii ezaypp Phaxira yhanigeeza. <verse eid="ACT 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2"/>Pinqqe piinggiz markkabe denggii ezayid gelii yhammadayis denddeeza. <verse eid="ACT 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3"/>Nuunii Qoophiroosa be7eezan garkk, haddirss bagga ashshii Soora yhanigeeza. Markkabay fa caana ezayid wothodayis koyeez gishos Xiroosa yhanigeeza. <verse eid="ACT 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4"/>Ezayid ammaniza asita denggeeza unttar laappun gallas betteeza. Phawuloosa Yerusalaame yhanggaamay garkk unttii ees Ayyanar odeeza. <verse eid="ACT 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5"/>Nuunii unttar bettiza woday wurin kezii yhanigeeza. Unttii ubbay fa machchitayrannee fa na7itayir pettii katamapp gaxa kessii nuna moyizeeza. Nuunii abba lanqqe bunqqittii Xoossa woosseeza. <verse eid="ACT 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6"/>Yeypp guye, woli sarothi nu markkabayid geleeza; unttikka fa kara maaqqeeza.<verse eid="ACT 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7"/>Nuunii abbal afar oga haasii, Xiroosapp Phexelemasa helleeza. Ezayid ammaniza asita sarothi, u kale pettii gallas peezheeza. <verse eid="ACT 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8"/>Wonttitha gallas kezii, Qisaare yhanigeeza. Sabaake Filphoosa kara hellii e kale betteeza. E Yerusalaame tiin doorintteez laappunitaypp petta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 6:5">Haw. O. 6:5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 8:5">8:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9"/>Filphoosas nabe maaqqeez oyddii wudir na7itay yeza.<verse eid="ACT 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10"/>Nuunii unddenna gallas ezayid bettii yezin Agaboosa giz nabay Yihudapp Qisaare ye7eeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:28">Haw. O. 11:28</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11"/>Nuuko yi7ii Phawuloosapp saqqa ekkii fa kushannee fa toka accii, «Geeshsha Ayyanay yha saqqay goda, Yerusalaame Ayihuditay yhay garkk accii, Ayihude maaqqekka asayis aathii immada yeegiza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12"/>Nuunii yeya si7ii nuunnee ezayid yez asitay Phawuloosa Yerusalaame yhanggaamay garkk woosseeza. <verse eid="ACT 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13"/>Zin Phawuloosa mahii, «Yi yhay garkk yeekkittar abis ta wozina shugishe? Taanii, Goda Yesuusa sunthay gishos achch aadda baazin Yerusalaame yhayqqodayisikka giigintteeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14"/>Nu zora E ekkaam ixxin, «Goday shene maaqqo» yeegii si7ii geeza.<verse eid="ACT 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15"/>Ezayid xiqqa wode gam7eezaypp guye giiginttii Yerusalaame yhammadayis kezeeza. <verse eid="ACT 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16"/>Qisaare yez ammaniza asitaypp xiqqitay nuur yhanigoytta geeza. Unttii nuunii shemppodayis Minasoona giz Qoophiroosa athay kara kanggeeza. Minasoona tiin ammaneez asaypp petta.<verse eid="ACT 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Yerusalaame helleeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17"/>Nuunii Yerusalaame hellin ammaniza asay nuna ufayssar mokkeeza. <verse eid="ACT 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18"/>Wonttitha gallas Phawuloosa nuur wolla Yayqqoobako yhanigeeza. Woosa keeth cimitay ubbitaykka ezayid yeza. <verse eid="ACT 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19"/>Phawuloosa unttan sarotheezaypp guye Ayihude maaqqekka asay gancce fa baggar Xoossii ootheezi bazita ubba unttis odeeza.<verse eid="ACT 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20"/>Unttii yeya si7ii Xoossa galatii Phawuloosako yhay garkk yeegeeza: «Nu ishayyo, Ayihuditay gancce aappun mukulitay Xoossa ammaneezako ne bi7iza; unttii ubbaykka higga miinthii naagiza. <verse eid="ACT 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21"/>Neenii Ayihude baazitay biitta yez Ayihude ubbay fa na7ita dookalamay garkk, Ayihuditay woga kaallaamay garkkennee Muse higga ixxoday garkk neenii taamarssizana Yerusalaame yez Ayihuditay si7eeza. <verse eid="ACT 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22"/>Yeezin abi lo77o? Neenii ye7itha tumakka u si7oda.<verse eid="ACT 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23"/>«Yey gishos, nuunii nees odizana si7oba; gatho yez oyddii asitay nu kale yeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:23-24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:13-21">Tay. 6:13-21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24"/>Unttan ekkii unttara geezhoba; ma unttii fa omma meedinttoday garkk unttis miishe inggoba. Unttii tiina nees si7eezay tuma baazannee neenii ne ubbaskka higge naagiza as maaqqeezana ubbay eroda.<verse eid="ACT 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25"/>«Zin ammaneez Ayihude maaqqekka asita maaqqiko, unttii eeqas yarshintteez baz maamay garkk, suuth uzhaamay garkk, bawuta maamay garkkennee lagitaamay garkk, nuunii oda accii, unttis dabddaabbe xaafeeza» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:29">Haw. O. 15:29</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 21:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26"/>Yeypp guye, Phawuloosa wonttitha gallas asita ekkii, yhanigeeza. E fa geezhiz gallasay ayide polinttodazako ersodayisnnee fa yarshsho ayide yarshodazako erisodayis Xooss Keetha geleeza.<verse eid="ACT 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa aykintteeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27"/>Laappun gallasay wurod hanodar, Iisapp ye7eez Ayihuditay Xooss keetha Phawuloosa bi7ii, as ubba denthithii Phawuloosa aykkeeza. <verse eid="ACT 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28"/>«Isreele asayyo, nuna maaddoytta; yha athay, nu higgannee yha Xooss Karana ixxoday garkk as ubba ubba aqo taamarssiza athay yhaya. Yeykka gidaam ixxin Ayihude baazita Xooss Kara gelssii, yha geeshsh aqa tuniseeza» yeegii uukkeeza. <verse eid="ACT 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29"/>Unttii yeya geezay tiina Efesoona Xirofimoosana Phawuloosar wola katamayid be7eez gishos yhatti Phawuloosa Xooss kara eza ekkii geleezbaz unttis aazeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">Haw. O. 20:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30"/>Katama ubbay sharkkisharkeeza; asii ubbay shiiqii Phawuloosa aykkii Xooss Karapp goochchii bale kesseeza. Xooss Kara pengitay ellisii gorddintteeza. <verse eid="ACT 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31"/>Asay Phawuloosa wodhod hanodar, «Yerusalaame katama kunithay buqqintteeza» giz oday Oroome shaalaqayiko helleeza. <verse eid="ACT 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32"/>Shaalaqay wottaddaritannee mato halaqita ekkii laasttar ye7eeza. Asay shaalaqannee wottaaddarita bi7ii Phawuloosa yhadhdhizana ashsheeza.<verse eid="ACT 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33"/>Ye wode shaalaqay shiiqii, Phawuloosa aykkii, nam77ii santhalaater acinttoday garkk azazeeza. Yeezii, E oonazakonnee ab udeezako asa oycceeza. <verse eid="ACT 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34"/>Asaypp baggay yhaya gi uukkodar yhankkitay yeya gi uukkiza. Cabbotay dareez gishos shaalaqay tuma shaakkodayis danda7inttaam ixxin, wotaaddaritay Phawuloosa fa yeza aqo kanggoday garkk azazeeza. <verse eid="ACT 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35"/>Phawuloosa yedhdhii kezeez detha hellodar as urqqithay gishos wotaaddaritay eza tookkeeza. <verse eid="ACT 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36"/>Gaame asay, «E yhayqqo!» yeegii ukkittar kaaliza.<verse eid="ACT 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa mootayis mahith inggeeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37"/>Wotaaddaritay Phawuloosa fa yeza aqo gelssod hanodar, Phawuloosa shaalaqayiko, «Ta nees pettibaz ododay garkk udodee?» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 21:37">E Phawuloosako, «Neenii Girike doona erinee? <verse eid="ACT 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38"/>Neenii yhaypp tiina buqithi medhdhii shemppo wodhdheez oyddii mukule asita ekkii liizho gadha geleez Gibxxe athay nena baasa?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 21:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39"/>Zin Phawuloosa, «Taanii, Kilqqa yez erintteez Terssese katama as maaqqeez Ayihude asii. Hayyana tana asayis odisooye?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 21:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40"/>Shaalaqay eziko, «Odoba» yeegin Phawuloosa dethal afa eqqii, asay si77i goday garkk fa kusher maleeza. Asay si77i gin Ibraysxe doonar yhay garkk yeegeeza:<verse eid="ACT 21:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1"/>«Ta ishuntho, ta aduntho, taanii yhatti yinttis inggiza malssa si7oytta.» <verse eid="ACT 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2"/>Phawuloosa unttis Ibraysxe doonar odiza si7ii kaseesaypp aathii si7ii ateeza. E yeegeeza,<verse eid="ACT 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3"/>«Taanii Kilqqa yez Xerseese yelinttii yha katamayid dicceeza. Ta asitamaaraykka Gamaalale; taanii nu aditay higga miinthii tamaareeza, yhayino yi ubbay hanizay garkk Xoossayis mishinttiza Ayihude asii. <verse eid="ACT 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4"/>Taanii yha oga kaalliza maachchitayinnee dhiirathita aykkii achch keetha olittarannee unttan wodhisod hellodayis meto beezeez asii.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Haw. O. 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26:9-11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5"/>Yey garkkekka, qeese halaqaynnee Shanggo ubbay tabaz markkattodayis danda7iza. Taanii Damasqqo yez u ishitayis unttapp dabddaabbe ekkii ezayid yez asitay acinttii seerinttod garkk Yerusalaame ko7odayis yhanigeeza.»<verse eid="ACT 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6"/>«Taanii yhanigii Damasqqo hellodar seeta gallas qoppekka salopp gita poo7o ta kalayir poo7eeza. <verse eid="ACT 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7"/>Taanii sa7a pokkii yezin, ‹Saa7oola, Saa7oola, tana abis bayi7inee?› giz qaala si7eeza. <verse eid="ACT 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8"/>Taanii mahii, ‹Godayyo, neenii oonoo?› yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:8">«E mahii, ‹Taanii, ne bayi7ithiz Naazirete Yesuusa› yeegeeza. <verse eid="ACT 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9"/>Taar yezitay poo7a be7eezaypp attin taas odiza qaala si7ekkaya.<verse eid="ACT 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10"/>«Taanii, ‹Godayyo, ta ab udo?› yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:10">«Goday taako, ‹Denddii Damasqqo yhanigoba. Ne udoday garkk Xooss qoppeezibaz ubba baz ezayid nees odinttoda› yeegeeza. <verse eid="ACT 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11"/>Ye wolqqama poo7aypp denddeezayid ta aafay be7aam ixin, taar yez asitay ta kusha aykkii, tana goochchin Damasqqo helleeza.<verse eid="ACT 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12"/>«Damasqqo yez Ayihude ubbay unddenna bonchchiza pettii Hanana giz athay, nu higga bonchchizaynnee Xoossa miinthii woossizay yeza. <verse eid="ACT 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13"/>Hanana taako yi7ii, ta kale eqqii, ‹Ta ishayyo Saa7oola, bo7oba› yeegeeza. Ellisii taanii eza be7o aykkeeza.<verse eid="ACT 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14"/>«E taako, ‹Nu aditay Xoossay neenii e shene eroday garkk, xilla be7aday garkkennee e doonapp qaala si7oday garkk tiinatii nena dooreeza. <verse eid="ACT 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15"/>Ne be7eezbazinnee si7eez baz as ubba tiina ees markka maaqqoda. <verse eid="ACT 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16"/>Yhatti abis gam7ee? Denddii xammaqinttoba; e suntha xeegittar ne nagaraypp meecinttoba› yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17"/>«Taanii guye Yerusalaame maaqqii Xooss keetha woosodar, taas qonccithii bentteeza. <verse eid="ACT 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18"/>Qonccithar Goday taako, ‹Ne taas markkattiz markkatitha asay ekkeka gishos ellisii Yerusalaamepp kezoba› yeegodar ta be7eeza.<verse eid="ACT 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19"/>«Taanii, ‹Godayyo, Ayihude Woosa Keeth ubbayid nena ammanizita aykkii yadhdheezannee achch kara oleeza unttii eriza. <verse eid="ACT 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20"/>Unttii ne markka Isxifaanose wodhodar taanii ye odayid asayir tobbeeza. Ma u kale eqqii eza wodheezitayis ma7o naagiza› yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:58">Haw. O. 7:58</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21"/>«Goday taako, ‹Taanii nena Ayihude maaqqekka asayiko haakko aqo kiitteezay gishos denddii qitoba› » yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Oroome as maaqqeezana qoncciseeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22"/>Phawuloosa ye qaala odii haasod hellodayis asay E giza si7iza. Yeypp guye, fa qaala dhoqq udii, «Yhaya biittaypp dhabisoba! E shemppor yezodayis beezooya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23"/>Unttii uukkittarannee, fa ma7o afa dakkittarannee baana afa denthodar; <verse eid="ACT 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24"/>Shaalaqay bi7ii wotaaddaritay Phawuloosana u fa yeza aqo kanggoday garkk azazeeza. Ma asay abis yey garkk uukkizako erodayis koyii Phawuloosa alanggar garafii pilagoday garkk unttan azazeeza. <verse eid="ACT 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25"/>Zin wotaaddaritay Phawuloosa dafer miinthii accii garafod hanodar Phawuloosa fa kale eqqeez mato halaqitayiko, «Oroome as pirdda bayith garafizay yinttis woga?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26"/>Mato halaqay yeya si7ii shaalaqayiko yhanigii, «Yha athay Oroome asii. Neenii ab oothodayis qoppeenee?» yeegii oycceeza.<verse eid="ACT 22:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27"/>Shaalaqay Phawuloosako shiiqii, «Neenii Oroome aso? An taas odoba» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:27">Phawuloosa, «Ee» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28"/>Shaalaqay mahii, «Taanii yha gadetitha gaame miisher wonggeeza» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:28">Zin Phawuloosa, «Ta yha gadetitha yeletithar denggii ekkeeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29"/>Yey gishos, Phawuloosa pilagodayis qoppeezitay izir eepp shaakintteeza. Shaalaqay Oroome as maaqqeezana erii acciseezayis yashshitteeza.<verse eid="ACT 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Ayihude shanggo tiina shiiqeeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30"/>Wonttitha gallas Shaalaqay, Ayihuditay Phawuloosa abis mooteezako geeshshii erodayis koyeeza. Qeese halaqitayinnee shanggo ubbay shiiqoday garkk azazeeza; ma Phawuloosa achchapp bili7isii u tiina esseeza.<verse eid="ACT 22:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1"/>Phawuloosa shanggana dakkii bi7ii, «Ta ishuntho, taanii yhayino hellodayis Xooss tiina ta yess ubbayid lo77o wozinar yeza» yeegeeza. <verse eid="ACT 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2"/>Qeese halaqay Hanana, Phawuloosa doonate baqqoday garkk e kale eqqeezana azazeeza. <verse eid="ACT 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3"/>Ye wode Phawuloosa eeko, «Naati ne borshontto tizheez gabbara aazizayo, Xoossay nena baqqoda. Neenii taal afa higge garkk pirddodayis bettii higge menth tana baqqoday garkk kiittinee?» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:27-28">Mat. 23:27-28</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4"/>Phawuloosa kantta eqqeezitay eeko, «Ne Xooss qeese halaqa cazhinee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5"/>Phawuloosa, «Ta ishuntho, E qeese halaqa maaqqeeza ta erekkaya; abis giiko Xooss qaalayid, ‹Ne woya aqisizayil afa iita qaala odippe› ginttinttii xaafintteeza» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:28">Kes. 22:28</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6"/>Zin Phawuloosa ye aqayid yez asaypp baggitay Saduqaawita, baggitay Ferisaawita maaqqeezana erii, «Ta ishuntho, taanii Ferisaawennee Ferisaawe na7a; ‹yhayqqeezitay yhayiqopp dendoda› gi taanii ufayisar naagiza gishos unttii taal afa pirddiza» yeegii odeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 26:5">Haw. O. 26:5</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Filp. 3:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7"/>Phawuloosa yeya geez wode Ferisaawitay ganccennee Saduqaawitay gancce kachchii kezin shaakintteeza. <verse eid="ACT 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8"/>Abis giiko, Saduqaawitay, «Yhayqqeez as dendooya; kiitanchchoka ayyankka baaya» yeegiza. Zin Ferisaawitay ubbakka ammaniza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:23">Mat. 22:23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18">Mar. 12:18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27">Luq. 20:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9"/>Ola uufo keseeza; Ferisaawitay bagga maaqqeez higge asitamaaritay denddii eqqii, «Yha athayil afa aba buutakka dengeekkaya; ees ayyana woy kiitanchchay odo attenna» yeegii palameeza.<verse eid="ACT 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10"/>Kachchay mee7ith aykkin asay Phawuloosa shaqirchchaamaygarkk gi, shaalaqay fa wotaaddaritay wodhdhii unttan ganccepp eza ellisii kessii u fa yeza aqo kanggodaygarkk azazeeza.<verse eid="ACT 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11"/>Ye qamma Goday Phawuloosa kale eqqii, «Phawloosa, neenii taas Yerusalaame markkatteeza Oroomekka markkattodayis beeziza; minggoba; akko baaya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosana wodhodayis maqintteeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12"/>Wonttitha gallas Ayihuditay, «Phawuloosana wodhekazar katha maamii haath uzhaamii» gi caaqqeeza. <verse eid="ACT 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13"/>Phawuloosal afa yeya maaqqintteez asitay oytamapp gaame. <verse eid="ACT 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14"/>Unttii qeese halaqitaykonnee gade cimatayko yhanigii, «Nuunii Phawuloosa wodhekkazar katha gizibaz maamii gi caaqqeez. <verse eid="ACT 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15"/>Yikkee, yinttan shanggay ebaz geeshshii pilagodibaz yez aazisii, Phawuloosa yinttiko ko7oday garkk shalaqa oycoytta. Nuunii E yha shiiqo hellodaypp tiina eza wodhodayis giigii betteeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16"/>Zin Phawuloosa mishii na7ay ye maaqqintta si7ii yhanigii wotaaddaritay yeza aqo gelii, Phawuloosas odeeza. <verse eid="ACT 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17"/>Phawuloosa mato halaqitaypp petta xeegii, «Yha na7ay shaalaqayis odiza baz yeza gishos eza shalaqayko kanggoba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18"/>Mato halaqay na7a shaalaqayiko kanggii, «Achch kara yez Phawuloosa tana faako xeegii, yha na7ay nees odiza baz yez gishos eza neeko ko7oday garkk tana woosseeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 23:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19"/>Shaalaqay na7ay kushayid aykkii, duma bale kessii, «Neenii taas ododbazay abba?» yeegii oycceez.<verse eid="ACT 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20"/>Na7ay shaalaqayiko, «Ayihuditay Phawuloosa bagga kasepp miinthii pilagodayis koyeezi baz aazisii neenii wontta eza shiiqo ko7oday garkk nena woossodayis zore acceeza. <verse eid="ACT 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21"/>Zin neenii unttii gizibaz si7ippe. Abis giiko, oytamapp gaame asitay Phawuloosa wodhekkazar ‹Katha maamii, haathe uzhaamii› gi caaqqii, qosinttii eza naagiza. Yhatti ne gizibaz aadda si7odayis naagiza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22"/>Shaalaqay mahii, «Yhaya ne taas odeezana hara ooskka odippe» yeegii na7a guye dakkeeza.<verse eid="ACT 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosana Filkkiseko dakkeeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23"/>Shaalaqay mato halaqitaypp nam77ita xeegii, «Qammapp hayidzii saater Qisaare yhanigodayis, nam77ii xeet wotaaddarita, laappun tam para asitannee nam77ii xeet tooranchchita giigisoytta. <verse eid="ACT 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24"/>Gade aqisiza Filkkisako Phawuloosa saror helloday garkk toga mehita giigisoytta» yeegii u azazeeza. <verse eid="ACT 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25"/>Shaalaqay Filkkisas yhay garkk giz dabddaabbe xaafeeza:<verse eid="ACT 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26"/>«Qalawudoosa Lusosappe gade aqisiza bonchcho Filkkisas, saro nees maaqqo. <verse eid="ACT 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27"/>Ayihuditay yha atha aykkii wodhod hanodar, E Oroome gade as maaqqeezaya erii wotaaddaritayira hellii eza ashsheeza. <verse eid="ACT 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28"/>Ta Unttii eza abis mootizako erodayis koyii unttan u shanggitayiko eza shiisheeza. <verse eid="ACT 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29"/>Unttii fa higgayis eza mooteezaypp attin eza wodhisizabaz woy acisizibaz baza ta denggeeza. <verse eid="ACT 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30"/>Unttii yha athayil afa maaqqintteez zigirssay tana hellin, taanii ellisii eza neeko dakkeeza. Eza mootizitay ne tiina yhanigii mootoday garkk azazeeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 23:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31"/>Yey gishos, wotaaddarita azazeezay garkk Phawuloosa ekkii, qamma Antiphaxirisa helitheeza. <verse eid="ACT 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32"/>Wonttitha gallas paar asitay eza ekkii yhammaday garkk ashshii toke asitay guye maaqqeeza. <verse eid="ACT 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33"/>Togar yez asay Qisaare hellii dabddaabbe gade aqisizayis inggii, Phawuloosana e tiina shiisheeza. <verse eid="ACT 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34"/>Gade aqisizay dabddaabba nabbabeezaypp guye «Phawuloosa, ne aba awurajja aso?» gi eza oyiceeza. E Kilqa as maaqqeezaya erii <verse eid="ACT 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35"/>«Taanii nena mootizitay yi7iko ne giza si7oda» yeegeeza. Wotaaddaritay Phawuloosa Herodoosa zabba naaginttoday garkk azazeeza.<verse eid="ACT 23:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa ayihuditay mooteeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1"/>Ichchin gallasappe guye qeese halaqay Hananee, cimitayirannee Xerxeluusa giz pettii afakatayir wolla Qisaare qiteeza. Unttii gade aqisizayil afa Phawuloosana mooteeza. <verse eid="ACT 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2"/>Phawuloosa xeeginttii geleez wode Xerxeluusa eza yhay garkk yeegii mooteeza:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:2">«Bonchcho Filkkisa, nuunii ne baggar unddenna sarotith denggeeza, ne lo77o aqisayid nu biittay unddenna laamintteeza. <verse eid="ACT 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3"/>Bonchchintteez Filkkisa, nuunii abakka ayidekka maaqqin unddenna galatar yeya ekkoda. <verse eid="ACT 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4"/>Taanii nena gam7isekkazar neenii ne keehetithayir nubaz eller si7od garkk nena woosiza. <verse eid="ACT 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5"/>Yha athay dhube maaqqii gade ubbayid yez Ayihuditay gancce cabbo medhdhii Naazirawitay bagga asa kaalithiza maaqqeezana nu ereeza. <verse eid="ACT 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6"/>Hara attozin, Xooss Kara tunisod hanodar nu eza aykkeeza; nu higgay gizay garkk ezal afa pirddodayis qoppeeza. <verse eid="ACT 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7"/><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Payido 24:6 nu higgay gizaypp aykkii payido 24:7 gujjii yhanigii 24:8 bagga hellodayis yezay pettii pettii Girike maxaafitayid baaya.</char></note> Zini shalaqa Luusiyosa yi7ii, wolqqar nu kusheppe eza kessii ekkeeza. <verse eid="ACT 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8"/>Ezar mootinttizitaykka neeko ye7od garkk azazeeza. Neenii ne ommas yha atha pilagii nu eza mootiza moota ubba erodayis danda7iza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9"/>Ayihuditaykka, «Yha oday tuma» gi e qofa ma7eeza.<verse eid="ACT 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa mootayis mahith inggeeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10"/>Gade aqisizay Phawuloosa odod garkk mallin Phawuloosa yhay garkk yeegi maheeza: «Neenii unddenna wodepp aykkii, yha asayis pirddittar yezana erii taanii odayis ufayssar mahith ingiza. <verse eid="ACT 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11"/>Taanii goynnodayis Yerusalaame kezin taphpho nam7i gallasapp aadhoozana neenii ne ommas erodayis danda7iza. <verse eid="ACT 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12"/>Ayihuditay tana Xooss kara maaqqin Ayihude Woosa kara maaqqin katama maaqqin oorakka palamodar woy as shiishii saro dhabisodayis tobbodar pettii asikka tana denggekkaya. <verse eid="ACT 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13"/>Yhattekka unttii tana mootizabazayis markka denggodayis danda7ooya.<verse eid="ACT 24:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14"/>«Zini taanii pettibaz ammaniza; taanii higger yezabazinnee nabitay xaafeez ubba baz ammanii, nu aditay Xoossa, unttikka worddo giz ogayir ta goynniza. <verse eid="ACT 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15"/>Unttii fa aaddas ammanizay ta garkk xillitayinnee xillobaazitayikk yhayiqopp dendodana taakka ammaniza. <verse eid="ACT 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16"/>Yey gishos, taanii Xooss tiinannee as tiina ubba wode lo77o kaha taas yezoday garkk miinggiza.<verse eid="ACT 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17"/>«Taanii Yerusalaameppe kezeezaypp unddenna laythapp guye ta dabo manqqitayis maadee immadayisinnee yarshsho yarshshodayis Yerusalaame yhanigeeza. <verse eid="ACT 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18"/>Taanii Xooss kara yeya udii qasho woga polii maaqqin tana denggeeza. Ye wode taara gaame woya baaya, kachchikka kezekkaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:17-18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:17-28">Haw. O. 21:17-28</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19"/>Zini Iisapp ye7eez pettii pettii Ayihuditay ezayid yeza; unttii taal afa oda koykko yi7ii tana neell afa mootodayis danda7iza. <verse eid="ACT 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20"/>Woy taanii shanggo tiina shiiqeez wode ootheez buuta yeziko yhayititay ne tiina yezitay odo. <verse eid="ACT 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21"/>‹Taanii u gancce eqqii, yhayqqeezitay dendoda› gi uukkii odeez gishos yhayino yi tiina pirddas shiiqeeza, yeypp hara baz oothekkaya» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">Haw. O. 23:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22"/>Zini Filkkisa Goday ogay bagga geeshshii ereez gishos «Taanii yi oda gachcheeza» yeegii woda adusiseeza. <verse eid="ACT 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23"/>Mato halaqay Phawuloosana naagttar maaddod garkkennee e dabbitaypp oonkka oycodayis ye7odar kayaamay garkk mato halaqayis azazeeza.<verse eid="ACT 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Filkkisa tiinannee Dirusilla tiina shiiqeeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24"/>Xiqqa gallasapp guye, Filkkisa Ayihude bagga maaqqeez fa machchat Dirusillara yi7ii Phawuloosa kiittii ki7isii Kiristtoosa Yesuus ammano bagga eepp si7eeza. <verse eid="ACT 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25"/>Phawuloosa xillotithi bagga, fa ubba aqiso baggannee ye7odayis yez pirdda bagga ododar, Filkkisa yashittii, «Neenii yhattes qitoba taas giigeez wode nena xeegisoda» yeegeeza. <verse eid="ACT 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26"/>Ye wode Phawuloosapp gubbo ekkodayis qoppii eza mahii mahii xeegii erii odinttiza.<verse eid="ACT 24:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27"/>Nam77ii laythapp guye, Filkkisa aqana Phorqqiyoda Fisxoosa ekkeez. Filkkisa Ayihudita ufayssodayis kezii Phawuloosa billekka ashsheeza.<verse eid="ACT 24:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25"/>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Oroome Kaatayis aatho warqqate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1"/>Fisxoosa fa aqisiza awurajja gelii hayidzintho gallasapp guye Qisaarepp Yerusalaame kezeeza. <verse eid="ACT 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2"/>Ezayid qeese halaqitayinnee Ayihuditay bayiritay Phawuloosa mooteeza. <verse eid="ACT 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3"/>Phawuloosana Yerusalaame ko7or paas lo77o baz oothoday garkk gi Fisxoosana u woosseeza. Yeyakka geezay ogell qosinttii eza wodhodayis unttis giigoday garkke <verse eid="ACT 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4"/>Fisxoosa unttiko, «Phawuloosa, Qisaare achch kara yeza; taanii ta ubbaskka ellisii ged guye maaqqad haniza. <verse eid="ACT 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5"/>E buuteezbaz yezako yi gancce mawuter yezitay taar Qisaare yhanigii eza mooto» yeegii maheeza.<verse eid="ACT 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6"/>Fisxoosa u achcha hosppun woy taphphii gallas garkk gam7eezaypp guye Qisaare qiteeza. Wonttitha gallas pirdda oydel bettii Phawuloosa ko7oday garkk azazeeza. <verse eid="ACT 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7"/>E yi7in Yerusalaamepp ye7eez Ayihuditay e kalayid eqqii unttii lathodayis danda7oowa deexo mooto shiisheeza. <verse eid="ACT 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8"/>Phawuloosa mahii, «Taanii Ayihude higga maaqqin Xooss Kara woy Oroome Kaata Qeesarekka qohekkaya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 25:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9"/>Zin Fisxoosa Ayihudita ufayssodayis kezii Phawuloosako, «Yerusalaame yhanigii yha mootaybagga ezayid ta tiina pirddinttodayis koyinee?» yeegii oycceez.<verse eid="ACT 25:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10"/>Zin Phawuloosa, «Taanii pirddinttodayis beeziza Qeesare pirdde keetha eqqeeza. Neenii lo7ithii erizay garkk taanii Ayihudita abarakka qohekkaya. <verse eid="ACT 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11"/>Yikkee, taanii qoheezibaz yhayiqoskka helthiza baz buuta ootheezibaz maaqqiko yhayiqopp tana ashshoba gamii. Zin unttii tana mootiza mootay cere maaqqiko oonkka tana unttis aathii inggodayis danda7ooya. Qeesare tabaz pirddo gi oycciza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 25:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12"/>Ye wode Fisxoosa fa zoranchchitayira zorinttii, «Neenii Qeesare tabaz pirddoba gi oycceeza; Qeesareko yhanigiza» yeegii maheeza.<verse eid="ACT 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Agirpha tiinannee Barnniiqe tiina shiiqeeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13"/>Xiqqa gallasapp guye Kaatay Agirphannee Barnniiqe Fisxoosa sarothodayis Qisaare yhanigeeza. <verse eid="ACT 25:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14"/>Ezayid unttii unddenna gallas gam7in, Fisxoosa Kawayis Phawuloosa bagga yhay garkk yeegii odeeza; «Filkkisa billekka ashshii yhanigeez pettii athay yhaydda yeza. <verse eid="ACT 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15"/>Taanii Yerusalaame yhanigeez wode qeese halaqitayinnee Ayihude cimitay ezal afa pirddoday garkk tana woossii ebaz taas odeeza. <verse eid="ACT 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16"/>Taanii, ‹Mootinttiza athay tana mootizitay tiina eqqii fana mooteezbazayis mahith inggekkazin, oona maaqqikokka aadhii ingginttizay Oroome woga baaya› yeegii unttis maheeza.<verse eid="ACT 25:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17"/>«Yey gishos, unttii yhaydda shiiqeez wode taanii gam7ekka wonttitha gallas pirdde keeth gelii Phawuloosa ko7oday garkk kiiteeza. <verse eid="ACT 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18"/>Eza mootizitay e kanttar mari eqqii, iitabazar eza mootekka ashshenna gi taanii qoppeezay garkk eza mootekkaya. <verse eid="ACT 25:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19"/>Zin unttii fa ammano baggannee Phawuloosa, ‹E Path yeza› giz yhayqqeez Yesuusa ginttinttiz athay bagga ezar palamizaza. <verse eid="ACT 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20"/>Taakka yha oda shaakkodayis metitheez gishos Phawuloosa Yerusalaame yhanigii, ezayid pirddinttodayis koyizako gi eza oycceeza. <verse eid="ACT 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21"/>Zin Phawuloosa fa oda Qeesare billod hellodayis achch keetha gam7odayis oycceeza. Taanii eza Qeesareko dakkod hellodayis E acinttodaygarkk kiiteeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 25:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22"/>Yey gishos, Agirpha Fisxoosako, «Taanii ta ubbaskka ye athay gizibaz si7odayis koyiza» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 25:22">Fisxoosa eeko, «Neenii wontta E gizibaz si7oda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 25:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23"/>Wonttitha gallas Agirphannee Barnniqqe gita bonchchor shaalaqitayrannee katama yez wolqqama asitayir yi7ii pirdde keetha geleeza. Fisxoosa Phawuloosa xeegisii ke7eeza. <verse eid="ACT 25:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24"/>Fisxoosa, «Kaat Agirpha, yhaydda nuur yez asitayyo, Ayihuditay Yerusalaamekka yhaygarkk uukkii, ‹E yikkepp guye path yezodayis beezooya› yeegii, tana woosseez atha yhaya yi bi7iza. <verse eid="ACT 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25"/>Zin eza yhayiqos helthiza baz abikka taanii denggekkaya. E fa ommas, ‹Qeesare tabaz pirddo yeegii oyceeza› geez gishos Qeesareko eza dakkodayis qofa acceeza. <verse eid="ACT 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26"/>Taanii ebaz ta kaat Qeesaares xaafisiza oge abikka baaya. Yey gishos, ebaz yi bi7iko ta xaafizay benttodazako gi yi tiina ubbarakka Kaat, Agirpha, ne tiina eza ke7eeza. <verse eid="ACT 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27"/>Abis giiko, acintteez as dhoqqa daynnas aathitar E abis mootintteezako erisekkazar ashshizay taas boozetith aaziza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 25:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26"/>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Agirpha tiina inggeez mahith</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1"/>Agirpha Phawuloosako, «Neenii ne bagga ododayis danda7iza» yeegeeza. Ye wode Phawuloosa fa kushe denthii yhay garkk yeegeeza:<verse eid="ACT 26:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2"/>«Kaat, Agirpha, Ayihuditay tana mooteez baz ubbayis mahith inggodayis yhayino ne tiina eqqittar ta anjay lo77o gi qoppiza. <verse eid="ACT 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3"/>Yeykka neenii Ayihude wogannee palama ubba loythii eriza yeyi gishos tana danda7ar si7oday garkk ta nena woosiza.<verse eid="ACT 26:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4"/>«Taanii na7atithapp aykkii ta asay ganccerannee Yerusalaame yezeez ta yessa Ayihude ubbay eriza. <verse eid="ACT 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5"/>Taanii tiinapp aykkii, nu ammano wogga miinthii naagiza Ferisaawitay baggaypp maaqqeezana unttii markkattodayis koykko eriza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">Haw. O. 23:6</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Filp. 3:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6"/>Yhattekka taanii Xooss nu aditayis inggod geez ufayssa naagiza gishos mootinttii yhaydda eqqeeza. <verse eid="ACT 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7"/>Ma taphpho nam77ii nu aditay sheeshay Xoossa qammannee gallas miinthii goynnittar Xooss inggod geeza ekkodayis ufayisar naagiza. Kaat Agirpha, Ayihuditay tana mootizay taanii ufayisar yeya naagiza gishos. <verse eid="ACT 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8"/>Xooss yhayqqeezita denthizaya maaqqeezay yi kantta abis ammaninttoosa?<verse eid="ACT 26:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9"/>«Binii taanii ta ubbaskka Naazirete Yesuusa suntha ixxiza danda7intteezbaz ubba oothodayis beeziza gi qoppeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:9-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Haw. O. 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:4-5">22:4-5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10"/>Taanii Yerusalaame ootheezay yhaya. Qeese halaqitaypp mawute ekkii Xoossa asitaypp gaamita aciseeza. Unttan wodhodar u yhayqqodana ta doseeza. <verse eid="ACT 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11"/>Gaame wode Ayihude Woosa Keeth ubbayid unttii seerinttoday garkkennee Yesuusana cazhoday garkk ta woxiteeza. Taanii aqopp aathii unttan kacceeza hara attozin, hara biitta katamita hellodayis yhanigii ta unttan bayi7itheeza.<verse eid="ACT 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12"/>«Taanii yha odayis qeese halaqitapp mawutennee kiita ekkii Damasqqo yhanigiza. <verse eid="ACT 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13"/>Kaatayyo, taanii seeta gallas ogell yezin awa poo7opp lo7ithii aadhiz poo7o ta yuushayirannee taara yhanigizitay yuushayir salopp poo7odar be7eeza. <verse eid="ACT 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14"/>Nuunii ubbaykka sa7a pokkeezin Ibraysxe doonar, ‹Saa7oola, Saa7oola, tana abis bayithinnee? Neenii nena caddiza biraata qakkiko nena qohiza› yeegii taas ododar si7eeza.<verse eid="ACT 26:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15"/>«Taanii, ‹Godayyo, neenii oonoo?› yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 26:15">«Goday, ‹Taanii, neenii bayi7ithiz Yesuusa; <verse eid="ACT 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16"/>zin denddoba. Yhayino neenii be7eezayppennee tiinapp ta nena beezodana haras markkattoday garkk taas oosanchcho udii nena shuumodayis nees ta benttoda. <verse eid="ACT 26:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17"/>Isreele asitayppennee taanii nena unttiko kiittiza Ayihude baazitaypp nena ashshoda. <verse eid="ACT 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18"/>Neenii u aafa dooyoday, dhumapp poo7oko, Xalahe kushepp Xoossiko unttan mahoda. Unttii tana ammanii nagara atotith ekkoda. Xooss geeshsheez asay gancce fa laata denggoda› yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19"/>«Kaat Agirpha, yey gishos, taas salopp bentteez qonccithayis kiitintteeza. <verse eid="ACT 26:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20"/>Zin taanii tiinatii Damasqqo yezitay yeypp guye Yerusalaamennee Yihuda biita ubbitayid yezitayinnee Ayihude baazitaykka fa nagarapp Xoossiko maaqqoday garkkennee nagaraypp maaqqodayis beeziza ooso oothod garkk qaala odeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:20">Haw. O. 9:20</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 9:28-29">28-29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21"/>Yey gishos, Ayihuditay tana Xooss kara aykkii wodhodayis koyeeza. <verse eid="ACT 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22"/>Yhayino hellodayis Xooss maadee taapp shaakinttekkaya; yey gishos, xiqqitaysinnee dammitayis markkattittar yhaydda eqqeeza. Nabittaynnee Muse hanoda gi odeezaypp hara pettibazikka taanii odeezibaz baaya. <verse eid="ACT 26:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23"/>Yeykka, ‹Kiristtoosa waaye ekkodayis beeziza; ma yhayiqopp tiina denddii Ayihuditayisinnee Ayihude baazitayis poo7o beezodayis ees beeziza› geeza» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:20">1 Qor. 15:20</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:6">Isa. 42:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:6">49:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 26:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24"/>Phawuloosa yeya yeegii mahodar, Fisxoosa fa qaala dhoqq udii, «Phawloosa, ne eeyeeza; ne gaame timirttay nena eeyisoss heltheeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 26:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25"/>Zin Phawuloosa, «Bonchcho Fisxoosa, taanii tumabazinnee beeziza baz odizapp attin eeyekkaya. <verse eid="ACT 26:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26"/>Taanii qoncce odiza oda Kaatay eriza. Yha oday geema oosinttekka gishos pettakka eepp qosinttii attamaya taanii lo7ithii eriza.<verse eid="ACT 26:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27"/>«Kaat Agirpha, neenii nabita ammaninnee? Neenii unttan ammanizana taanii eriza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 26:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28"/>Kaatay Agirpha, Phawuloosako, «Yha xiqqa saatayid tana Kiristaanee mahodayis koyinee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 26:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29"/>Phawuloosa, «Gaame wode maaqqin xiqqa wode ne aadda baazin yhayino ta oda si7iz ubbay yha achchaypp attin ta garkk maaqqoday garkk ta Xooss woosiza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 26:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30"/>Yeypp guye, Kaat Agriphpha, gade aqisiz Fisxoosa, Barnniqennee unttar betteez ubbitaykka denddeeza. <verse eid="ACT 26:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31"/>Yeypp kezii yhanigttar pettay pettayir, «Yha athay yhayqqos woy achchis helthiza baz akkokka oothekkaya» yeegii odintteeza. <verse eid="ACT 26:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32"/>Agirpha Fisxoosako, «Yha athay ‹Qeesare tabaz pirddo› geekazako bilinttodayis danda7izazin atteeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 26:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27"/>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Oroome qiteeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1"/>Nuunii markkaber Ixaale dakkodayis u murtteez wode kaatitay kaat wotaaddarita ginttinttizitaypp pettii Yuuliyoosa giz mato halaqayis Phawuloosannee hara xiqqa achch asita inggeeza. <verse eid="ACT 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2"/>Iisa lanqqe yez heerita yhanigodar Adiramixoosa markkabe gelii denddeeza. Maqadoona as maaqqeez Teselonqqe Arsxirokoosa nuur yeza.<verse eid="ACT 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3"/>Wonttitha gallas nuunii Sidoona hellodar, Yuuloosa Phawuloosas qadhinttii fa laggitayko yhanigii koshshiza baz maadinttoday garkk unttiko dakkeeza. <verse eid="ACT 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4"/>Yeypp denddii nu tiinar carkkiza gishos haathar teqintteez biitta, Qoophiroosar miyithii aadheeza. <verse eid="ACT 27:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5"/>Kilqqannee Phinfila yez abba piinggii Luqa yez Muura helleeza. <verse eid="ACT 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6"/>Ezayid mato halaqay Ixaale yhanigiz Iskkinddire markkabe denggii, ize nuna geliseeza.<verse eid="ACT 27:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7"/>Nuunii gaame gallas loddera yhanigii, gaame un7ar Qanddoosa katama kale helleeza. Ezayir yhanigodayis nuna carkko kayin Salmoonar aadhii haathar teqintteez biitta, Qarxeesa miyithii aadheeza. <verse eid="ACT 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8"/>Gaame metor gaxa gaxa aykkii Laasa katamas ukke yez lo77o ginttinttiz markkabe shemppiza heera kezeeza.<verse eid="ACT 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9"/>Nuunii ezayid unddenna wode gam7eezaypp guye xooma wode aadheez gisho, markkaber yhamo metiza gishos Phawuloosa unttan zoreeza. <verse eid="ACT 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10"/>«Yinttanno asitayyo, nu yhamay gita dhabonnee gaame qoho yezay taas benttiza; qohay caanal afannee markkabel afa aadda baazin nu shemppayil afakka helloda» yeegeeza. <verse eid="ACT 27:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11"/>Zin mato halaqay Phawuloosa geezaypp aathii markkaba laaggizayinnee markkaba goday giza ammaneeza. <verse eid="ACT 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12"/>Ye abba doonar yez katamay balggo agina aathodayis unttis giigekka gishos gaame asitay paas danda7inttiko Finqqe katama hellii balggo agina ezayid aathodayis zorintteeza. Finqqe awa gelos pude baggappennee awa gelopp sulle baggas gancce abba kantta yez markkabe eqqii caan wodhisiz aqo.<verse eid="ACT 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abbal afa gote dendeeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13"/>Kawushsha sulle carkko loddar carkkeez wode fa qoppeezay garkk haneezibaz aazin denddii, markkabe eni7aamay garkk aykkiz biraata udee ekkii Qarxeesa kanttar aadheeza. <verse eid="ACT 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14"/>Zin gaame gam7ekkazar «Awuraqisa» giz wolqqama gote haathar teqintteez biittapp sulle unttal afa dendeeza. <verse eid="ACT 27:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15"/>Ye gotay markkaba urqqii yhamo kayeez gishos carkkay markkabay fa doseez oge kanggoday garkk ashshii ashsheeza.<verse eid="ACT 27:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16"/>Nuunii Qeeda giz haathar teqintteez biitta miyithi yhanigttar gaame metinttii markkabitt wogolito aykkii ashshodayis danda7eeza. <verse eid="ACT 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17"/>Unttii wogola pude kesseezaypp guye wodoror markkabayil afa xaaxii, miinthii acceeza. Sirtiisa giz shafel domi7inttoda gi hirgii, markkabe shaara wothii markkabay cere laaginttod garkk dakkii ashsheeza.<verse eid="ACT 27:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18"/>Gotay wolqqamittar yhanigin wonttitha gallas caanaypp bagga abba gancce olo aykkeeza. <verse eid="ACT 27:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19"/>Hayidzintho gallas markkabe miishe ekkii nu kushayir dhugeeza. <verse eid="ACT 27:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20"/>Nuunii gaame gallas awannee xoolintto be7ekkazay gishonnee wolqqama carkko nuul afa minggeez gishos tiinapp shemppor attoda gi qoppekkaya.<verse eid="ACT 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21"/>Ye wode unttii unddenna gallas katha meekka gam7eez gishos Phawuloosa u gancce denddii eqqii, «Asitayyo, yi ta zora ekkii Qarxeesepp denddekkazako yha metaynnee qohay nuna hellaamizin. <verse eid="ACT 27:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22"/>Zin taanii yinttan yashittippate gi zoriza; abis giiko, yha markkabay dhabodaypp attin yinttipp pettii as shemppokka dhabenna. <verse eid="ACT 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23"/>Zin qamma ta ebaz maaqqeezayinnee ta goynniza Xoossay kiitteez kiitanchchay ta kale eqqii, <verse eid="ACT 27:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24"/>‹Phawuloosa, yashittippe; neenii Oroome Kaatay Qeesare tiina eqqodayis beeziza. Yeezako Xooss ne gishos neer yhanigizita nees inggeeza› yeegeeza. <verse eid="ACT 27:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25"/>Yey gishos, asitayyo, yashitippate. Ye kiitanchchay taas odeezay hanodana taanii Xoossal ammaninttiza. <verse eid="ACT 27:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26"/>Zin carkko nuna kanggii pettii haathar teqintteez biitta gaxa oloda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27"/>Taphpho oyddantho qamma Adira Abba nuna carkkay gedennee yhana urqqodar, gidii bilahe maaqqeez wode markkabe oothizitayis biittako ukkeeza aazeeza. <verse eid="ACT 27:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28"/>Unttii ciimmotitha erodayis koyii wodoro xeera deexizabaz accii abba gancce olin, abbay hosppun tam yhadha maaqqeeza. Xiqqa gam7ii, mahii olin usuppuntam yhadha maaqqeeza. <verse eid="ACT 27:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29"/>Unttii abba gaxa yez shuchchar domi7nttamay garkk yashittii, markkabay yhanggaamay garkk aykkiz oyddii biraatita markkabaypp guyer abba olii, sa7a wonttoday garkk Xooss woossiza. <verse eid="ACT 27:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30"/>Markkabel oothizitay markkabaypp woxxii kezii, markkabay yhanggaamay garkk aykkiz biraatita markkabaypp tiina baggar abba oliza aazin wogola abba gancce oleeza. <verse eid="ACT 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31"/>Phawuloosa mato halaqaykonnee wotaaddaritayiko, «Yeyititay markkabayid shemppii bettam ixxiko yi attodayis danda7oowa» yeegeeza. <verse eid="ACT 27:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32"/>Yey gishos, wotaaddaritay wogolay accintteeza wodora gachchii dakkii ashsheeza.<verse eid="ACT 27:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33"/>Sa7a wonttod hanodar ubbitay kath maaday garkk Phawuloosa asayiko, «Yi katha meekka naagttar yhayinor taphpho oyddii gallas gam7eeza. <verse eid="ACT 27:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34"/>Yey gishos, xiqqa katha yi maaday garkk ta yinttan woosiza. Yinttis lo77o maaqqada; hara attozin yi omma binanaypp pettakka dhabaamii» yeegeeza. <verse eid="ACT 27:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35"/>Phawuloosa yeya gi boora ekkii ubbay tiina Xooss galateeza; baxxii muntta aykkeeza. <verse eid="ACT 27:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36"/>Ubbay miinggii fa ubbas katha ekkii meeza. <verse eid="ACT 27:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37"/>Nuunii markkabayid yezitay nam77ii xeetannee laappun tam usuppun. <verse eid="ACT 27:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38"/>Unttii mi mizheez wode caaneez gistta abba gancce olii markkabay deexa shawukiseeza.<verse eid="ACT 27:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Markkabat meqqeeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39"/>Sa7a wonttin markkaba oosanchchitay aba helleezako erekkazar, abba gaxa yez shafennee silima be7eeza. Paas danda7inttiko markkaba ye silimayiko shiishodayis qoppeeza. <verse eid="ACT 27:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40"/>Yeezii, markkabay yhanggaamay garkk aykkiz biraatita bili7i abba gancce oleeza. Ye wode laaggiza mitha acciz wodora bili7eeza. Yeypp guye, carkkay markkaba tiina urqqoday garkk markkaba kanggiza shaara tiina baggar dhoqqi udii yhamo aykkeeza. <verse eid="ACT 27:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41"/>Zin markkabay shafe dethar domi7inttii mitintteeza. Markkabayis tiina baggay mooginttii eni7aam ixxin, guye baggay zulo urqqithaypp dendii meqito aykkeeza.<verse eid="ACT 27:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42"/>Wotaaddaritay achch asaypp pettakka haatha yhadhdhii kezaamay garkk unttan wodhodayis tobbeeza. <verse eid="ACT 27:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43"/>Zin mato halaqay Phawuloosa ashshodayis qopp wotaaddaritay tobba ixeeza. Haathe yhadho eriza ubbay markkabaypp haathayid doonggii doonggii wodhdhii tiinatii gaxa kezoday garkk azazeeza. <verse eid="ACT 27:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44"/>Atteezitay sanqqal afannee, markkabe meqayil afa kezoday garkk azazeeza ubbay gaxa saror kezeeza.<verse eid="ACT 27:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28"/>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Malaxa giz haathar marintteez biitta qiteeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1"/>Nuunii gaxa saro kezeez wode helleez haathar teqintteez biittay Malaxa ginttinttizana ereeza. <verse eid="ACT 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2"/>Malaxa asay nuna qadhdhii ufayssar ekkeeza. Ira bukkiza gishonnee meeggiza gishos tama eethii nuna ubba mokkeeza. <verse eid="ACT 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3"/>Phawuloosa gaame afira shiishii tama gaddodar, shooshii tamay michcheez gishos kezii e kushayil afa xaaxinttii eza dukkeeza. <verse eid="ACT 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4"/>Malaxa asay shooshii Phawuloosa kushayil xaaxintteeza bi7ii pettay pettayiko, «Tuma yha athay shemppo wodhdheez as; hara attozin abbapp E attinikka Xoossa pirddayppe attii path yezodayis danda7ekka» yeegeeza. <verse eid="ACT 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5"/>Zin Phawuloosa fa kushaypp shoosha wuxarkkii, tama oleeza; eza akkokka qohekka. <verse eid="ACT 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6"/>Unttii, «E asetithay ayidepp ayide, eelliza woy pokkii yhayqqiza» gi naagiza. Zin unddenna wode naageezin e asetithayil abikka laamintteezbaz dhabin, «Yhay tuma Xoosse» yeegii fa qofa laammeeza. <verse eid="ACT 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7"/>Ye heera haathar teqintteez biittayis halaqa, Puploosa gizayis gade yeza; hayidzii gallas hellodayis e nuna siiqor mokkeeza. <verse eid="ACT 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8"/>Puploosa aday oxe, misharannee gusor hargginttii woyi7ii yeza. Phawuloosa e kara gelii ees Xoossa woosseeza; fa kusha ezalli afa gaddii patheeza. <verse eid="ACT 28:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9"/>Yeypp guye, Malaxa yez hargginttiza hara asitayikka yi7ii paxeeza. <verse eid="ACT 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10"/>Unttii nuna gaame bonchcheeza; nuunii markkaber yhanigodayis denddeez wode oges beeziza baz nuus inggeeza.<verse eid="ACT 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Malaxapp Oroome qiteeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11"/>Hayidzii aginapp guye, Malaxa balggo aathii Iskkinddire markkaber yhammadayis denddeeza. Ye markkabayil afa Diyosqoroosa giz mentte eeqitay misile yeza. <verse eid="ACT 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12"/>Sirakuuse katama gelii ezayid hayidzii gallas betteeza. <verse eid="ACT 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13"/>Yeypp denddii Regiyume katama helleeza. Pettii gallasapp guye, sulle bagga carkkay carkkin, wonttitha gallas Putiyoole katama helleeza. <verse eid="ACT 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14"/>Ezayid nuunii pettii pettii ammaniza asita denggin, paar saamintta gam7od garkk nuna woosseeza. Yeypp guye, Oroome yhanigeeza.<verse eid="ACT 28:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15"/>Oroome yez ammaniza asitay nu bagga si7ii, Afoosa Farusinannee, Hayidzii Aqiza aqo giz aqo hellodayis nuna mokkodayis ye7eeza. Phawuloosa unttan bi7ii Xoossa galateeza e wozinaykka miinggeeza.<verse eid="ACT 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Oroome</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16"/>Nuunii Oroome geleez wode Phawuloosa fana naagiza wotaaddaritayir fa aaddas bettod garkk ginttintteeza.<verse eid="ACT 28:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17"/>Hayidzii gallasapp guye, Phawuloosa Ayihuditay halaqita faako xeegiseeza. Unttii shiiqeez wode unttiko, «Ta ishuntho, taanii nu asay woy nu aditay wogal afa aba qohokka oothekkaya, zin tana Yerusalaame accii Oroome asayis aathii inggeeza. <verse eid="ACT 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18"/>Unttii ta moota bi7ii yhayiqos helithiza baz taal afa abikka denggekka gishos tana bili7odayis qoppeeza. <verse eid="ACT 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19"/>Zin Ayihuditay yeya ixxin ‹Tabaz Qeesare pirddo› yeegeezapp attin taanii ta gadita mootizabaz yezin baaya. <verse eid="ACT 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20"/>Taanii yinttan xeegiseezay yinttan be7adayisinnee yinttis yhaya ododadayisii. Taanii yha santhalatayir acintteezay Isreele asay naagiza ufayssay gishoss» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 25:11">Haw. O. 25:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 28:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21"/>Ayihude halaqitay Phawuloosako, «Nuus Yihudapp nees xaafintteez dabddaabbe hellekkay. Yeypp ye7eez asitaypp pettakka nees iita odeezay baaya. <verse eid="ACT 28:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22"/>Zin yha ne kaalliza ammana duma duma aqo asay ixxizana nuunii eriza gishos ne qofa si7odayis koyiza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 28:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23"/>Unttii fa ye7od gallas Phawuloosas qamma ekkii, ye gallas gaanggii e yeza aqo ye7eeza. E wonttapp omath hellodayis Xooss kaatetithii bagga unttis markkatteeza. Ma unttii Yesuusa bagga ammanoday garkk Muse higgennee nabitay maxaafita lo7ithii tamaareeza. <verse eid="ACT 28:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24"/>Pettay pettay Phawuloosa geezana ammaneeza, zin yhankkitay ammanekkaya. <verse eid="ACT 28:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25"/>Unttii woli gancce odayil ma77aam ixxeezaypp Phawuloosa pettibaz geezaypp guye yhanigeeza. E yhay garkk yeegeeza: «Geeshsha Ayyanay nu aditayis nabe Isiyaasa doonar odeezay tuma.<verse eid="ACT 28:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26"/>«‹Neenii yha asayiko yhanigii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:26">yi sis si7iza, zin akaakooya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">Yi be7o bi7iza, zin denggooya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:26-27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Isa. 6:9-10</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 28:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27"/>Yha asay wozinay muumeeza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">u hayay tuleeza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">u aafaykka goozntteeza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Yey baazako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">unttii fa aafayir bi7ii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">fa hayayir si7ii, fa wozinayir akaakii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">taako maaqqodazin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">taakka unttan pathodazin› yeegoba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 28:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28"/>«Yikkee, yhay Xooss atotith kiitay Ayihude baazitayis maaqqeezana eriza. Unttikka si7oda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ACT 28:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29"/>Phawuloosa yeya geezaypp guye Ayihuditay woli gancce daro palamittar kezii qiteeza.<verse eid="ACT 28:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30"/>Phawuloosa kera keetha nam77ii laythi muda betteeza; ezayid yezar faako ye7eezita ubba mokkiza. <verse eid="ACT 28:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31"/>Yashsha baythinnee ookka kayekkazin Xooss kaatetithibaz sabbakeeza; Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa bagga milxi udii taamarsseeza.<verse eid="ACT 28:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28"/>
</usx>
